valid YAML string, and Obsidian still parses both\nwiki-links from the string when scanning for note links.\n\nChanges: 95 lesson files in FrontendCourse + a couple of plan/spec docs.\nPattern: ''связано: [[A]], [[B]]'' → ''связано: \"[[A]], [[B]]\"''\n\nEmpty ''связано:'' values left untouched (already valid YAML).","tree":{"sha":"3a8fe9e4940edd25ec553bda716310ae194c23a6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/6Methods/FrontendCourse/git/trees/3a8fe9e4940edd25ec553bda716310ae194c23a6"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/6Methods/FrontendCourse/git/commits/c7430a21f7162b1ccf27f0b56a41744dec430035","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/109748251?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/6Methods/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/6Methods/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/6Methods/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/6Methods/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/6Methods","id":109748251,"login":"6Methods","node_id":"U_kgDOBoqgGw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/6Methods/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/6Methods/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/6Methods/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/6Methods/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/6Methods/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/6Methods","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/6Methods/FrontendCourse/commit/c7430a21f7162b1ccf27f0b56a41744dec430035","node_id":"C_kwDOSG3CYNoAKGM3NDMwYTIxZjcxNjJiMWNjZjI3ZjBiNTZhNDE3NDRkZWM0MzAwMzU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/6Methods/FrontendCourse/commit/37e19db4d34a410c88df87f43ce71a78832ff67a","sha":"37e19db4d34a410c88df87f43ce71a78832ff67a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/6Methods/FrontendCourse/commits/37e19db4d34a410c88df87f43ce71a78832ff67a"}],"sha":"c7430a21f7162b1ccf27f0b56a41744dec430035","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/6Methods/FrontendCourse/commits/c7430a21f7162b1ccf27f0b56a41744dec430035"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/109748251?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/6Methods/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/6Methods/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/6Methods/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/6Methods/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/6Methods","id":109748251,"login":"6Methods","node_id":"U_kgDOBoqgGw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/6Methods/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/6Methods/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/6Methods/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/6Methods/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/6Methods/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/6Methods","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/6Methods/FrontendCourse/commits/37e19db4d34a410c88df87f43ce71a78832ff67a/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-26T23:41:30Z","email":"ivan.mol.10@mail.ru","name":"6Methods"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-26T23:41:30Z","email":"ivan.mol.10@mail.ru","name":"6Methods"},"message":"style: humanize all course content (modules 02-14, projects, MOCs, appendix)\n\nApplied humanizer skill across all remaining course materials. Worked\nin 4 parallel waves with sub-agents, one module per agent:\n\n- Modules 02-05 (HTML, CSS-база, CSS-продвинутый, JS-база)\n- Modules 06-09 (JS-продвинутый, Веб-архитектура, Git-DevTools, React-база)\n- Modules 10-13 (React-экосистема, TypeScript, Build-tools, Next.js)\n- Module 14 + mini-projects (M02-M13) + projects (P1, P3) + MOCs + Алгоритмы\n\nPatterns reduced across all files:\n- Em-dash density ~50% reduction; replaced with periods/commas/colons\n  where punctuation pause didn''t help\n- Mechanical bold-prefix lists (- **X** — Y) converted to flowing prose;\n  bold kept only for first-mention key terms\n- Rule-of-three groupings broken into 2 or 4 items, or rewritten as prose\n- \"Не просто X — Y\" negative parallelisms replaced with direct statements\n- Significance inflation removed (\"ключевой\", \"играет важную роль\",\n  \"в современном мире\", \"является фундаментом\")\n- Signposting cut (\"В этом уроке рассмотрим\", \"Давайте разберём\")\n- Copula avoidance fixed: \"является\" / \"представляет собой\" → \"это\"\n- Hedges removed (\"стоит отметить\", \"важно понимать\")\n- Trailing participle additions cut (\"обеспечивая\", \"подчёркивая\")\n- Sentence rhythm varied\n\nPreserved: YAML frontmatter, all code blocks, wiki-links [[...]], 6-section\nlesson structure, technical accuracy, fact tables, task checklists,\n\"Котёнок\" voice, P1''s GitHub Pages deploy section, React forward-references\nin module 05 with explicit \"модуль 09\" disclaimers.","tree":{"sha":"a078eff8410354fcbc8d31b464adda37cb0a353c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/6Methods/FrontendCourse/git/trees/a078eff8410354fcbc8d31b464adda37cb0a353c"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/6Methods/FrontendCourse/git/commits/37e19db4d34a410c88df87f43ce71a78832ff67a","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/109748251?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/6Methods/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/6Methods/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/6Methods/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/6Methods/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/6Methods","id":109748251,"login":"6Methods","node_id":"U_kgDOBoqgGw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/6Methods/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/6Methods/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/6Methods/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/6Methods/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/6Methods/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/6Methods","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/6Methods/FrontendCourse/commit/37e19db4d34a410c88df87f43ce71a78832ff67a","node_id":"C_kwDOSG3CYNoAKDM3ZTE5ZGI0ZDM0YTQxMGM4OGRmODdmNDNjZTcxYTc4ODMyZmY2N2E","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/6Methods/FrontendCourse/commit/a158b2a0f410d11e968f457fc6e50b2dfec6a6d9","sha":"a158b2a0f410d11e968f457fc6e50b2dfec6a6d9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/6Methods/FrontendCourse/commits/a158b2a0f410d11e968f457fc6e50b2dfec6a6d9"}],"sha":"37e19db4d34a410c88df87f43ce71a78832ff67a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/6Methods/FrontendCourse/commits/37e19db4d34a410c88df87f43ce71a78832ff67a"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/109748251?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/6Methods/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/6Methods/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/6Methods/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/6Methods/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/6Methods","id":109748251,"login":"6Methods","node_id":"U_kgDOBoqgGw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/6Methods/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/6Methods/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/6Methods/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/6Methods/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/6Methods/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/6Methods","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/6Methods/FrontendCourse/commits/a158b2a0f410d11e968f457fc6e50b2dfec6a6d9/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-26T23:01:53Z","email":"ivan.mol.10@mail.ru","name":"6Methods"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-26T23:01:53Z","email":"ivan.mol.10@mail.ru","name":"6Methods"},"message":"style: humanize new lessons (modules 00 and 01.1/01.4/01.5)\n\nApplied humanizer skill (Wikipedia \"Signs of AI writing\" patterns):\n\n- Reduced em-dash density ~60-70% — kept only where punctuation pause\n  genuinely improves readability; replaced others with periods, commas,\n  parentheses\n- Killed mechanical bold-prefix lists (**заголовок** — описание) where\n  they were stylistic noise; converted to flowing prose\n- Replaced rigid \"Шаг 1 / Шаг 2 / Шаг 3\" scaffolding with topic-based\n  subheadings\n- Varied sentence rhythm; broke up rule-of-three patterns\n- Removed significance inflation (\"полный маршрут от пикселей в Figma\n  до пикселей в браузере\") and signposting (\"В этом уроке —\")\n- Fewer \"не просто X — Y\" negative parallelisms\n- Kept tables (factual mappings, not stylistic), course template\n  structure, and \"Котёнок\" voice — these are intentional\n\nFiles: 00-Установка/{00,00.1,00.2,00.3} + 01-Setup/{01.1,01.4,01.5}","tree":{"sha":"f39e00015ee658cbecf02b5ea6b42d63be51c653","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/6Methods/FrontendCourse/git/trees/f39e00015ee658cbecf02b5ea6b42d63be51c653"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/6Methods/FrontendCourse/git/commits/a158b2a0f410d11e968f457fc6e50b2dfec6a6d9","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/109748251?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/6Methods/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/6Methods/followers","follow