t с ссылками на A1.1.6\n  (rendering overlay) и A1.3.5 (memory snapshots) — тот же инструмент,\n  но JS-ракурс здесь, rendering и memory — в Track 1.\n- A3.5 Testing и A4.5 Observability получили взаимные scope-callouts:\n  тесты = pre-prod синтетика, observability = prod-видимость реальных\n  событий. Error tracking (Sentry) живёт в A4.5.4 и не дублируется.\n\nФорма уроков не затронута.","tree":{"sha":"1bb0bd34d7f3675e0d2b16ef975e9f1614146737","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/6Methods/FrontendCourse/git/trees/1bb0bd34d7f3675e0d2b16ef975e9f1614146737"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/6Methods/FrontendCourse/git/commits/b1230a3c58591abf6a2c9c585894d2c00160a291","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/109748251?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/6Methods/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/6Methods/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/6Methods/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/6Methods/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/6Methods","id":109748251,"login":"6Methods","node_id":"U_kgDOBoqgGw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/6Methods/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/6Methods/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/6Methods/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/6Methods/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/6Methods/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/6Methods","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/6Methods/FrontendCourse/commit/b1230a3c58591abf6a2c9c585894d2c00160a291","node_id":"C_kwDOSG3CYNoAKGIxMjMwYTNjNTg1OTFhYmY2YTJjOWM1ODU4OTRkMmMwMDE2MGEyOTE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/6Methods/FrontendCourse/commit/ce8aad5448ef2fa18a