r}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/6Methods/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/6Methods","id":109748251,"login":"6Methods","node_id":"U_kgDOBoqgGw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/6Methods/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/6Methods/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/6Methods/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/6Methods/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/6Methods/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/6Methods","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/6Methods/FrontendCourse/commits/d6c66caebe7e39402a12503c5067ce4143ebf0a9/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-20T13:37:34Z","email":"ivan.mol.10@mail.ru","name":"6Methods"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-20T13:37:34Z","email":"ivan.mol.10@mail.ru","name":"6Methods"},"message":"feat: add FrontendAdvanced course — 6 tracks, 28 modules, 137 lessons\n\nПродвинутый курс для middle+/senior React+TS. Слой поверх базового\nFrontendObsidianCourse: Browser/V8 internals, TS type-level, FSD,\nmonorepo, legacy, testing, a11y, Docker, self-hosting, SQL, OTel,\nweb security, алгоритмы с применением, tech writing, OSS, менторинг.\n\n- Track 1 Deep Frontend (A1.1–A1.4)\n- Track 2 TypeScript Mastery (A2.1–A2.3)\n- Track 3 Архитектура и масштаб (A3.1–A3.6)\n- Track 4 Инфра, DevOps, SQL (A4.1–A4.6)\n- Track 5 Алгоритмы (A5.1–A5.5)\n- Track 6 Команда и культура (A6.1–A6.4)\n\n6 MOC-карт, 4 практических проекта (A-P1…A-P4), Start-Here с\nпараллельными дорожками A5/A6 и advanced-метками. Планы и дизайн-\nспек в docs/superpowers/.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"678dc196281805c29057f6db8723fdc1a59e4afb","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/6Methods/FrontendCourse/git/trees/678dc196281805c29057f6db8723fdc1a59e4afb"},"url":"https://api.github.com/