, add SHAP explainability logging to MLflow\n- retrain.py, sweep.py: import model_utils (eliminate duplication)\n- eda_dashboard.py, predict.py: import feature_utils (eliminate duplication)\n- predict.py: add POST /feedback endpoint for ground-truth label collection\n- fetch.py: encrypt comment_text on write; pseudo_label.py, compute_embedding_drift.py: decrypt on read\n- alerts.yml: add HighInferenceLatency (p99>200ms), EmbeddingDrift (<0.80), LowPredictionConfidence (<0.75)\n- ci.yml: expand to lint (ruff) + unit tests + docker build + smoke train jobs\n- dvc.yaml + params.yaml: define reproducible ML pipeline stages\n- .gitattributes: Git LFS for *.pkl, *.pt, *.bin, *.db, *.safetensors\n- docker-compose.yml: Grafana password via env var\n- requirements.txt: add shap, cryptography, scipy, plotly, ruff\n- tests/: fix imports after refactor; mock googleapiclient for local runs","tree":{"sha":"a8a3dc0108dcafe23cdb12e70eeb02ea05f977d4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/n0xet3rnal/toxcity_classifier/git/trees/a8a3dc0108dcafe23cdb12e70eeb02ea05f977d4"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/n0xet3rnal/toxcity_classifier/git/commits/866102ab9af58de58f49d4d1b292537ae451c028","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/123719576?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/n0xet3rnal/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/n0xet3rnal/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/n0xet3rnal/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/n0xet3rnal/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/n0xet3rnal","id":123719576,"login":"n0xet3rnal","node_id":"U_kgDOB1_PmA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/n0xet3rnal/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/n0xet3rnal/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/n0xet3rnal/repos","site_