/commits/82dc7778a334b006ad5e9513efa16ccaa8996078"}],"sha":"f2bd216e7335247ca13e36299ae769fca830b895","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/efureev/unocss-preset-granular/commits/f2bd216e7335247ca13e36299ae769fca830b895"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/efureev/unocss-preset-granular/commits/82dc7778a334b006ad5e9513efa16ccaa8996078/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-04T11:15:21Z","email":"fureev@gmail.com","name":"fureev"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-04T11:15:21Z","email":"fureev@gmail.com","name":"fureev"},"message":"feat: add includeExtraRules","tree":{"sha":"15cd01a7cbf3252808de3b1107d2b1d3716c0a15","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/efureev/unocss-preset-granular/git/trees/15cd01a7cbf3252808de3b1107d2b1d3716c0a15"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/efureev/unocss-preset-granular/git/commits/82dc7778a334b006ad5e9513efa16ccaa8996078","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/efureev/unocss-preset-granular/commit/82dc7778a334b006ad5e9513efa16ccaa8996078","node_id":"C_kwDOSHDghtoAKDgyZGM3Nzc4YTMzNGIwMDZhZDVlOTUxM2VmYTE2Y2NhYTg5OTYwNzg","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/efureev/unocss-preset-granular/commit/e589483de646132a8e901de5bc3f102e4be039b4","sha":"e589483de646132a8e901de5bc3f102e4be039b4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/efureev/unocss-preset-granular/commits/e589483de646132a8e901de5bc3f102e4be039b4"}],"sha":"82dc7778a334b006ad5e9513efa16ccaa8996078","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/efureev/unocss-preset-granular/commits/82dc7778a334b006ad5e9513efa16ccaa8996078"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/efureev/unocss-preset-granular/commits/e589483de646132a8e901de5bc3f102e4be039b4/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-03T16:19:40Z","email":"fureev@gmail.com","name":"fureev"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-03T16:19:40Z","email":"fureev@gmail.com","name":"fureev"},"message":"feat(vite): add granularCssAssetsPlugin for declared CSS assets\n\nA `tokenDefinitionsRef` (or `cssFiles`) written as a plain string is data the\nbundler knows nothing about, so the file never reaches `dist` and the reference\ndangles in the published package — the consumer gets a bare ENOENT. The only\nworking alternative was the `new URL(..., import.meta.url)` literal, which the\nbundler inlines as a `data:text/css;base64` string; since `tokenDefinitionsRef`\nmade component configs shared between the browser and node entries, that base64\nnow travels into the consumer''s client bundle too.\n\nThe plugin makes the string form whole: it builds its plan from the descriptors\nthemselves and copies each source to exactly the `assetName` the `define*`\nhelper recorded, so it cannot drift from the contract. `cssFiles` are covered\nsymmetrically. A missing source fails the build (`GranularCssAssetError`);\n`data:` refs are skipped, while refs that have no `assetName` at all are\nreported instead of silently dropped.\n\nNarrow `GranularComponentDescriptor.tokenDefinitionsRef` to\n`GranularThemeTokenRef` (no `| string`): the descriptor is the output of\n`defineGranularComponent`, which already normalised the string. The union stays\non the options type (input) and on `GranularThemeContribution`, where\n`defineGranularProvider` is an identity function and normalises nothing. This\nis a type-level breaking change only for hand-written descriptors that used the\nstring form — those never had an `assetName` and could not work anyway.\n\nCI gains an end-to-end contract gate and the quality steps the preset lacked:\n\n- `verify-contract` runs `build:all` + `verify:apps`, and both publish jobs now\n  depend on it. A successful build proves nothing on its own: it stays green\n  when a component''s classes silently vanish from the CSS.\n- `lint:check` and `typecheck` run in the test job. `lint` keeps `--fix` for\n  local use; in CI it would have fixed violations and exited zero. `typecheck`\n  uses `tsconfig.json`, so it covers tests too, unlike the `tsc` inside `build`.\n\nBump the preset to 0.6.0 and, with it, the dependency range in every in-repo\nconsumer. Leaving them at ^0.5.0 makes yarn consider the workspace package\nunsuitable and silently install the published version into nested node_modules,\nafter which the repo builds against foreign code.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"ee793fca20e2f854a73d27b309080685932764ea","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/efureev/unocss-preset-granular/git/trees/ee793fca20e2f854a73d27b309080685932764ea"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/efureev/unocss-preset-granular/git/commits/e589483de646132a8e901de5bc3f102e4be039b4","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/efureev/unocss-preset-granular/commit/e589483de646132a8e901de5bc3f102e4be039b4","node_id":"C_kwDOSHDghtoAKGU1ODk0ODNkZTY0NjEzMmE4ZTkwMWRlNWJjM2YxMDJlNGJlMDM5YjQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/efureev/unocss-preset-granular/commit/38e0a7aa4374da0f2d44f26c5ce4a4fcc83e3f44","sha":"38e0a7aa4374da0f2d44f26c5ce4a4fcc83e3f44","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/efureev/unocss-preset-granular/commits/38e0a7aa4374da0f2d44f26c5ce4a4fcc83e3f44"}],"sha":"e589483de646132a8e901de5bc3f102e4be039b4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/efureev/unocss-preset-granular/commits/e589483de646132a8e901de5bc3f102e4be039b4"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/efureev/unocss-preset-granular/commits/38e0a7aa4374da0f2d44f26c5ce4a4fcc83e3f44/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-30T21:04:54Z","email":"fureev@gmail.com","name":"fureev"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-30T21:04:54Z","email":"fureev@gmail.com","name":"fureev"},"message":"refactor: remove unused theme CSS and improve package metadata\n\n- Deleted `dark.css`, `light.css`, and `base.css` as themes are now app-managed.\n- Updated `package.json` descriptions and keywords for better clarity and alignment with new functionality.\n- Added new subpath exports for `XGroupAOne` and `XGroupATwo`.\n- Included `LICENSE` and `README.md` in the published package.","tree":{"sha":"495119fbceb928e09d1184f037a108e7cf2af0b6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/efureev/unocss-preset-granular/git/trees/495119fbceb928e09d1184f037a108e7cf2af0b6"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/efureev/unocss-preset-granular/git/commits/38e0a7aa4374da0f2d44f26c5ce4a4fcc83e3f44","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/efureev/unocss-preset-granular/commit/38e0a7aa4374da0f2d44f26c5ce4a4fcc83e3f44","node_id":"C_kwDOSHDghtoAKDM4ZTBhN2FhNDM3NGRhMGYyZDQ0ZjI2YzVjZTRhNGZjYzgzZTNmNDQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/efureev/unocss-preset-granular/commit/053de208fdddd3dd4a12b35319e8278f3e95f7a6","sha":"053de208fdddd3dd4a12b35319e8278f3e95f7a6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/efureev/unocss-preset-granular/commits/053de208fdddd3dd4a12b35319e8278f3e95f7a6"}],"sha":"38e0a7aa4374da0f2d44f26c5ce4a4fcc83e3f44","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/efureev/unocss-preset-granular/commits/38e0a7aa4374da0f2d44f26c5ce4a4fcc83e3f44"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/efureev/unocss-preset-granular/commits/053de208fdddd3dd4a12b35319e8278f3e95f7a6/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-30T20:38:29Z","email":"fureev@gmail.com","name":"fureev"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-30T20:38:29Z","email":"fureev@gmail.com","name":"fureev"},"message":"docs: update README files with installation, usage, and migration info\n\n- Replaced `preset-wind4` with `presetMini` in configuration examples.\n- Added migration guide links for `0.4.0 → 0.5.0` in `en` and `ru` README files.\n- Expanded quick start sections with updated comment