date":"2026-07-30T13:09:10Z","email":"fureev@gmail.com","name":"fureev"},"message":"feat: update dependencies, improve app verification, and add integration tests\n\n- Updated `@feugene/unocss-preset-granular` to `^0.5.0` across all apps and packages.\n- Downgraded `typescript` from `^7.0.2` to `^6.0.3` for compatibility.\n- Added `expected-css.mjs` for app-1 through app-4 to verify correct CSS outputs.\n- Introduced `scripts/verify-apps.mjs` to automate integration tests on app builds.\n- Updated `package.json` scripts to include `verify:apps` and removed unused test suite configs.\n- Improved documentation (`en` and `ru`) to cover CSS expectations, verification processes, and app-specific scenarios.","tree":{"sha":"faa91712b8ae066958387325d6dbf77dec832f9a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/efureev/unocss-preset-granular/git/trees/faa91712b8ae066958387325d6dbf77dec832f9a"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/efureev/unocss-preset-granular/git/commits/363977a3c132bd1aaf38b329428dbb5f7bb4ff18","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/efureev/unocss-preset-granular/commit/363977a3c132bd1aaf38b329428dbb5f7bb4ff18","node_id":"C_kwDOSHDghtoAKDM2Mzk3N2EzYzEzMmJkMWFhZjM4YjMyOTQyOGRiYjVmN2JiNGZmMTg","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/efureev/unocss-preset-granular/commit/7f052b89fcc81274775205742eff197467b29019","sha":"7f052b89fcc81274775205742eff197467b29019","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/efureev/unocss-preset-granular/commits/7f052b89fcc81274775205742eff197467b29019"}],"sha":"363977a3c132bd1aaf38b329428dbb5f7bb4ff18","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/efureev/unocss-preset-granular/commits/363977a3c132bd1aaf38b329428dbb5f7bb4ff18"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/efureev/unocss-preset-granular/commits/7f052b89fcc81274775205742eff197467b29019/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-29T19:29:57Z","email":"fureev@gmail.com","name":"fureev"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-29T19:29:57Z","email":"fureev@gmail.com","name":"fureev"},"message":"feat: improve provider validation, CLI, and CSS caching\n\n- Added provider shape validation at registration with `InvalidProviderError`.\n- Introduced LRU-bound CSS caching (`CSS_CACHE_MAX_ENTRIES`) with mtime/size invalidation.\n- Refactored CLI into a testable structure, extracting logic to a new `cli.ts` module.\n- Enhanced test coverage: CLI, caching, and validation.\n- Updated docs (`en`, `ru`) for provider validation, CSS caching, and CLI usage.","tree":{"sha":"4b971b7ecd12ef45441bd82ee0bcc7c2be989ccd","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/efureev/unocss-preset-granular/git/trees/4b971b7ecd12ef45441bd82ee0bcc7c2be989ccd"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/efureev/unocss-preset-granular/git/commits/7f052b89fcc81274775205742eff197467b29019","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/efureev/unocss-preset-granular/commit/7f052b89fcc81274775205742eff197467b29019","node_id":"C_kwDOSHDghtoAKDdmMDUyYjg5ZmNjODEyNzQ3NzUyMDU3NDJlZmYxOTc0NjdiMjkwMTk","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/efureev/unocss-preset-granular/commit/33614979c02fe98bdafb0910c72e25aa80daaa60","sha":"33614979c02fe98bdafb0910c72e25aa80daaa60","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/efureev/unocss-preset-granular/commits/33614979c02fe98bdafb0910c72e25aa80daaa60"}],"sha":"7f052b89fcc81274775205742eff197467b29019","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/efureev/unocss-preset-granular/commits/7f052b89fcc81274775205742eff197467b29019"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/efureev/unocss-preset-granular/commits/33614979c02fe98bdafb0910c72e25aa80daaa60/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-29T19:10:31Z","email":"fureev@gmail.com","name":"fureev"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-29T19:10:31Z","email":"fureev@gmail.com","name":"fureev"},"message":"feat: add `resolvePackageBaseUrl` utility and improve asset handling\n\n- Added `resolvePackageBaseUrl` for runtime-safe URL resolution in preset contracts.\n- Introduced `granularAssetFileNames` for Vite builds to place CSS assets in contract-compliant paths (`components/<Name>/styles.css`).\n- Refactored asset and chunk handling in `vite.config.ts` across packages to ensure correct component directory structures.\n- Enhanced test coverage for asset utilities, ensuring expected outputs and validations.\n- Updated documentation (`ru` and `en`) to include usage examples and best practices for new utilities.","tree":{"sha":"e0d356b447af262888b59040546e2fa70e2f363b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/efureev/unocss-preset-granular/git/trees/e0d356b447af262888b59040546e2fa70e2f363b"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/efureev/unocss-preset-granular/git/commits/33614979c02fe98bdafb0910c72e25aa80daaa60","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/efureev/unocss-preset-granular/commit/33614979c02fe98bdafb0910c72e25aa80daaa60","node_id":"C_kwDOSHDghtoAKDMzNjE0OTc5YzAyZmU5OGJkYWZiMDkxMGM3MmUyNWFhODBkYWFhNjA","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/efureev/unocss-preset-granular/commit/a6509463d85e1608ccf5c3aa8c921eef4e1fdaf5","sha":"a6509463d85e1608ccf5c3aa8c921eef4e1fdaf5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/efureev/unocss-preset-granular/commits/a6509463d85e1608ccf5c3aa8c921eef4e1fdaf5"}],"sha":"33614979c02fe98bdafb0910c72e25aa80daaa60","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/efureev/unocss-preset-granular/commits/33614979c02fe98bdafb0910c72e25aa80daaa60"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/efureev/unocss-preset-granular/commits/a6509463d85e1608ccf5c3aa8c921eef4e1fdaf5/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-29T18:47:34Z","email":"fureev@gmail.com","name":"fureev"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-29T18:47:34Z","email":"fureev@gmail.com","name":"fureev"},"message":"feat: refactor scan inspection and provider configuration\n\n- Replaced internal `inspectScanDirs` with a unified `inspectGranularScanDirs` for FS inspection and caching.\n- Improved provider configuration to enforce browser/node separation and avoid unintended `node` imports in browser exports.\n- Added `ScanDirsInspection` result to streamline diagnostics across `content.filesystem` and granular doctor.\n- Enhanced test coverage for memoization, directory inspection, and skipped entries.\n- Updated documentation (`ru` and `en`) with best practices for provider design and common mistakes to avoid.\n- Refactored `granular-provider` factories to ensure consistency between browser and node exports.","tree":{"sha":"954c18be5b5578536abf9e0a26a06a2e913e38b2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/efureev/unocss-preset-granular/git/trees/954c18be5b5578536abf9e0a26a06a2e913e38b2"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/efureev/unocss-preset-granular/git/commits/a6509463d85e1608ccf5c3aa8c921eef4e1fdaf5","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/efureev/unocss-preset-granular/commit/a6509463d85e1608ccf5c3aa8c921eef4e1fdaf5","node_id":"C_kwDOSHDghtoAKGE2NTA5NDYzZDg1ZTE2MDhjY2Y1YzNhYThjOTIxZWVmNGUxZmRhZjU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/efureev/unocss-preset-granular/commit/03d44cd490f6d2fc57bfd2de07e87798cbfe9e05","sha":"03d44cd490f6d2fc57bfd2de07e87798cbfe9e05","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/efureev/unocss-preset-granular/commits/03d44cd490f6d2fc57bfd2de07e87798cbfe9e05"}],"sha":"a6509463d85e1608ccf5c3aa8c921eef4e1fdaf5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/efureev/unocss-preset-granular/commits/a6509463d85e1608ccf5c3aa8c921eef4e1fdaf5"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/efureev/unocss-preset-granular/commits/03d44cd490f6d2fc57bfd2de07e87798cbfe9e05/