y): snakelet — enter_from_below_ticks: отступ взвода от уровня в тиках (v0.0.186 · ui-0.0.165)\n\nВзвод «входа только снизу» разрешён, только пока best_ask целевой\nстороны ниже open_trigger − N × тик (живой current_tick_size рынка) —\nтриггер не взводится впритык к границе, где сработал бы первым же\nтиком. Отступ влияет только на момент взвода: взведённый триггер в\nбуферной зоне не снимается (без дребезга). Def 0 — прежнее поведение.\nUI: поле «Entry gap (ticks below level)» с visibleWhen по гейту.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"0deb338ba3f4d77ce5b033ccdce25200f9a6a1e4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Olegosx/PolyMoney2/git/trees/0deb338ba3f4d77ce5b033ccdce25200f9a6a1e4"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Olegosx/PolyMoney2/git/commits/8e9cb80aae256b79a07d455845fbfd763584ffb7","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/188755011?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Olegosx/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Olegosx/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Olegosx/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Olegosx/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Olegosx","id":188755011,"login":"Olegosx","node_id":"U_kgDOC0AsQw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Olegosx/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Olegosx/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Olegosx/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Olegosx/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Olegosx/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Olegosx","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Olegosx/PolyMoney2/commit/8e9cb80aae256b79a07d455845fbfd763584ffb7","node_id":"C_kwDOSHIGw9oAKD