стреляет сразу и покупает дороже триггера. Гейт только на\nпостановку: взведённый триггер при росте цены не снимается (пересечение\nснизу = штатный вход). Целевая сторона — той же логикой, что у драйвера\n(лидер/аутсайдер по midpoint); цена неопределима → не взводим. UI:\nбулево поле «Enter from below only» в форме snakelet.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"02276ad935ce5f39ce55766a16a465e7296c82a0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Olegosx/PolyMoney2/git/trees/02276ad935ce5f39ce55766a16a465e7296c82a0"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Olegosx/PolyMoney2/git/commits/33dd405302914811205a5c364aa4d13646e2b5a7","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/188755011?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Olegosx/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Olegosx/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Olegosx/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Olegosx/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Olegosx","id":188755011,"login":"Olegosx","node_id":"U_kgDOC0AsQw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Olegosx/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Olegosx/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Olegosx/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Olegosx/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Olegosx/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Olegosx","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Olegosx/PolyMoney2/commit/33dd405302914811205a5c364aa4d13646e2b5a7","node_id":"C_kwDOSHIGw9oAKDMzZGQ0MDUzMDI5MTQ4MTEyMDVhNWMzNjRhYTRkMTM2NDZlMmI1YTc","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Olegosx/PolyMoney2/commit/476ee0beae61ca2ac3fd40ba13a18027d4733d34","sha":"476ee0b