x/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Olegosx/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Olegosx/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Olegosx","id":188755011,"login":"Olegosx","node_id":"U_kgDOC0AsQw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Olegosx/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Olegosx/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Olegosx/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Olegosx/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Olegosx/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Olegosx","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Olegosx/PolyMoney2/commits/aacaeb076f8abe952a4667d20e85c13f3abf84a5/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-05T22:34:14Z","email":"olegos@vivaldi.net","name":"Olegosx"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-05T22:34:14Z","email":"olegos@vivaldi.net","name":"Olegosx"},"message":"feat(uplink): реалтайм-PnL рынка на дашборде — bot_market_pnl сквозь стек (v0.0.184 · frontend-0.0.36 · ui-0.0.163)\n\nТочное ботовое значение (helpers.market_pnl — тот же расчёт, что видит\nстратегия) текстом в шапке графика под строками индикаторов, зелёным/\nкрасным по знаку. Бот: быстрая петля аплинка _snapshot_fast_loop\n(диф-гейт, новый живой параметр output.uplink_fast_interval_seconds,\ndef 1 с). Оркестратор: BotMarketPnl — разбор, кэш для снапшота при\nподписке, рассылка (зеркало bot_positions). UI: поле стора marketPnl +\nстрока [Market PnL: ...] в MarketChart, формат pnlDisplay. Протокол —\ndocs/bot-frontend-protocol.md.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"df55c35e740c5d7aacaa2210c86eefe5a997eb3b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Olegosx/PolyMoney2/git/trees/df55c35e740c5d7aacaa2210c86eefe5a997eb3b"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Olegosx/PolyMoney2/git/commits/aacae