rganizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Olegosx/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Olegosx/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Olegosx/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Olegosx/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Olegosx/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Olegosx","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Olegosx/PolyMoney2/commits/854169044af5edf7963f2ae35416e2dc445e0231/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-05T20:42:28Z","email":"olegos@vivaldi.net","name":"Olegosx"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-05T20:42:28Z","email":"olegos@vivaldi.net","name":"Olegosx"},"message":"feat(strategy): реалтайм PnL по маркету — сверка с журналом сделок Polymarket (v0.0.182)\n\nСлайс 1 инструмента PnL: реализованная часть подтверждается журналом\nData API /activity (корутина strategy-pnl-sync, интервал\ntrading.pnl_sync_interval_seconds, якорь ConfirmedPnl в MarketState),\nрасчётными остаются только хвост непроиндексированных продаж ленты и\nпереоценка открытой позиции по best_bid (helpers.market_pnl). Семантика\nи формула сверены живым API 2026-07-05: реплей журнала воспроизводит\nсобственные агрегаты realizedPnl Polymarket; комиссии — из usdcSize.\nБез якоря (бектест / сверка выключена) — деградация в расчётный режим.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"2a576d332ee25a35ae4f25088c334e330db62a3e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Olegosx/PolyMoney2/git/trees/2a576d332ee25a35ae4f25088c334e330db62a3e"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Olegosx/PolyMoney2/git/commits/854169044af5edf7963f2ae35416e2dc445e0231","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/188755011?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ol