x/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Olegosx/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Olegosx/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Olegosx/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Olegosx","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Olegosx/PolyMoney2/commits/d54e21226dd1e9fded716235366a702c1646a96c/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-05T17:16:39Z","email":"olegos@vivaldi.net","name":"Olegosx"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-05T17:16:39Z","email":"olegos@vivaldi.net","name":"Olegosx"},"message":"feat(backtest): сценарий base-0 — наливы FAK по цене установки уровня (v0.0.181 · ui-0.0.161)\n\nbase-0 = base, где FAK сработавшего сторожка наливается по своему\nуровню (вход — trigger_price, SL — уровень момента срабатывания,\nSELL-нога SB), а не по книге под-тика: при гэпе ленты FAK по книге\nложится далеко за уровнем. FAK без уровня и лимитки — как в base;\nD действует поверх; negative/base байт-в-байт. Доставка уровня —\nнеобязательный параметр level у place_market_order (живой клиент\nигнорирует, в HTTP не уходит). CLI/супервайзер/UI-селект + D для\nbase-0; docs/backtest.md — подраздел сценария и срез C10. +12 тестов.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"80cb06e604e61c6e61e17f4f93485fb08f6956c4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Olegosx/PolyMoney2/git/trees/80cb06e604e61c6e61e17f4f93485fb08f6956c4"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Olegosx/PolyMoney2/git/commits/d54e21226dd1e9fded716235366a702c1646a96c","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/188755011?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Olegosx/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Olegosx/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/use