: явная сторона триггерного входа — опциональный outcome у OpenTriggerCommand (v0.0.179)\n\noutcome задан (YES/NO) → watchdog следит за указанной стороной без\nролевой логики и переоценки по midpoint; asset_id watchdog-компонента\nизвестен уже при взводе (линия уровня в UI сразу, как в режиме 4).\noutcome=None → прежний авто-выбор, авто-путь не изменён (rider/\nsnakelet/delta как раньше). wire.py не расширялся — явная сторона\nпока только для стратегий. Подготовка к swings2. +3 теста.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"4da0c582ec27c80fc37d0209d979e4c5ef498704","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Olegosx/PolyMoney2/git/trees/4da0c582ec27c80fc37d0209d979e4c5ef498704"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Olegosx/PolyMoney2/git/commits/86699ffc2c809d873d9878cd629c7659dc5600c1","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/188755011?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Olegosx/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Olegosx/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Olegosx/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Olegosx/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Olegosx","id":188755011,"login":"Olegosx","node_id":"U_kgDOC0AsQw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Olegosx/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Olegosx/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Olegosx/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Olegosx/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Olegosx/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Olegosx","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Olegosx/PolyMoney2/commit/86699ffc2c809d873d9878cd629c7659dc5600c1","node_id":"C_kwDOSHIGw9oAKDg2Njk5ZmZjMmM4MDl