"user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Olegosx/PolyMoney2/commits/6b56ba7c5168b1110e992d19447cc06ff7177b1f/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-04T21:25:55Z","email":"olegos@vivaldi.net","name":"Olegosx"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-04T21:25:55Z","email":"olegos@vivaldi.net","name":"Olegosx"},"message":"fix(ui): читаемость дашборда и Account — подписи метрик слева, порядок Activity by market (ui-0.0.154)\n\n- Completed markets: ценовая ось MarketMetricsChart слева — подписи серий\n  не наезжают на свежие точки справа\n- Activity by market: карточки по market_id (убыв., новые вверху) вместо\n  времени свежей записи (поздний REDEEM поднимал старый рынок наверх);\n  группы без market_id — в конце\n- записи внутри карточки хронологически (старые вверху)\n- карточка по умолчанию прокручена к нижней (свежей) записи (MarketCard\n  + viewportRef, скролл вниз на монтировании и доливе)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"6d5bfc58d5168fb9607364af50c77da530425bb2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Olegosx/PolyMoney2/git/trees/6d5bfc58d5168fb9607364af50c77da530425bb2"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Olegosx/PolyMoney2/git/commits/6b56ba7c5168b1110e992d19447cc06ff7177b1f","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/188755011?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Olegosx/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Olegosx/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Olegosx/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Olegosx/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Olegosx","id":188755011,"login":"Olegosx","node_id":"U_kgDOC0AsQw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Olegosx/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Olegosx/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Olegosx/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Olegosx/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Olegosx/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Olegosx","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Olegosx/PolyMoney2/commit/6b56ba7c5168b1110e992d19447cc06ff7177b1f","node_id":"C_kwDOSHIGw9oAKDZiNTZiYTdjNTE2OGIxMTEwZTk5MmQxOTQ0N2NjMDZmZjcxNzdiMWY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Olegosx/PolyMoney2/commit/adcf6b90fec38ae7531164ee5cd301e2f0815d77","sha":"adcf6b90fec38ae7531164ee5cd301e2f0815d77","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Olegosx/PolyMoney2/commits/adcf6b90fec38ae7531164ee5cd301e2f0815d77"}],"sha":"6b56ba7c5168b1110e992d19447cc06ff7177b1f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Olegosx/PolyMoney2/commits/6b56ba7c5168b1110e992d19447cc06ff7177b1f"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/188755011?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Olegosx/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Olegosx/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Olegosx/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Olegosx/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Olegosx","id":188755011,"login":"Olegosx","node_id":"U_kgDOC0AsQw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Olegosx/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Olegosx/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Olegosx/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Olegosx/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Olegosx/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Olegosx","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Olegosx/PolyMoney2/commits/adcf6b90fec38ae7531164ee5cd301e2f0815d77/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-04T20:41:57Z","email":"olegos@vivaldi.net","name":"Olegosx"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-04T20:41:57Z","email":"olegos@vivaldi.net","name":"Olegosx"},"message":"fix(account): честный учёт PnL — ключ closed_positions без timestamp + синтез сгоревших остатков (v0.0.174 · frontend-0.0.35 · ui-0.0.153)\n\nСверка bot.db против живого Data API и блокчейна Polygon (bot-3):\n230 из 408 строк closed_positions — устаревшие снимки (timestamp\nзаписи мутирует при пересчётах, /closed-positions держит одну\nагрегатную запись на токен — своп 500 записей без единого повтора\nпары), плюс ≈ −30 USDC по 102 сгоревшим позициям вне учёта (пока на\nтокене остаток, Polymarket записи о закрытии не создаёт; жетоны\nподтверждены balanceOf ConditionalTokens).\n\nPK → (condition_id, asset), timestamp — колонка; миграция\n_migrate_closed_key (в группе остаётся снимок с max timestamp);\nколонка source ''api''/''synthetic''. Поток аккаунта опрашивает\n/positions (sizeThreshold=0) → OpenPosition в буфере; output\nсинтезирует закрытия сгоревших числами Polymarket (realizedPnl +\ncashPnl, момент = resolved_at), синтетика не затирает api, api\nзатирает синтетику. bot_account получил burned_pnl, оркестратор\nпроксирует, UI показывает «Burned, USDC». Доки: polymarket-clob-api\n(опровергнуто предположение об «эпизодах»), bot-history-db,\nbot-frontend-protocol.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"6c52b58ddf8de066cfa0e14a542da1b9c6c24478","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Olegosx/PolyMoney2/git/trees/6c52b58ddf8de066cfa0e14a542da1b9c6c24478"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Olegosx/PolyMoney2/git/commits/adcf6b90fec38ae7531164ee5cd301e2f0815d77","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/188755011?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Olegosx/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Olegosx/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Olegosx/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Olegosx/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Olegosx","id":188755011,"login":"Olegosx","node_id":"U_kgDOC0AsQw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Olegosx/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Olegosx/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Olegosx/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Olegosx/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Olegosx/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Olegosx","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Olegosx/PolyMoney2/commit/adcf6b90fec38ae7531164ee5cd301e2f0815d77","node_id":"C_kwDOSHIGw9oAKGFkY2Y2YjkwZmVjMzhhZTc1MzExNjRlZTVjZDMwMWUyZjA4MTVkNzc","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Olegosx/PolyMoney2/commit/364c3c3c80bf0817904b3911342219cd2a64cee1","sha":"364c3c3c80bf0817904b3911342219cd2a64cee1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Olegosx/PolyMoney2/commits/364c3c3c80bf0817904b3911342219cd2a64cee1"}],"sha":"adcf6b90fec38ae7531164ee5cd301e2f0815d77","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Olegosx/PolyMoney2/commits/adcf6b90fec38ae7531164ee5cd301e2f0815d77"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/188755011?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Olegosx/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Olegosx/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Olegosx/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Olegosx/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Olegosx","id":188755011,"login":"Olegosx","node_id":"U_kgDOC0AsQw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Olegosx/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Olegosx/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Olegosx/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Olegosx/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Olegosx/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Olegosx","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Olegosx/PolyMoney2/commits/364c3c3c80bf0817904b3911342219cd2a64cee1/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-04T14:08:16Z","email":"olegos@vivaldi.net","name":"Olegosx"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-04T14:08:16Z","email":"olegos@vivaldi.net","name":"Olegosx"},"message":"fix(strategy): гонка SB↔SL на границе switch_sec — фазы сущности + дедлайн выстрела в драйвере (v0.0.173)\n\nДва подтверждённых окна гонки (прод 2026-07-04): 2780752 — SB выстрелил\nза 0.34 с до переключения, финиш блока 2 поставил SL на продаваемую\nногой переворота сторону (отказ биржи, мёртвая SL-сущность, новая\nпозиция без защиты, −$3.60); 2782718 — снятие сторожка опоздало на 14 с\n(тики стратегии только на WS-событиях), SB жил до T−1 с.\n\nФиниш блока 2 различает фазы SB через новый канонический firing_ids\n(helpers.py): переворот исполняется (компоненты — ноги-ордера, запись\nсинхронна до первого await) → SL не ставим, его добирает блок 3 после\nосадки. Дедлайн выстрела SBCommand.fire_before_sec держит сам драйвер\nв точке решения (паттерн самообрыва по trading_ends_at): позже границы\n— терминал без ордеров; snakelet передаёт switch_sec, None — прочие\nстратегии и ручные команды без изменений.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"6667b3b74dc725442a0fcb2f414557e3e906781b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Olegosx/PolyMoney2/git/trees/6667b3b74dc725442a0fcb2f414557e3e906781b"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Olegosx/PolyMoney2/git/commits/364c3c3c80bf0817904b3911342219cd2a64cee1","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/188755011?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Olegosx/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Olegosx/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Olegosx/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Olegosx/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Olegosx","id":188755011,"login":"Olegosx","node_id":"U_kgDOC0AsQw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Olegosx/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Olegosx/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Olegosx/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Olegosx/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Olegosx/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Olegosx","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Olegosx/PolyMoney2/commit/364c3c3c80bf0817904b3911342219cd2a64cee1","node_id":"C_kwDOSHIGw9oAKDM2NGMzYzNjODBiZjA4MTc5MDRiMzkxMTM0MjIxOWNkMmE2NGNlZTE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Olegosx/PolyMoney2/commit/e72f72702adeda1c0891a45126cbaca795dd4bab","sha":"e72f72702adeda1c0891a45126cbaca795dd4bab","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Olegosx/PolyMoney2/commits/e72f72702adeda1c0891a45126cbaca795dd4bab"}],"sha":"364c3c3c80bf0817904b3911342219cd2a64cee1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Olegosx/PolyMoney2/commits/364c3c3c80bf0817904b3911342219cd2a64cee1"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/188755011?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Olegosx/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Olegosx/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Olegosx/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Olegosx/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Olegosx","id":188755011,"login":"Olegosx","node_id":"U_kgDOC0AsQw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Olegosx/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Olegosx/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Olegosx/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Olegosx/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Olegosx/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Olegosx","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Olegosx/PolyMoney2/commits/e72f72702adeda1c0891a45126cbaca795dd4bab/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-04T13:20:34Z","email":"olegos@vivaldi.net","name":"Olegosx"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-04T13:20:34Z","email":"olegos@vivaldi.net","name":"Olegosx"},"message":"fix(strategy): snakelet добирает пропущенный SL в блоке 3 — позиция не остаётся голой (v0.0.172)\n\nПереход блок 2 → блок 3 в окне trade CONFIRMED молча пропускал SL, а\nWaitBlock попытку не повторял — позиция ехала до резолюции без защиты\n(прод bot-3 2026-07-04, рынок 2778391, −$8.10 кэшем). Теперь WaitBlock\nна каждом тике ставит SL, как только позиции подтвердят сторону журнала\n(зеркало паттерна ожидания SB блока 2); гварды — нет ждущего и нет\nотработавшего SL, отменённый без налива перевыставляется. Сборка\nSLCommand вынесена в общий _sl_command. Бонус: поздний вход после\nпрыжка блок 1 → блок 3 тоже получает SL. Только плагин, ядро не тронуто.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"9c52e5b3b62ac621dac17014f81560dd5ec29c7f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Olegosx/PolyMoney2/git/trees/9c52e5b3b62ac621dac17014f81560dd5ec29c7f"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Olegosx/PolyMoney2/git/commits/e72f72702adeda1c0891a45126cbaca795dd4bab","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/188755011?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Olegosx/events{/priva