"repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Olegosx/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Olegosx/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Olegosx/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Olegosx","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Olegosx/PolyMoney2/commits/e65876ec01a727abbf10724e8d81fb0edd82e1d0/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-04T11:59:01Z","email":"olegos@vivaldi.net","name":"Olegosx"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-04T11:59:01Z","email":"olegos@vivaldi.net","name":"Olegosx"},"message":"fix(ui): схема grid догнала стратегию — Resolution hedge вместо мёртвых защит (ui-0.0.152)\n\nСрез v0.0.138 заменил в grid защиты первого поколения (arm_stop_sec /\nflatten_sec / max_drawdown) на хэдж у резолюции, но схема формы в\nstrategies/schemas.ts осталась старой: показывала три параметра, которые\nстратегия молча игнорирует, а живой хэдж настраивался только руками в JSON.\n\nГруппа «Resolution guards» → «Resolution hedge»: hedge_trigger (0-1, 0=off),\nhedge_mode (lock/cover/fixed/flip/exit), hedge_size (только fixed,\nenabledWhen), hedge_exit_mode (fak/maker, только exit/flip). Подсказки — по\nдокстрингу стратегии. Мёртвые ключи в существующих конфигах безвредны.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"1fd57013c5d781ae005a149e8c855d90d017914e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Olegosx/PolyMoney2/git/trees/1fd57013c5d781ae005a149e8c855d90d017914e"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Olegosx/PolyMoney2/git/commits/e65876ec01a727abbf10724e8d81fb0edd82e1d0","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/188755011?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Olegosx/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Olegosx/followers","following_url":