rl":"https://api.github.com/users/Olegosx/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Olegosx/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Olegosx","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Olegosx/PolyMoney2/commits/7708e2ccbfac8248db9954901f69c8ce96f2233d/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-03T23:41:59Z","email":"olegos@vivaldi.net","name":"Olegosx"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-03T23:41:59Z","email":"olegos@vivaldi.net","name":"Olegosx"},"message":"revert(backtest): откат моделей FAK v0.0.169/v0.0.170 к поведению v0.0.168 (v0.0.171)\n\ngit revert 8160023 (модель «по касанию», decision_price) и 44105f9 (худший\nэкстремум секунды + тихие раунды _settle). Бектест снова наливает FAK по\nкотировке снимка, _settle выходит после одного тихого раунда. Версия идёт\nвперёд (теги v0.0.169/v0.0.170 заняты историей), записи в CHANGELOG сохранены.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"6ec8fc3aee1d5cae90e51a20d6fa466011657fb5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Olegosx/PolyMoney2/git/trees/6ec8fc3aee1d5cae90e51a20d6fa466011657fb5"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Olegosx/PolyMoney2/git/commits/7708e2ccbfac8248db9954901f69c8ce96f2233d","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/188755011?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Olegosx/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Olegosx/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Olegosx/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Olegosx/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Olegosx","id":188755011,"login":"Olegosx","node_id":"U_kgDOC0AsQw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Olegosx/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Olegosx/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Olegosx/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Olegosx/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Olegosx/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Olegosx","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Olegosx/PolyMoney2/commit/7708e2ccbfac8248db9954901f69c8ce96f2233d","node_id":"C_kwDOSHIGw9oAKDc3MDhlMmNjYmZhYzgyNDhkYjk5NTQ5MDFmNjljOGNlOTZmMjIzM2Q","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Olegosx/PolyMoney2/commit/8160023e0be05c0560f193d7e5d79c3a832820f3","sha":"8160023e0be05c0560f193d7e5d79c3a832820f3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Olegosx/PolyMoney2/commits/8160023e0be05c0560f193d7e5d79c3a832820f3"}],"sha":"7708e2ccbfac8248db9954901f69c8ce96f2233d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Olegosx/PolyMoney2/commits/7708e2ccbfac8248db9954901f69c8ce96f2233d"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/188755011?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Olegosx/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Olegosx/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Olegosx/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Olegosx/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Olegosx","id":188755011,"login":"Olegosx","node_id":"U_kgDOC0AsQw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Olegosx/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Olegosx/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Olegosx/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Olegosx/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Olegosx/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Olegosx","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Olegosx/PolyMoney2/commits/8160023e0be05c0560f193d7e5d79c3a832820f3/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-03T23:20:49Z","email":"olegos@vivaldi.net","name":"Olegosx"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-03T23:20:49Z","email":"olegos@vivaldi.net","name":"Olegosx"},"message":"fix(backtest): модель FAK «по касанию» — калибровка по живой торговле 2026-07-03 (v0.0.170)\n\nv0.0.169 (худший экстремум секунды) оказалась пережатой: живой день +4.17,\nстарая модель +25.51, v0.0.169 −17.77 (живые параметры, 42 общих рынка).\nЖивые пары ног SB зеркальны (суммы ≈ 1.0) и наливаются у пересечения уровня.\n\nДрайвер передаёт цену решения (decision_price: уровень триггера; у встречной\nноги SB — зеркало 1 − уровень) через SupportsOrders.place_market_order; живой\nOrderClient параметр не использует (в ордер не попадает — поведение прода не\nменяется). SimExchange наливает FAK по пересечению этой цены, клампя в\nнаблюдённый диапазон свечи секунды: внутри → уровень, вне (гэп) → ближайший\nреальный экстремум; без уровня — котировка книги. Итог калибровки: −4.49,\nпометочная ошибка 47.9 → 44.4 → 39.9.\n\nИзвестный остаток: каскад переворотов на мерцающих секундах (лента фаз\nпересекает триггер чаще живого потока тиков) и мейкер-ноги от котировки\nснимка — вне среза.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"57a4af449044adfabea14439df6dc6bc73af8bf3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Olegosx/PolyMoney2/git/trees/57a4af449044adfabea14439df6dc6bc73af8bf3"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Olegosx/PolyMoney2/git/commits/8160023e0be05c0560f193d7e5d79c3a832820f3","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/188755011?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Olegosx/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Olegosx/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Olegosx/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Olegosx/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","