os@vivaldi.net","name":"Olegosx"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-02T23:23:23Z","email":"olegos@vivaldi.net","name":"Olegosx"},"message":"fix(trade): watchdog публикует целевую сторону в asset_id — линия UI следует за сущностью (v0.0.166)\n\nWatchdog-компонент всегда нёс asset_id=\"\" до срабатывания — UI не знал\nсторону и рисовал trigger_price без зеркала (как YES), линия не следовала\nза авто-переворотом open 3 и стояла не на той половине для open 4/SL/SB\nна NO. Теперь _build_watchdog_entity принимает asset_id (open 4/SL/SB —\nпри взводе), а open 3 публикует цель роли при пере-резолве\n(_publish_watch_target, коммит только при смене — пересечение 0.5).\nЗеркалирование UI уже читало asset_id — правок UI-кода нет. Семантика\nэксплицирована в bot-frontend-protocol.md.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"b247bfa304e90d33ba07ff4598aac33110b5abe0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Olegosx/PolyMoney2/git/trees/b247bfa304e90d33ba07ff4598aac33110b5abe0"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Olegosx/PolyMoney2/git/commits/f505f1f368db5188a8dc95efdcb8d84579eeb961","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/188755011?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Olegosx/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Olegosx/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Olegosx/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Olegosx/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Olegosx","id":188755011,"login":"Olegosx","node_id":"U_kgDOC0AsQw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Olegosx/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Olegosx/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Olegosx/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Olegosx/starred{/owner}{/repo