,"name":"Olegosx"},"message":"feat(ui): Max move % и MM/HV в строке индикаторов графика (ui-0.0.148)\n\nwithDerivedReadout добавляет в первую строку легенды (Pre-candle):\nMax move % (пик move_pct от старта окна, перед Move %) и MM/HV (пик,\nнормированный на текущую короткую HV — сигнал фильтра входа стратегий).\nСчитаются на лету из готовых рядов: в БД не пишутся, на панели не\nрисуются. Нет hv_short → MM/HV не добавляется; не прогрелась → «—».\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"1227226e907cc202e373a97aa8e74526ea5aee3d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Olegosx/PolyMoney2/git/trees/1227226e907cc202e373a97aa8e74526ea5aee3d"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Olegosx/PolyMoney2/git/commits/c740f19c02d07c15d90ea274af43a9f509a32084","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/188755011?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Olegosx/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Olegosx/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Olegosx/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Olegosx/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Olegosx","id":188755011,"login":"Olegosx","node_id":"U_kgDOC0AsQw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Olegosx/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Olegosx/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Olegosx/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Olegosx/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Olegosx/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Olegosx","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Olegosx/PolyMoney2/commit/c740f19c02d07c15d90ea274af43a9f509a32084","node_id":"C_kwDOSHIGw9oAKGM3NDBmMTljMDJkMDdjMTVkOTBlYTI3NGFmNDNhOWY1MDlhMzIwODQ","p