mail":"olegos@vivaldi.net","name":"Olegosx"},"message":"feat(strategy): множитель BUY-ноги SB на каждый флип в snakelet (v0.0.164, ui-0.0.144)\n\nsb_buy_mult принимает скаляр (один M на все флипы, как раньше) или список:\nсвой M на флип. Номер флипа = число completed SB в буфере; за концом списка\nберётся последний элемент; пустой список → дефолт 1 (_mult_for_flip).\nЯдро/SBCommand не менялись. UI: новый тип поля number_list (ввод через\nзапятую, Apply шлёт JSON-массив, невалидный ввод блокирует Apply).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"d364e90cafe7673b8df2f7d1a72615aa8a9e4140","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Olegosx/PolyMoney2/git/trees/d364e90cafe7673b8df2f7d1a72615aa8a9e4140"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Olegosx/PolyMoney2/git/commits/957a71b54c3ed63de25a9f35e5517678b831c86b","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/188755011?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Olegosx/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Olegosx/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Olegosx/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Olegosx/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Olegosx","id":188755011,"login":"Olegosx","node_id":"U_kgDOC0AsQw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Olegosx/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Olegosx/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Olegosx/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Olegosx/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Olegosx/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Olegosx","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Olegosx/PolyMoney2/commit/957a71b54c3ed63de25a9f35e5517678b831c86b","node_id":"C_kwDOSHIGw9oA