n":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Olegosx/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Olegosx/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Olegosx","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Olegosx/PolyMoney2/commits/a41080f1a56efa264ca6028c43b248a48a8c91af/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-02T12:07:14Z","email":"olegos@vivaldi.net","name":"Olegosx"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-02T12:07:14Z","email":"olegos@vivaldi.net","name":"Olegosx"},"message":"feat(ui): manual ops — кнопка «Close all & pause» (ui-0.0.139)\n\nВ блоке Close all: закрывает все держимые стороны FAK и ставит бота\nна паузу (control trading.paused=true). Дизейбл только при отсутствии\nактивного рынка + общий гейт Allow trading.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"e37ecc468e08f7a8faafd7fdf0ee1bb1e0460b77","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Olegosx/PolyMoney2/git/trees/e37ecc468e08f7a8faafd7fdf0ee1bb1e0460b77"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Olegosx/PolyMoney2/git/commits/a41080f1a56efa264ca6028c43b248a48a8c91af","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/188755011?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Olegosx/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Olegosx/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Olegosx/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Olegosx/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Olegosx","id":188755011,"login":"Olegosx","node_id":"U_kgDOC0AsQw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Olegosx/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Olegosx/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Olegosx/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Olegosx/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Olegosx/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Olegosx","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Olegosx/PolyMoney2/commit/a41080f1a56efa264ca6028c43b248a48a8c91af","node_id":"C_kwDOSHIGw9oAKGE0MTA4MGYxYTU2ZWZhMjY0Y2E2MDI4YzQzYjI0OGE0OGE4YzkxYWY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Olegosx/PolyMoney2/commit/9896ec66333a6211480339471a96307c3a130819","sha":"9896ec66333a6211480339471a96307c3a130819","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Olegosx/PolyMoney2/commits/9896ec66333a6211480339471a96307c3a130819"}],"sha":"a41080f1a56efa264ca6028c43b248a48a8c91af","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Olegosx/PolyMoney2/commits/a41080f1a56efa264ca6028c43b248a48a8c91af"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/188755011?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Olegosx/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Olegosx/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Olegosx/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Olegosx/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Olegosx","id":188755011,"login":"Olegosx","node_id":"U_kgDOC0AsQw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Olegosx/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Olegosx/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Olegosx/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Olegosx/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Olegosx/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Olegosx","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Olegosx/PolyMoney2/commits/9896ec66333a6211480339471a96307c3a130819/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-02T01:25:12Z","email":"olegos@vivaldi.net","name":"Olegosx"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-02T01:25:12Z","email":"olegos@vivaldi.net","name":"Olegosx"},"message":"fix(strategy): SB — инвариант «нет продажи → нет покупки», гард по журналу (v0.0.161)\n\nНоги SB параллельны и независимы: отказ SELL (продавать нечего) не\nостанавливал BUY — каждый лишний SB залпа наливал голую покупку\n(прод 2026-07-01: NO раздулся 2.23 → 11.04 shares). A/B убрали залп,\nно оставалась дыра: позицию продали мимо взведённого сторожка\n(close/SL), триггер срабатывает в окне trade CONFIRMED — проверка\nпозиции по запаздывающей таблице молчит, SELL отвергается, BUY\nналивается.\n\nСеквенирование ног отвергнуто (цена уезжает — ноги обязаны стартовать\nодновременно). Вместо него _sold_outside_since_armed: в _fire до\nотправки ног — проверка журнала на чужую налитую SELL-ногу по нашему\nтокену после нашей отправки (updated_at > штампа prime). Есть →\nсущность отменяется целиком, ни одна нога не шлётся. Latency — ноль\n(локальный буфер). Ложная отмена безопасна: стратегия перевзведёт SB\n(канон v0.0.160).\n\nТесты: продажа мимо сторожка → ордеров ноль; старая продажа (цепочка\nSB) не блокирует. ruff/mypy/pytest (804) чисты. Пакет A+B+C завершён.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"4aec67c00a51aff6773c97cc07b080646d459a0d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Olegosx/PolyMoney2/git/trees/4aec67c00a51aff6773c97cc07b080646d459a0d"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Olegosx/PolyMoney2/git/commits/9896ec66333a6211480339471a96307c3a130819","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/188755011?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Olegosx/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Olegosx/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Olegosx/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Olegosx/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Olegosx","id":188755011,"login":"Olegosx","node_id":"U_kgDOC0AsQw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Olegosx/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Olegosx/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Olegosx/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Olegosx/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Olegosx/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Olegosx","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Olegosx/PolyMoney2/commit/9896ec66333a6211480339471a96307c3a130819","node_id":"C_kwDOSHIGw9oAKDk4OTZlYzY2MzMzYTYyMTE0ODAzMzk0NzFhOTYzMDdjM2ExMzA4MTk","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Olegosx/PolyMoney2/commit/edad144321ad4b01419c080dcc5dc294e41d4a43","sha":"edad144321ad4b01419c080dcc5dc294e41d4a43","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Olegosx/PolyMoney2/commits/edad144321ad4b01419c080dcc5dc294e41d4a43"}],"sha":"9896ec66333a6211480339471a96307c3a130819","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Olegosx/PolyMoney2/commits/9896ec66333a6211480339471a96307c3a130819"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/188755011?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Olegosx/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Olegosx/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Olegosx/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Olegosx/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Olegosx","id":188755011,"login":"Olegosx","node_id":"U_kgDOC0AsQw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Olegosx/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Olegosx/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Olegosx/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Olegosx/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Olegosx/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Olegosx","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Olegosx/PolyMoney2/commits/edad144321ad4b01419c080dcc5dc294e41d4a43/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-02T01:06:38Z","email":"olegos@vivaldi.net","name":"Olegosx"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-02T01:06:38Z","email":"olegos@vivaldi.net","name":"Olegosx"},"message":"fix(strategy): серия SB — сторона из журнала флипов, а не из позиций (v0.0.160)\n\nБлок 2 snakelet брал сторону переворота из position_side, а таблица\nпозиций обновляется только на trade CONFIRMED (~7-8 c после налива).\nВ этом окне стратегия видела старую сторону и лупила SB залпом\n(прод 2026-07-01, bot-3, рынок 2746844: 7 SB за 4 с на одной стороне).\n\nЧиталка журнала (helpers): bought_side — купленная сторона сущности по\nналитой BUY-ноге компонентов; journal_side — текущая сторона по своим\nдействиям синхронно по наливу (цепочка SB поверх входа; пустой журнал,\nнапр. рестарт, → фолбэк на позиции). Новых хранилищ/полей нет.\n\nБлок 2: сторона из journal_side; журнал разошёлся с позициями\n(переворот подтверждается) → ждём — залп невозможен. finish: SL только\nна подтверждённую сторону журнала. Осознанный компромисс: в окне\nподтверждения SB не взведён (недобор, не убыток). Шаг B фикса серии SB;\nостаток — C (драйвер: нет продажи → нет голой покупки).\n\nТесты: 6 юнитов journal_side + 2 сценария snakelet (регрессия залпа,\nфиниш без SL на устаревшую сторону). ruff/mypy/pytest (802) чисты.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"4d5efb99b639fe6917097e4aa23662df47a15fb0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Olegosx/PolyMoney2/git/trees/4d5efb99b639fe6917097e4aa23662df47a15fb0"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Olegosx/PolyMoney2/git/commits/edad144321ad4b01419c080dcc5dc294e41d4a43","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/188755011?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Olegosx/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Olegosx/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Olegosx/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Olegosx/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Olegosx","id":188755011,"login":"Olegosx","node_id":"U_kgDOC0AsQw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Olegosx/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Olegosx/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Olegosx/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Olegosx/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Olegosx/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Olegosx","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Olegosx/PolyMoney2/commit/edad144321ad4b01419c080dcc5dc294e41d4a43","node_id":"C_kwDOSHIGw9oAKGVkYWQxNDQzMjFhZDRiMDE0MTljMDgwZGNjNWRjMjk0ZTQxZDRhNDM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Olegosx/PolyMoney2/commit/ef97ed40543950fa4483fa985cdced432aeab771","sha":"ef97ed40543950fa4483fa985cdced432aeab771","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Olegosx/PolyMoney2/commits/ef97ed40543950fa4483fa985cdced432aeab771"}],"sha":"edad144321ad4b01419c080dcc5dc294e41d4a43","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Olegosx/PolyMoney2/commits/edad144321ad4b01419c080dcc5dc294e41d4a43"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/188755011?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Olegosx/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Olegosx/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Olegosx/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Olegosx/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Olegosx","id":188755011,"login":"Olegosx","node_id":"U_kgDOC0AsQw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Olegosx/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Olegosx/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Olegosx/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Olegosx/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Olegosx/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Olegosx","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Olegosx/PolyMoney2/commits/ef97ed40543950fa4483fa985cdced432aeab771/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-01T22:20:58Z","email":"olegos@vivaldi.net","name":"Olegosx"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-01T22:20:58Z","email":"olegos@vivaldi.net","name":"Olegosx"},"message":"fix(strategy): порог пыли dust_shares — единое «есть ли позиция» через is_held (v0.0.159)\n\nposition_side отдавал сторону по size > 0, поэтому остаток частичного\nзакрытия (пыль ~0.006 shares) читался как удержание. После переворота\nпозиции (snakelet, серия SB) пыль на старой стороне уводила выбор стороны\nSB и SL.\n\nЕдиное определение (helpers.is_held): новый живой параметр\ntrading.dust_shares (Decimal, дефолт 0.05, в whitelist control) —\nis_held = size > dust. Метрика shares (иммунна к движению курса),\nпорог ниже минимального ордера биржи. Применён во всей системе:\nposition_side/in_market + гарды драйверов (SL/TP/SB/close/TB).\nСтратегии передают config.trading.dust_shares. Шаг A фикса серии SB.\n\nТесты + пример конфига + docs (control/протокол). ruff/mypy/pytest (794) чисты.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"268a89c323ee4d7e0ad4ca8236301c7eb30a4264","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Olegosx/PolyMoney2/git/trees/268a89c323ee4d7e0ad4ca8236301c7eb30a4264"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Olegosx/PolyMoney2/git/commits/ef97ed40543950fa4483fa985cdced432aeab771","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"