4)\n\nНовый блок 0 (DelayBlock): не лезем в рынок, пока до конца маркета\nбольше start_sec секунд (def 900); при подходе к окну прозрачно\nпереходим в открытие. Нумерация остальных блоков сдвинута на +1.\n\nНовый параметр start_sec в профиле snakelet (config + UI-форма Timing).\nТесты переписаны под 4-блочную механику.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"1464bd49dc715509d33b5f69f28bc2694ccc53f4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Olegosx/PolyMoney2/git/trees/1464bd49dc715509d33b5f69f28bc2694ccc53f4"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Olegosx/PolyMoney2/git/commits/33a2765cefb78150bc078c703e0a71f03eca1fa8","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/188755011?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Olegosx/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Olegosx/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Olegosx/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Olegosx/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Olegosx","id":188755011,"login":"Olegosx","node_id":"U_kgDOC0AsQw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Olegosx/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Olegosx/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Olegosx/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Olegosx/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Olegosx/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Olegosx","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Olegosx/PolyMoney2/commit/33a2765cefb78150bc078c703e0a71f03eca1fa8","node_id":"C_kwDOSHIGw9oAKDMzYTI3NjVjZWZiNzgxNTBiYzA3OGM3MDNlMGE3MWYwM2VjYTFmYTg","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Olegosx/PolyMoney2/commit/7d564a0df0723547e7902b947eb938099d7a8896","sha":"7d564a0df0723547e7902b947eb938099d7a8896","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Olegosx/PolyMoney2/commits/7d564a0df0723547e7902b947eb938099d7a8896"}],"sha":"33a2765cefb78150bc078c703e0a71f03eca1fa8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Olegosx/PolyMoney2/commits/33a2765cefb78150bc078c703e0a71f03eca1fa8"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/188755011?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Olegosx/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Olegosx/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Olegosx/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Olegosx/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Olegosx","id":188755011,"login":"Olegosx","node_id":"U_kgDOC0AsQw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Olegosx/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Olegosx/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Olegosx/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Olegosx/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Olegosx/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Olegosx","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Olegosx/PolyMoney2/commits/7d564a0df0723547e7902b947eb938099d7a8896/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-30T20:19:43Z","email":"olegos@vivaldi.net","name":"Olegosx"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-30T20:19:43Z","email":"olegos@vivaldi.net","name":"Olegosx"},"message":"feat(ui): переработка панели Manual Trading Operations (ui-0.0.123)\n\n- карточки операций — SimpleGrid по 4 в ряд; убрана flex-распорка\n  переноса (давала дырку в гриде); OperationCard на высоту ячейки;\n- Accordion → строка-заголовок (шеврон-тоггл) + Collapse; в свёрнутом\n  виде быстрые «открыть» (FAK) и «Close all» (закрыть держимые стороны\n  FAK по позициям), каждая в визуальном блоке; баннеры результата\n  вынесены наружу (видны свёрнуто и развёрнуто);\n- тумблер Allow/Disallow (зелёный/красный, дефолт Disallow) —\n  предохранитель: при Disallow торговые кнопки задизейблены через\n  TradingEnabledContext; уведомление о работе без подтверждения —\n  после тумблера;\n- тумблеры Side: YES зелёный / NO красный; болд тумблеров снят темой;\n- блок Completed markets перенесён под панель операций;\n- переименование Trading Operations → Manual Trading Operations.\n\nБот/оркестратор/протокол не затронуты.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"4676701a7bd51c3534ac05d2592c9d69d2cbbddc","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Olegosx/PolyMoney2/git/trees/4676701a7bd51c3534ac05d2592c9d69d2cbbddc"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Olegosx/PolyMoney2/git/commits/7d564a0df0723547e7902b947eb938099d7a8896","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/188755011?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Olegosx/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Olegosx/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Olegosx/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Olegosx/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Olegosx","id":188755011,"login":"Olegosx","node_id":"U_kgDOC0AsQw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Olegosx/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Olegosx/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Olegosx/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Olegosx/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Olegosx/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Olegosx","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Olegosx/PolyMoney2/commit/7d564a0df0723547e7902b947eb938099d7a8896","node_id":"C_kwDOSHIGw9oAKDdkNTY0YTBkZjA3MjM1NDdlNzkwMmI5NDdlYjkzODA5OWQ3YTg4OTY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Olegosx/PolyMoney2/commit/99e1854492d524506a309515947de28458e7366a","sha":"99e1854492d524506a309515947de28458e7366a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Olegosx/PolyMoney2/commits/99e1854492d524506a309515947de28458e7366a"}],"sha":"7d564a0df0723547e7902b947eb938099d7a8896","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Olegosx/PolyMoney2/commits/7d564a0df0723547e7902b947eb938099d7a8896"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/188755011?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Olegosx/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Olegosx/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Olegosx/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Olegosx/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Olegosx","id":188755011,"login":"Olegosx","node_id":"U_kgDOC0AsQw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Olegosx/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Olegosx/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Olegosx/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Olegosx/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Olegosx/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Olegosx","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Olegosx/PolyMoney2/commits/99e1854492d524506a309515947de28458e7366a/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-30T17:24:37Z","email":"olegos@vivaldi.net","name":"Olegosx"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-30T17:24:37Z","email":"olegos@vivaldi.net","name":"Olegosx"},"message":"feat(metrics): бэкфил среднего HV завершения маркета из per-market БД (v0.0.152)\n\nУтилита bot.tools.backfill_market_metrics: по строкам market_metrics читает\nindicators_history соответствующих market_<id>.db[.gz] и пересчитывает внешний блок\n(max_move, hv_velocity_avg/accel, hv_short_avg, hv_long_avg) той же\ncompute_external_completion_metrics, что и live-финализация — точное воспроизведение.\nСливает в JSON metrics (Polymarket-метрики не трогает); маркеты без indicators_history\nпропускаются. Запись одной транзакцией, идемпотентна, есть --dry-run.\n\nПрогон на dev (bot-1): 692 строки добэкфилены, 295 без изменений (контроль точности).\nТесты (5): слияние, чтение .gz, идемпотентность, dry-run, пропуск старой БД. 770 pytest,\nruff/mypy чисты. Доку — секция в c4-level-3-components.md.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"1fd551d5f0353c4ac4b497bbd2524a606c7c49e2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Olegosx/PolyMoney2/git/trees/1fd551d5f0353c4ac4b497bbd2524a606c7c49e2"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Olegosx/PolyMoney2/git/commits/99e1854492d524506a309515947de28458e7366a","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/188755011?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Olegosx/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Olegosx/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Olegosx/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Olegosx/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Olegosx","id":188755011,"login":"Olegosx","node_id":"U_kgDOC0AsQw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Olegosx/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Olegosx/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Olegosx/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Olegosx/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Olegosx/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Olegosx","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Olegosx/PolyMoney2/commit/99e1854492d524506a309515947de28458e7366a","node_id":"C_kwDOSHIGw9oAKDk5ZTE4NTQ0OTJkNTI0NTA2YTMwOTUxNTk0N2RlMjg0NThlNzM2NmE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Olegosx/PolyMoney2/commit/0201269ec7e3e4d740f1364840e2557cf3391de4","sha":"0201269ec7e3e4d740f1364840e2557cf3391de4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Olegosx/PolyMoney2/commits/0201269ec7e3e4d740f1364840e2557cf3391de4"}],"sha":"99e1854492d524506a309515947de28458e7366a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Olegosx/PolyMoney2/commits/99e1854492d524506a309515947de28458e7366a"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/188755011?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Olegosx/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Olegosx/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Olegosx/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Olegosx/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Olegosx","id":188755011,"login":"Olegosx","node_id":"U_kgDOC0AsQw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Olegosx/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Olegosx/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Olegosx/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Olegosx/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Olegosx/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Olegosx","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Olegosx/PolyMoney2/commits/0201269ec7e3e4d740f1364840e2557cf3391de4/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-30T17:01:25Z","email":"olegos@vivaldi.net","name":"Olegosx"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-30T17:01:25Z","email":"olegos@vivaldi.net","name":"Olegosx"},"message":"feat(trade): потолок цены входа мейкера в ручной Triggered Open (v0.0.151, ui-0.0.122)\n\nБот: wire._parse_open_trigger для trigger_maker читает cap (опц., пусто →\nбез потолка) и cap_action (park/cancel/take, валидация → bad_cap_action),\nпрокидывает в OpenTriggerCommand. Для trigger_fak/fixed игнор. Драйвер не\nменялся (потолок уже умел через общий слайдер). Тесты на проброс/игнор/reject.\n\nUI: в карточке Triggered Open при Mode=Maker — поля Price cap (0–1, пусто =\nбез потолка) и On reaching cap (park/cancel/take); dispatchOpenTrigger шлёт\ncap/cap_action (для не-мейкера cap=null). OpenTriggerCommandPayload расширен.\n\nПротокол bot-frontend обновлён. Оркестратор не менялся (trade проксируется\nобобщённо). Раньше эта механика была только в стратегии rider.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"096c0384366e53dc9497e4f316a4794bac7bdc43","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Olegosx/PolyMoney2/git/trees/096c0384366e53dc9497e4f316a4794bac7bdc43"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Olegosx/PolyMoney2/git/commits/0201269ec7e3e4d740f1364840e2557cf3391de4","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/188755011?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Olegosx/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Olegosx/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Olegosx/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Olegosx/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Olegosx","id":188755011,"login":"Olegosx","node_id":"U_kgDOC0AsQw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Olegosx/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Olegosx/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Olegosx/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Olegosx/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Olegosx/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Olegosx","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Olegosx/PolyMoney2/commit/0201269ec7e3e4d740f1364840e2557cf3391de4","node_id":"C_kwDOSHIGw9oAKDAyMDEyNjllYzdlM2U0ZDc0MGYxMzY0ODQwZTI1NTdjZjMzOTFkZTQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Olegosx/PolyMoney2/commit/51c2263d3fc5c83f19ab5e5ae096906124526ec2","sha":"51c2263d3fc5c83f19ab5e5ae096906124526ec2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Olegosx/PolyMoney2/commits/51c2263d3fc5c83f19ab5e5ae096906124526ec2"}],"sha":"0201269ec7e3e4d740f1364840e2557cf3391de4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Olegosx/PolyMoney2/commits/0201269ec7e3e4d740f1364840e2557cf3391de4"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/188755011?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Olegosx/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Olegosx/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Olegosx/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Olegosx/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Olegosx","id":188755011,"login":"Olegosx","node_id":"U_kgDOC0AsQw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Olegosx/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Olegosx/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Olegosx/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Olegosx/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Olegosx/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Olegosx","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Olegosx/PolyMoney2/commits/51c2263d3fc5c83f19ab5e5ae096906124526ec2/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-30T11:16:16Z","email":"olegos@vivaldi.net","name":"Olegosx"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-30T11:16:16Z","email":"olegos@vivaldi.net","name":"Olegosx"},"message":"feat(ui): индикаторы — карточная разбивка как у параметров стратегии (ui-0.0.121)\n\nIndicatorsEditor: каждая секция-индикатор — отдельная карточка-блок\n(рамка из переменных темы, без тени), подгруппы внутри с малыми\nзаголовками. Было — плоские заголовки-текст.\n\nОбщее вынесено и переиспользуется обоими редакторами:\n- formBlock.module.css (.block) — стиль карточки-блока (из удалённого\n  ParamsEditor.module.css);\n- FieldRows (fields.tsx) — рендер полей секции (inlineRuns + Group grow\n  + Apply); значение/применение/доступность через колбэки (плоский\n  params у стратегии, путь в bot_config у индикаторов).\nParamsEditor переведён на общие части — дублирование убрано.\n\nБот/оркестратор/протокол не затронуты.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"7b3caabe768e22c3d3af9b3a2c9d403dacf73a51","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Olegosx/PolyMoney2/git/trees/7b3caabe768e22c3d3af9b3a2c9d403dacf73a51"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Olegosx/PolyMoney2/git/commits/51c2263d3fc5c83f19ab5e5ae096906124526ec2","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/188755011?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Olegosx/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Olegosx/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Olegosx/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Olegosx/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Olegosx","id":188755011,"login":"Olegosx","node_id":"U_kgDOC0AsQw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Olegosx/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Olegosx/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Olegosx/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Olegosx/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Olegosx/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Olegosx","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Olegosx/PolyMoney2/commit/51c2263d3fc5c83f19ab5e5ae0969061245