Скрипт и README покрывают новые службы во всех\nкомандах (start/stop/restart/status/logs/deploy).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"f438c1f302a08de4e29c17a7e7be8679e9aade99","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Olegosx/PolyMoney2/git/trees/f438c1f302a08de4e29c17a7e7be8679e9aade99"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Olegosx/PolyMoney2/git/commits/6089f3f903dd8df9a9f2acc1dc2d70cc5a9c999f","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/188755011?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Olegosx/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Olegosx/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Olegosx/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Olegosx/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Olegosx","id":188755011,"login":"Olegosx","node_id":"U_kgDOC0AsQw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Olegosx/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Olegosx/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Olegosx/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Olegosx/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Olegosx/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Olegosx","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Olegosx/PolyMoney2/commit/6089f3f903dd8df9a9f2acc1dc2d70cc5a9c999f","node_id":"C_kwDOSHIGw9oAKDYwODlmM2Y5MDNkZDhkZjlhOWYyYWNjMWRjMmQ3MGNjNWE5Yzk5OWY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Olegosx/PolyMoney2/commit/c5b1c974f433979e8d1d9621edb33e573b447ed6","sha":"c5b1c974f433979e8d1d9621edb33e573b447ed6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Olegosx/PolyMoney2/commits/c5b1c974f433979e8d1d9621edb33e573b447ed6"}],"sha":"6089f3f903dd8df9a9f2acc1dc2d70cc5a9c999f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Olegosx/PolyMoney2/commits/6089f3f903dd8df9a9f2acc1dc2d70cc5a9c999f"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/188755011?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Olegosx/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Olegosx/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Olegosx/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Olegosx/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Olegosx","id":188755011,"login":"Olegosx","node_id":"U_kgDOC0AsQw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Olegosx/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Olegosx/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Olegosx/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Olegosx/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Olegosx/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Olegosx","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Olegosx/PolyMoney2/commits/c5b1c974f433979e8d1d9621edb33e573b447ed6/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-30T01:22:35Z","email":"olegos@vivaldi.net","name":"Olegosx"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-30T01:22:35Z","email":"olegos@vivaldi.net","name":"Olegosx"},"message":"feat(ui): rider — порядок в форме параметров + общие механизмы формы (ui-0.0.120)\n\nФорма rider на Settings разложена по блокам-карточкам: Entry mode →\nEntry size → Entry window → Entry price range → Stop-loss → SL window.\nГруппа с заголовком — отдельная карточка (рамка из переменных темы,\nбез тени), общее пояснение блока (groupHelp) под заголовком.\n\nОбщие механизмы формы (для любой стратегии/индикаторов):\n- inline-поля: компактная ячейка (label сверху), соседние — в одну\n  строку равными колонками (inlineRuns + Group grow);\n- enabledWhen: дизейбл подчинённого поля по применённому значению\n  ведущего (cap_action — лишь для maker; стоп-лосс — лишь sl_kind≠none);\n- дропдауны (enum) применяются по кнопке Apply, не сразу при выборе;\n- единая ширина контролов CONTROL_WIDTH (вертикальное выравнивание).\n\nБот/оркестратор/протокол не затронуты (форма — разметка на фронте).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"6110fc8dce78f5d128208f46dc3ab3ac75ee60c5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Olegosx/PolyMoney2/git/trees/6110fc8dce78f5d128208f46dc3ab3ac75ee60c5"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Olegosx/PolyMoney2/git/commits/c5b1c974f433979e8d1d9621edb33e573b447ed6","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/188755011?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Olegosx/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Olegosx/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Olegosx/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Olegosx/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Olegosx","id":188755011,"login":"Olegosx","node_id":"U_kgDOC0AsQw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Olegosx/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Olegosx/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Olegosx/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Olegosx/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Olegosx/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Olegosx","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Olegosx/PolyMoney2/commit/c5b1c974f433979e8d1d9621edb33e573b447ed6","node_id":"C_kwDOSHIGw9oAKGM1YjFjOTc0ZjQzMzk3OWU4ZDFkOTYyMWVkYjMzZTU3M2I0NDdlZDY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Olegosx/PolyMoney2/commit/c9fe4c2daeb87a1835fdd02ed7e56f13a14351ac","sha":"c9fe4c2daeb87a1835fdd02ed7e56f13a14351ac","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Olegosx/PolyMoney2/commits/c9fe4c2daeb87a1835fdd02ed7e56f13a14351ac"}],"sha":"c5b1c974f433979e8d1d9621edb33e573b447ed6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Olegosx/PolyMoney2/commits/c5b1c974f433979e8d1d9621edb33e573b447ed6"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/188755011?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Olegosx/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Olegosx/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Olegosx/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Olegosx/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Olegosx","id":188755011,"login":"Olegosx","node_id":"U_kgDOC0AsQw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Olegosx/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Olegosx/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Olegosx/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Olegosx/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Olegosx/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Olegosx","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Olegosx/PolyMoney2/commits/c9fe4c2daeb87a1835fdd02ed7e56f13a14351ac/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-30T00:11:35Z","email":"olegos@vivaldi.net","name":"Olegosx"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-30T00:11:35Z","email":"olegos@vivaldi.net","name":"Olegosx"},"message":"feat(backtest): подграфик метрик завершения под кривой капитала (v0.0.150, ui-0.0.119)\n\nБот: read-only query market_metrics (окно from/to по trading_ends_at →\n{markets}) — оконная выборка метрик завершения из bot.db, покрывает любой\nпрогон бектеста (в т.ч. старше живого окна bot_market_metrics).\ndb.market_metrics_window + ветка query._db_query_data (фоном, bad_window),\nтесты на чтение и ветку запроса.\n\nUI: обёртка BacktestEquity над BacktestChart (общая для живого результата\nи истории) — под кривой капитала чекбокс Show metrics (дефолт off) +\nрадиокнопки выбора метрики. Запрос market_metrics уходит лениво, только по\nвключению; ответ фильтруется на рынки прогона по market_id. Нижняя панель\nBacktestChart (addPane) рисует метрику на оси времени баланса; линия/\nгистограмма и подписи из METRIC_GROUPS. orchestrator.clearQueryResult\nчистит слот при выкл/смене прогона/размонтировании.\n\nОркестратор не менялся (query/query_result проксируются обобщённо).\nПротокол-док обновлён.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"947e08b1654f9c63560703fe81b793446737f639","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Olegosx/PolyMoney2/git/trees/947e08b1654f9c63560703fe81b793446737f639"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Olegosx/PolyMoney2/git/commits/c9fe4c2daeb87a1835fdd02ed7e56f13a14351ac","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/188755011?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Olegosx/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Olegosx/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Olegosx/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Olegosx/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Olegosx","id":188755011,"login":"Olegosx","node_id":"U_kgDOC0AsQw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Olegosx/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Olegosx/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Olegosx/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Olegosx/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Olegosx/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Olegosx","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Olegosx/PolyMoney2/commit/c9fe4c2daeb87a1835fdd02ed7e56f13a14351ac","node_id":"C_kwDOSHIGw9oAKGM5ZmU0Y