,"gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Olegosx/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Olegosx","id":188755011,"login":"Olegosx","node_id":"U_kgDOC0AsQw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Olegosx/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Olegosx/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Olegosx/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Olegosx/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Olegosx/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Olegosx","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Olegosx/PolyMoney2/commits/66e4d97b1e417fa259343fa567af48827573a15d/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-29T21:33:31Z","email":"olegos@vivaldi.net","name":"Olegosx"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-29T21:33:31Z","email":"olegos@vivaldi.net","name":"Olegosx"},"message":"fix(strategy): rider — потолок мейкера = entry_high, один верхний уровень (v0.0.149)\n\nОтдельный open_cap дублировал верхнюю границу диапазона entry_high (Upper\ngate). При open_cap < entry_low режим park прижимал цену входа вниз к\nпотолку (min(best_ask−tick, cap)) и ставил лимитку под рынком — на\nбэктесте это давало вход YES по 0.15 при триггере 0.70 (фаворит уже\nразвернулся) с мгновенным стоп-аутом.\n\nУбрали лишний уровень: потолок trigger_maker = entry_high (≥1.0 — гейт\nвыключен → без потолка). entry_high по определению выше entry_low,\nпоэтому цена входа под рынок физически не уезжает. Параметр действия\nпереименован open_cap_action → cap_action (срабатывает на entry_high;\npark/cancel/take, default park).\n\nОбщий механизм слайдера (_Leg.price_bound/bound_action,\nOpenTriggerCommand.cap/cap_action) не менялся — менялся только источник\nпотолка в плагине. config.example.json: убран open_cap,\nopen_cap_action → cap_action.\n\nТесты: потолок = entry_high; регресс «потолок > триггера» (нет налива\nпод рынком); гейт off → без потолка; проброс/дефолт cap_action.\n758 passed, mypy/ruff чисты.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"ec41089bde273b47117f4b20dc89061f42562578","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Olegosx/PolyMoney2/git/trees/ec41089bde273b47117f4b20dc89061f42562578"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Olegosx/PolyMoney2/git/commits/66e4d97b1e417fa259343fa567af48827573a15d","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/188755011?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Olegosx/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Olegosx/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Olegosx/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Olegosx/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Olegosx","id":188755011,"login":"Olegosx","node_id":"U_kgDOC0AsQw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Olegosx/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Olegosx/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Olegosx/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Olegosx/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Olegosx/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Olegosx","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Olegosx/PolyMoney2/commit/66e4d97b1e417fa259343fa567af48827573a15d","node_id":"C_kwDOSHIGw9oAKDY2ZTRkOTdiMWU0MTdmYTI1OTM0M2ZhNTY3YWY0ODgyNzU3M2ExNWQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Olegosx/PolyMoney2/commit/e6f5ddf73e80faab33424c9ec0339ea30b5554e6","sha":"e6f5ddf73e80faab33424c9ec0339ea30b5554e6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Olegosx/PolyMoney2/commits/e6f5ddf73e80faab33424c9ec0339ea30b5554e6"}],"sha":"66e4d97b1e417fa259343fa567af48827573a15d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Olegosx/PolyMoney2/commits/66e4d97b1e417fa259343fa567af48827573a15d"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/188755011?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Olegosx/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Olegosx/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Olegosx/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Olegosx/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Olegosx","id":188755011,"login":"Olegosx","node_id":"U_kgDOC0AsQw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Olegosx/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Olegosx/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Olegosx/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Olegosx/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Olegosx/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Olegosx","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Olegosx/PolyMoney2/commits/e6f5ddf73e80faab33424c9ec0339ea30b5554e6/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-29T20:28:41Z","email":"olegos@vivaldi.net","name":"Olegosx"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-29T20:28:41Z","email":"olegos@vivaldi.net","name":"Olegosx"},"message":"feat(ui): rider — поля потолка цены входа мейкера (ui-0.0.116)\n\nПод бот v0.0.148: в схему формы rider добавлены open_cap (number, цена;\nпусто → без потолка) и open_cap_action (enum: park / cancel / take).\nПодсказки поясняют, что поля действуют только для trigger_maker и задают\nреакцию при достижении потолка. Правка шлёт control как и прочие params.\ntypecheck/lint/build чисты.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"247e87e34e287e30911f0568b01b6582c88a5d40","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Olegosx/PolyMoney2/git/trees/247e87e34e287e30911f0568b01b6582c88a5d40"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Olegosx/PolyMoney2/git/commits/e6f5ddf73e80faab33424c9ec0339ea30b5554e6","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/188755011?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Olegosx/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Olegosx/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Olegosx/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Olegosx/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Olegosx","id":188755011,"login":"Olegosx","node_id":"U_kgDOC0AsQw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Olegosx/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Olegosx/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Olegosx/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Olegosx/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Olegosx/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Olegosx","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Olegosx/PolyMoney2/commit/e6f5ddf73e80faab33424c9ec0339ea30b5554e6","node_id":"C_kwDOSHIGw9oAKGU2ZjVkZGY3M2U4MGZhYWIzMzQyNGM5ZWMwMzM5ZWEzMGI1NTU0ZTY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Olegosx/PolyMoney2/commit/bea1029b5e9597456c1cea3ab0b7707d3a567b41","sha":"bea1029b5e9597456c1cea3ab0b7707d3a567b41","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Olegosx/PolyMoney2/commits/bea1029b5e9597456c1cea3ab0b7707d3a567b41"}],"sha":"e6f5ddf73e80faab33424c9ec0339ea30b5554e6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Olegosx/PolyMoney2/commits/e6f5ddf73e80faab33424c9ec0339ea30b5554e6"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/188755011?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Olegosx/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Olegosx/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Olegosx/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Olegosx/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Olegosx","id":188755011,"login":"Olegosx","node_id":"U_kgDOC0AsQw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Olegosx/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Olegosx/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Olegosx/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Olegosx/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Olegosx/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Olegosx","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Olegosx/PolyMoney2/commits/bea1029b5e9597456c1cea3ab0b7707d3a567b41/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-29T19:16:47Z","email":"olegos@vivaldi.net","name":"Olegosx"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-29T19:16:47Z","email":"olegos@vivaldi.net","name":"Olegosx"},"message":"feat(strategy): потолок цены входа для trigger_maker (v0.0.148)\n\nОпциональный потолок цены для триггерного скользящего мейкера (3.B),\nпо умолчанию выключен. Ограничивает погоню за убегающей ценой и задаёт\nреакцию при достижении потолка. Сделан общим механизмом слайдера\n(переиспользуем будущими мейкер-сущностями), подключён пока к BUY-входу\nrider.\n\nПорог цены ноги: _Leg.price_bound (BUY потолок / SELL пол) +\n_Leg.bound_action (park/cancel/take), по умолчанию None/park → инертны.\nLimitMakerDriver: park — кламп в _leg_target_price (без churn, лимитка\nзамирает на пороге); cancel/take — терминал в _maybe_repost_leg (take\nдобирает остаток тейкером FAK по текущей цене). OpenTriggerDriver._fire_maker\nприменяет действие сразу, если цена уже за потолком. Сущности\nopen-1.B/close/SL.b/SB/TB не затронуты (порог не задают).\n\nOpenTriggerCommand +cap/+cap_action (только trigger_maker). rider-плагин\nчитает open_cap/open_cap_action. config.example.json: ключи в профиль rider\n(потолок выключен).\n\nТесты: кламп/пересечение BUY+SELL, три действия на срабатывании и в слайде,\nпроброс params, регресс мейкера. 756 passed, mypy/ruff чисты. Доки:\nc4-level-3 + execution-matrix.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"d6c6c4b8f3380cac0ffca48a051bf4ee9f2bd7ef","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Olegosx/PolyMoney2/git/trees/d6c6c4b8f3380cac0ffca48a051bf4ee9f2bd7ef"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Olegosx/PolyMoney2/git/commits/bea1029b5e9597456c1cea3ab0b7707d3a567b41","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/188755011?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Olegosx/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Olegosx/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Olegosx/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Olegosx/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Olegosx","id":188755011,"login":"Olegosx","node_id":"U_kgDOC0AsQw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Olegosx/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Olegosx/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Olegosx/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Olegosx/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Olegosx/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Olegosx","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Olegosx/PolyMoney2/commit/bea1029b5e9597456c1cea3ab0b7707d3a567b41","node_id":"C_kwDOSHIGw9oAKGJlYTEwMjliNWU5NTk3NDU2YzFjZWEzYWIwYjc3MDdkM2E1NjdiNDE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Olegosx/PolyMoney2/commit/b7f21e492e4318dc519a3d80f7aff9ec713f3eb7","sha":"b7f21e492e4318dc519a3d80f7aff9ec713f3eb7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Olegosx/PolyMoney2/commits/b7f21e492e4318dc519a3d80f7aff9ec713f3eb7"}],"sha":"bea1029b5e9597456c1cea3ab0b7707d3a567b41","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Olegosx/PolyMoney2/commits/bea1029b5e9597456c1cea3ab0b7707d3a567b41"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/188755011?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Olegosx/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Olegosx/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Olegosx/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Olegosx/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Olegosx","id":188755011,"login":"Olegosx","node_id":"U_kgDOC0AsQw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Olegosx/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Olegosx/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Olegosx/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Olegosx/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Olegosx/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Olegosx","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Olegosx/PolyMoney2/commits/b7f21e492e4318dc519a3d80f7aff9ec713f3eb7/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-29T14:33:13Z","email":"olegos@vivaldi.net","name":"Olegosx"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-29T14:33:13Z","email":"olegos@vivaldi.net","name":"Olegosx"},"message":"feat(ui): rider — поля опционального SL в форме стратегии (ui-0.0.115)\n\nПод бот v0.0.147: в схему формы rider добавлены sl_kind\n(none/absolute/delta/trailing), sl_value, sl_mode (FAK/maker) и\nвременно́е окно SL sl_from_sec/sl_to_sec. Подсказки отражают строгое\nокно (вне окна невыстреливший стоп снимается) и дефолты бота\n(sl_value 0.22, окно 120→0). Блок — зеркало SL у rebound; правка\nшлёт control как и прочие params. Раньше эти params рисовались\nJSON-фолбэком. typecheck/lint/build чисты.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"77bf2273809072c5b097a0192d75734572ea6112","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Olegosx/PolyMoney2/git/trees/77bf2273809072c5b097a0192d75734572ea6112"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Olegosx/PolyMoney2/git/commits/b7f21e492e4318dc519a3d80f7aff9ec713f3eb7","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/188755011?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Olegosx/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Olegosx/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Olegosx/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Olegosx/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Olegosx","id":188755011,"login":"Olegosx","node_id":"U_kgDOC0AsQw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Olegosx/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Olegosx/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Olegosx/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Olegosx/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Olegosx/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Olegosx","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Olegosx/PolyMoney2/commit/b7f21e492e4318dc519a3d80f7aff9ec713f3eb7","node_id":"C_kwDOSHIGw9oAKGI3ZjIxZTQ5MmU0MzE4ZGM1MTlhM2Q4MGY3YWZmOWVjNzEzZjNlYjc","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Olegosx/PolyMoney2/commit/55598a5d74620797cd67da9428de3d6a7535db33","sha":"55598a5d74620797cd67da9428de3d6a7535db33","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Olegosx/PolyMoney2/commits/55598a5d74620797cd67da9428de3d6a7535db33"}],"sha":"b7f21e492e4318dc519a3d80f7aff9ec713f3eb7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Olegosx/PolyMoney2/commits/b7f21e492e4318dc519a3d80f7aff9ec713f3eb7"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/188755011?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Olegosx/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Olegosx/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Olegosx/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Olegosx/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Olegosx","id":188755011,"login":"Olegosx","node_id":"U_kgDOC0AsQw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Olegosx/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Olegosx/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Olegosx/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Olegosx/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Olegosx/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Olegosx","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Olegosx/PolyMoney2/commits/55598a5d74620797cd67da9428de3d6a7535db33/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-29T14:28:40Z","email":"olegos@vivaldi.net","name":"Olegosx"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-29T14:28:40Z","email":"olegos@vivaldi.net","name":"Olegosx"},"message":"feat(strategy): rider — опциональный SL в строгом окне (v0.0.147)\n\nСтоп-лосс после налива позиции строго внутри временно́го окна\nsl_from_sec..sl_to_sec секунд до конца (по умолчанию выключен).\nВ окне взводим один SLCommand (идемпотентно по SL-сущности; watchdog\nпо best_bid — если цена уже ≤ уровня, продаёт сразу). Вышли из окна,\nSL не сработал → снимаем (CancelCommand): «строгое» окно, вне него\nзащиты нет. Переиспользует существующие SLCommand/StopLossDriver/\nCancelCommand — ядро/драйверы/протокол не тронуты.\n\nПараметры (strategy.params, живьём): sl_kind (none/absolute/delta/\ntrailing, default none), sl_value (0.22), sl_mode (fak/maker),\nsl_from_sec (120), sl_to_sec (0). Способ уровня — как у rebound.\n\nКонфиг: ключи в профиль rider в config.example.json (sl_kind=none) —\nповедение по умолчанию неизменно. Pydantic-модель не менялась.\n\nТесты: +8 (взвод в окне / вне окна / выкл / идемпотентность /\nснятие за окном / проброс уровня и режима). 744 passed, mypy/ruff чисты.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"60d3e5bfb4daab475f4e2912208a98ef1e029860","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Olegosx/PolyMoney2/git/trees/60d3e5bfb4daab475f4e2912208a98ef1e029860"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Olegosx/PolyMoney2/git/commits/55598a5d74620797cd67da9428de3d6a7535db33","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/188755011?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Olegosx/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Olegosx/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Olegosx/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Olegosx/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Olegosx","id":188755011,"login":"Olegosx","node_id":"U_kgDOC0AsQw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Olegosx/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Olegosx/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Olegosx/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Olegosx/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Olegosx/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Olegosx","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Olegosx/PolyMoney2/commit/55598a5d74620797cd67da9428de3d6a7535db33","node_id":"C_kwDOSHIGw9oAKDU1NTk4YTVkNzQ2MjA3OTdjZDY3ZGE5NDI4ZGUzZDZhNzUzNWRiMzM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Olegosx/PolyMoney2/commit/da97cc28ceb44fe655348e3f2d9285280bf7a953","sha":"da97cc28ceb44fe655348e3f2d9285280bf7a953","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Olegosx/PolyMoney2/commits/da97cc28ceb44fe655348e3f2d9285280bf7a953"}],"sha":"55598a5d74620797cd67da9428de3d6a7535db33","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Olegosx/PolyMoney2/commits/55598a5d74620797cd67da9428de3d6a7535db33"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/188755011?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Olegosx/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Olegosx/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Olegosx/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Olegosx/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Olegosx","id":188755011,"login":"Olegosx","node_id":"U_kgDOC0AsQw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Olegosx/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Olegosx/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Olegosx/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Olegosx/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Olegosx/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Olegosx","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Olegosx/PolyMoney2/commits/da97cc28ceb44fe655348e3f2d9285280bf7a953/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-29T12:04:38Z","email":"olegos@vivaldi.net","name":"Olegosx"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-29T12:04:38Z","email":"olegos@vivaldi.net","name":"Olegosx"},"message":"refactor(strategy): единая идемпотентность по буферу, общий модуль helpers (v0.0.146)\n\nПосле prime() (v0.0.145) буфер — достоверный источник правды о выпущенных\nдействиях, поэтому параллельные in-memory флаги «я уже сходил» избыточны и\nнеединообразны: rider/rebound гейтили по буферу, swings/delta/snakelet — по\nфлагам (_fired/_armed/_awaiting). Привели всех к одному механизму; попутно\nубрали размноженные копии хелперов (_position_side был в 4 стратегиях).\n\n- helpers.py: канонические запросы к буферу — position_side, has_entity\n  (любое состояние → «уже выпускали»), waiting_ids (pending/active),\n  size_from_params, тип Outcome, константа WAITING.\n- swings/delta/snakelet: убраны _fired/_armed/_awaiting, гейт по\n  has_entity/waiting_ids; delta.DefenseBlock выводит «вилка взведена» из\n  _pre_ids (нужен для идентификации ног OCO). rider/rebound: локальные копии\n  хелперов → общий модуль.\n- Семантика входа не изменилась: терминальные сущности живут в entities до\n  конца рынка → has_entity любого состояния = прежнее «один раз на рынок».\n  grid (лесенка) и probe (process-wide one-shot) — вне слайса.\n- tests: общий make_entity в conftest; тесты идемпотентности переписаны под\n  буфер (имитируют prime); прямой юнит-тест helpers. 736 passed.\n- docs: c4-level-3-components.md — единая идемпотентность + модуль helpers.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"3062e750219428ae96ba45f644c00e3b83ad0fd4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Olegosx/PolyMoney2/git/trees/3062e750219428ae96ba45f644c00e3b83ad0fd4"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Olegosx/PolyMoney2/git/commits/da97cc28ceb44fe655348e3f2d9285280bf7a953","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/188755011?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Olegosx/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Olegosx/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Olegosx/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Olegosx/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Olegosx","id":188755011,"login":"Olegosx","node_id":"U_kgDOC0AsQw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Olegosx/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Olegosx/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Olegosx/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Olegosx/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Olegosx/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Olegosx","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Olegosx/PolyMoney2/commit/da97cc28ceb44fe655348e3f2d9285280bf7a953","node_id":"C_kwDOSHIGw9oAKGRhOTdjYzI4Y2ViNDRmZTY1NTM0OGUzZjJkOTI4NTI4MGJmN2E5NTM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Olegosx/PolyMoney2/commit/8455b318144de0f4db06da326ad29e1f910e2094","sha":"8455b318144de0f4db06da326ad29e1f910e2094","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Olegosx/PolyMoney2/commits/8455b318144de0f4db06da326ad29e1f910e2094"}],"sha":"da97cc28ceb44fe655348e3f2d9285280bf7a953","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Olegosx/PolyMoney2/commits/da97cc28ceb44fe655348e3f2d9285280bf7a953"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/188755011?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Olegosx/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Olegosx/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Olegosx/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Olegosx/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Olegosx","id":188755011,"login":"Olegosx","node_id":"U_kgDOC0AsQw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Olegosx/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Olegosx/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Olegosx/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Olegosx/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Olegosx/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Olegosx","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Olegosx/PolyMoney2/commits/8455b318144de0f4db06da326ad29e1f910e2094/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-29T11:08:12Z","email":"olegos@vivaldi.net","name":"Olegosx"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-29T11:08:12Z","email":"olegos@vivaldi.net","name":"Olegosx"},"message":"fix(strategy): синхронная регистрация сущности prime() — гонка при пачке эффектов (v0.0.145)\n\nТело on_event обрабатывает все эффекты одного WS-сообщения синхронно,\nбез await, поэтому корутина драйвера не успевает записать свою сущность\nв entities. Стратегия, гейтящая вход по наличию своей сущности в буфере\n(а не по in-memory флагу), на каждом следующем эффекте той же пачки\nвидела пустой буфер и повторяла команду — 4-кратный перелив у rider.\nРешение общее для проекта, не костыль под rider.\n\n- drivers.py: EntityDriver.prime() — синхронно публикует pending-снимок\n  TradingEntity через единый writer _commit. Идемпотентен; single-writer\n  не нарушается. Первое касание сущности в драйвере перезатирает снимок.\n- executor.py: вызов driver.prime() перед create_task в обоих путях —\n  launch (плагин) и dispatch_external (фронт). Реестр entity_id→driver\n  по-прежнему заполняет run.\n- tests: регресс на синхронную видимость после launch (до await) и на\n  пачку эффектов → ровно одна сущность / один ордер. 730 passed.\n- docs: c4-level-3-components.md — поток стратегии + жизненный цикл.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"4efd429a6300717e8212a97211e9cdc1c9e5a4e0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Olegosx/PolyMoney2/git/trees/4efd429a6300717e8212a97211e9cdc1c9e5a4e0"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Olegosx/PolyMoney2/git/commits/8455b318144de0f4db06da326ad29e1f910e2094","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/188755011?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Olegosx/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Olegosx/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Olegosx/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Olegosx/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Olegosx","id":188755011,"login":"Olegosx","node_id":"U_kgDOC0AsQw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Olegosx/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Olegosx/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Olegosx/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Olegosx/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Olegosx/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Olegosx","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Olegosx/PolyMoney2/commit/8455b318144de0f4db06da326ad29e1f910e2094","node_id":"C_kwDOSHIGw9oAKDg0NTViMzE4MTQ0ZGUwZjRkYjA2ZGEzMjZhZDI5ZTFmOTEwZTIwOTQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Olegosx/PolyMoney2/commit/8554113ffab695c2d0fd5442d1a59f8f79054f6b","sha":"8554113ffab695c2d0fd5442d1a59f8f79054f6b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Olegosx/PolyMoney2/commits/8554113ffab695c2d0fd5442d1a59f8f79054f6b"}],"sha":"8455b318144de0f4db06da326ad29e1f910e2094","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Olegosx/PolyMoney2/commits/8455b318144de0f4db06da326ad29e1f910e2094"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/188755011?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Olegosx/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Olegosx/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Olegosx/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Olegosx/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Olegosx","id":188755011,"login":"Olegosx","node_id":"U_kgDOC0AsQw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Olegosx/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Olegosx/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Olegosx/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Olegosx/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Olegosx/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Olegosx","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Olegosx/PolyMoney2/commits/8554113ffab695c2d0fd5442d1a59f8f79054f6b/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-29T11:07:48Z","email":"olegos@vivaldi.net","name":"Olegosx"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-29T11:07:48Z","email":"olegos@vivaldi.net","name":"Olegosx"},"message":"feat(ui): rider — форма параметров стратегии в Settings (ui-0.0.114)\n\nРаньше страница Settings рисовала params стратегии rider сырым JSON:\nформа строится по реестру схем (src/strategies/schemas.ts), а записи\nдля rider там не было → срабатывал JSON-фолбэк. Бот-часть (плагин +\nпрофиль) уже была — не хватало только фронтовой разметки.\n\n- src/strategies/schemas.ts: схема формы rider — окно входа\n  (open_from_sec/open_to_sec), триггер entry_low, верхний гейт\n  entry_high (1.0 = выкл), способ входа open_mode (FAK/maker),\n  размер size (shares/usdc). Остальные стратегии не затронуты.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"a92c5b17a19cd1bd64542eaa37499324d7ee81ad","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Olegosx/PolyMoney2/git/trees/a92c5b17a19cd1bd64542eaa37499324d7ee81ad"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Olegosx/PolyMoney2/git/commits/8554113ffab695c2d0fd5442d1a59f8f79054f6b","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/188755011?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Olegosx/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Olegosx/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Olegosx/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Olegosx/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Olegosx","id":188755011,"login":"Olegosx","node_id":"U_kgDOC0AsQw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Olegosx/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Olegosx