Qw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Olegosx/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Olegosx/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Olegosx/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Olegosx/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Olegosx/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Olegosx","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Olegosx/PolyMoney2/commits/5383aa39039dd98d240b6313306933dea4b0d175/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-28T13:18:13Z","email":"olegos@vivaldi.net","name":"Olegosx"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-28T13:18:13Z","email":"olegos@vivaldi.net","name":"Olegosx"},"message":"feat(backtest): проигрывание записанных индикаторов в стратегию (v0.0.142)\n\nРеплей/гарнес не заполняли indicators_external → стратегии-фильтры\n(rebound) не входили, бэктест пустой. Теперь движок берёт записанный\nряд indicators_history из дампа и подаёт его в indicators_external\nпо тикам (carry-forward через _IndicatorTimeline) — стратегия видит\nто же, что видел живой бот. Не пересчитываем (hv с REST-прогревом\nиз дампа не восстановить). Старые дампы без таблицы → пустой ряд.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"2f8290ef9278e03b63fb37439e5413dfe74b7a1b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Olegosx/PolyMoney2/git/trees/2f8290ef9278e03b63fb37439e5413dfe74b7a1b"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Olegosx/PolyMoney2/git/commits/5383aa39039dd98d240b6313306933dea4b0d175","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/188755011?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Olegosx/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Olegosx/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Oleg