6-06-28T12:10:45Z","email":"olegos@vivaldi.net","name":"Olegosx"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-28T12:10:45Z","email":"olegos@vivaldi.net","name":"Olegosx"},"message":"feat(strategy): rebound — фильтр входа по метрике (v0.0.140 · ui-0.0.111)\n\nСлайс 2: вход держится, только пока сигнал ≤ filter_threshold; нет данных\nиндикатора → не входим. Метрики из indicators_external (move_pct, hv_short),\nновых драйверов нет. filter_metric none/max_move/max_move_over_hv_short,\nбегущий максимум move_pct в стратегии, гейт в реконсиляции.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"901f310e40fc84fcd83dd91dbdc3a90cc3180bb5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Olegosx/PolyMoney2/git/trees/901f310e40fc84fcd83dd91dbdc3a90cc3180bb5"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Olegosx/PolyMoney2/git/commits/d581d096e0a913b9a5fbf1a22e6a259e0dbb4256","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/188755011?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Olegosx/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Olegosx/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Olegosx/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Olegosx/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Olegosx","id":188755011,"login":"Olegosx","node_id":"U_kgDOC0AsQw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Olegosx/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Olegosx/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Olegosx/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Olegosx/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Olegosx/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Olegosx","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Olegosx/PolyMoney2/commit/d581d096e0a91