nts{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Olegosx/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Olegosx/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Olegosx/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Olegosx","id":188755011,"login":"Olegosx","node_id":"U_kgDOC0AsQw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Olegosx/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Olegosx/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Olegosx/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Olegosx/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Olegosx/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Olegosx","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Olegosx/PolyMoney2/commits/0e78445356acc6bc8226bea834c210af418fd396/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-28T11:47:46Z","email":"olegos@vivaldi.net","name":"Olegosx"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-28T11:47:46Z","email":"olegos@vivaldi.net","name":"Olegosx"},"message":"feat(strategy): grid — хэдж-защита у резолюции вместо старых защит (v0.0.138)\n\nЗамена защит arm_stop_sec/flatten_sec/max_drawdown на хэдж-механику. Когда\nmid-цена стороны достигает hedge_trigger (рынок практически определился),\nсетка снимается (Cancel живых ступеней/тейков, one-shot) и открывается хэдж\nна победителе. Режимы hedge_mode: lock (докупить до равенства), cover\n(покрыть стоимость остатка), fixed (объём hedge_size), flip (закрыть\nпроигравшего + переложиться), exit (закрыть обе стороны). Закрытие в\nexit/flip — fak или maker (hedge_exit_mode).\n\n- grid/__init__.py: +_side_mid/_held/_winning_side/_cover_size/\n  _hedge_commands/_cancel_resting/_check_hedge; −_drawdown/_kill_commands/\n  _arm_allowed.\n- config.example.json: grid-параметры hedge_*.\n- test_grid.py: тесты под хэдж-механику.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"042b838efec39f2793e9a5d2ab127515dbb1f833","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Olegosx/PolyMoney2/git/trees/042b838efec39f2793e9a5d2ab127515dbb1f833"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Olegosx/PolyMoney2/git/commits/0e78445356acc6bc8226bea834c210af418fd396","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/188755011?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Olegosx/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Olegosx/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Olegosx/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Olegosx/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Olegosx","id":188755011,"login":"Olegosx","node_id":"U_kgDOC0AsQw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Olegosx/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Olegosx/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Olegosx/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Olegosx/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Olegosx/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Olegosx","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Olegosx/PolyMoney2/commit/0e78445356acc6bc8226bea834c210af418fd396","node_id":"C_kwDOSHIGw9oAKDBlNzg0NDUzNTZhY2M2YmM4MjI2YmVhODM0YzIxMGFmNDE4ZmQzOTY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Olegosx/PolyMoney2/commit/84e1fae2a5b66d39f9439b775e4f2689d0159fe4","sha":"84e1fae2a5b66d39f9439b775e4f2689d0159fe4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Olegosx/PolyMoney2/commits/84e1fae2a5b66d39f9439b775e4f2689d0159fe4"}],"sha":"0e78445356acc6bc8226bea834c210af418fd396","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Olegosx/PolyMoney2/commits/0e78445356acc6bc8226bea834c210af418fd396"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/188755011?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Olegosx/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Olegosx/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Olegosx/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Olegosx/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Olegosx","id":188755011,"login":"Olegosx","node_id":"U_kgDOC0AsQw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Olegosx/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Olegosx/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Olegosx/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Olegosx/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Olegosx/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Olegosx","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Olegosx/PolyMoney2/commits/84e1fae2a5b66d39f9439b775e4f2689d0159fe4/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-28T11:43:52Z","email":"olegos@vivaldi.net","name":"Olegosx"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-28T11:43:52Z","email":"olegos@vivaldi.net","name":"Olegosx"},"message":"feat(ui): авто-сторона лимитки на фронте — контрол Auto (v0.0.137 · ui-0.0.109)\n\nСлайс 4 сквозной механики авто-выбора стороны: проводка на фронт уже\nготовой механики бота (слайсы 1-3). Оркестратор не менялся (проксирует\ntrade-команды прозрачно).\n\nБот (v0.0.137):\n- wire._parse_open: outcome=null принимается только для fixed_limit\n  (авто-сторона) → OpenCommand(outcome=None); для fak/maker → отказ\n  outcome_required. Граница wire зеркалит инвариант OpenCommand.__post_init__.\n- test_wire.py: +2 теста (авто-сторона fixed_limit, отказ maker без outcome).\n\nUI (ui-0.0.109):\n- TradingPanel: в карточке Limit Open/Close у поля Side при Open добавлен\n  сегмент Auto → команда open с outcome:null. Close требует явную сторону\n  (Auto только для Open, сброс на YES при переключении).\n- protocol.ts: OpenCommandPayload.outcome → ''YES'' | ''NO'' | null.\n\nДоки: bot-frontend-protocol (open.outcome nullable), ui/README.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"f33d84e2c80dbc1694a1486548e527c8637f254a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Olegosx/PolyMoney2/git/trees/f33d84e2c80dbc1694a1486548e527c8637f254a"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Olegosx/PolyMoney2/git/commits/84e1fae2a5b66d39f9439b775e4f2689d0159fe4","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/188755011?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Olegosx/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Olegosx/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Olegosx/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Olegosx/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Olegosx","id":188755011,"login":"Olegosx","node_id":"U_kgDOC0AsQw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Olegosx/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Olegosx/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Olegosx/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Olegosx/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Olegosx/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Olegosx","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Olegosx/PolyMoney2/commit/84e1fae2a5b66d39f9439b775e4f2689d0159fe4","node_id":"C_kwDOSHIGw9oAKDg0ZTFmYWUyYTViNjZkMzlmOTQzOWI3NzVlNGYyNjg5ZDAxNTlmZTQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Olegosx/PolyMoney2/commit/79b02fb7cdb185f058f2fd6c3d9fefbd25ffe971","sha":"79b02fb7cdb185f058f2fd6c3d9fefbd25ffe971","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Olegosx/PolyMoney2/commits/79b02fb7cdb185f058f2fd6c3d9fefbd25ffe971"}],"sha":"84e1fae2a5b66d39f9439b775e4f2689d0159fe4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Olegosx/PolyMoney2/commits/84e1fae2a5b66d39f9439b775e4f2689d0159fe4"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/188755011?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Olegosx/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Olegosx/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Olegosx/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Olegosx/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Olegosx","id":188755011,"login":"Olegosx","node_id":"U_kgDOC0AsQw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Olegosx/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Olegosx/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Olegosx/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Olegosx/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Olegosx/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Olegosx","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Olegosx/PolyMoney2/commits/79b02fb7cdb185f058f2fd6c3d9fefbd25ffe971/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-28T11:26:44Z","email":"olegos@vivaldi.net","name":"Olegosx"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-28T11:26:44Z","email":"olegos@vivaldi.net","name":"Olegosx"},"message":"feat(strategy): авто-сторона лимитки — динамический переворот до fill (v0.0.136)\n\nСлайс 3 (фаза B), закрывает сквозную механику авто-выбора стороны для\nрежима 2. После постановки лимитки (outcome=None) слежение продолжается:\nпока ничего не исполнено, при сдвиге цены сторона переставляется на более\nблизкую к цене исполнения.\n\n- drivers.py: авто-ветка OpenFixedLimitDriver → _watch_and_flip (вместо\n  _wait_leg, игнорившего PriceTick). На PriceTick, пока filled==0,\n  _flip_target проверяет: другая сторона выставима и строго ближе к\n  limit_price (на сетке тиков = минимум на тик) → _maybe_flip_side снимает\n  ордер (_supersede_leg, точный fill) и переставляет на новую сторону с тем\n  же price (_update_component asset_id + _place_leg). Первый частичный fill\n  фиксирует сторону. Гонка fill-во-время-снятия → переворот отменяется.\n  Общие _slide_leg/_maybe_repost_leg и fixed-ветка не тронуты.\n- test_drivers.py: 3 теста (переворот на близкую, отказ при равных\n  расстояниях, фиксация после частичного fill).\n- Доки: c4-level-3 (подраздел «Динамический переворот»), execution-matrix.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"ca55f5d26e4b8a6c6af087adaf80ea992b028211","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Olegosx/PolyMoney2/git/trees/ca55f5d26e4b8a6c6af087adaf80ea992b028211"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Olegosx/PolyMoney2/git/commits/79b02fb7cdb185f058f2fd6c3d9fefbd25ffe971","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/188755011?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Olegosx/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Olegosx/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Olegosx/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Olegosx/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Olegosx","id":188755011,"login":"Olegosx","node_id":"U_kgDOC0AsQw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Olegosx/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Olegosx/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Olegosx/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Olegosx/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Olegosx/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Olegosx","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Olegosx/PolyMoney2/commit/79b02fb7cdb185f058f2fd6c3d9fefbd25ffe971","node_id":"C_kwDOSHIGw9oAKDc5YjAyZmI3Y2RiMTg1ZjA1OGYyZmQ2YzNkOWZlZmJkMjVmZmU5NzE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Olegosx/PolyMoney2/commit/9e4de9d0a42ed77b8b6abab41347592a494dce67","sha":"9e4de9d0a42ed77b8b6abab41347592a494dce67","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Olegosx/PolyMoney2/commits/9e4de9d0a42ed77b8b6abab41347592a494dce67"}],"sha":"79b02fb7cdb185f058f2fd6c3d9fefbd25ffe971","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Olegosx/PolyMoney2/commits/79b02fb7cdb185f058f2fd6c3d9fefbd25ffe971"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/188755011?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Olegosx/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Olegosx/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Olegosx/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Olegosx/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Olegosx","id":188755011,"login":"Olegosx","node_id":"U_kgDOC0AsQw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Olegosx/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Olegosx/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Olegosx/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Olegosx/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Olegosx/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Olegosx","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Olegosx/PolyMoney2/commits/9e4de9d0a42ed77b8b6abab41347592a494dce67/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-28T10:47:02Z","email":"olegos@vivaldi.net","name":"Olegosx"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-28T10:47:02Z","email":"olegos@vivaldi.net","name":"Olegosx"},"message":"feat(strategy): авто-сторона лимитки — ожидание выставимости и постановка (v0.0.135)\n\nСлайс 2 сквозной механики авто-выбора стороны (фаза A). При outcome=None\nрежим 2 ждёт появления выставимой стороны и ставит фикс-лимитку на ближней\nк цене исполнения. Переворот после постановки — слайс 3.\n\n- commands.py: OpenCommand.outcome → Literal[\"YES\",\"NO\"] | None = None +\n  __post_init__ (None допустим только для fixed_limit; fak/maker → ValueError).\n- drivers.py: OpenFixedLimitDriver база LimitMakerDriver → WatchdogDriver\n  (реюз _watch + _run_single_fixed_leg, как режим 4). _run ветвится: сторона\n  задана → прежнее поведение; None → watchdog (_check_and_fire через\n  _nearest_eligible_side → _fire). Класс перемещён ниже WatchdogDriver.\n  Маршрутизация executor не изменилась.\n- test_drivers.py: 5 тестов авто-ветки (обе/одна/ноль выставимых, ожидание→\n  PriceTick→постановка, валидация outcome=None для fak/maker).\n- Доки: c4-level-3 (подраздел «Авто-сторона фикс-лимитки», ролевая модель\n  ограничена 3.A/3.B), execution-matrix (клетка режима 2 + нюанс стороны).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"80ebf6cad85e8fac5d62b9f6ccbc1440c6d9ad6c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Olegosx/PolyMoney2/git/trees/80ebf6cad85e8fac5d62b9f6ccbc1440c6d9ad6c"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Olegosx/PolyMoney2/git/commits/9e4de9d0a42ed77b8b6abab41347592a494dce67","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/188755011?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Olegosx/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Olegosx/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Olegosx/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Olegosx/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Olegosx","id":188755011,"login":"Olegosx","node_id":"U_kgDOC0AsQw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Olegosx/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Olegosx/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Olegosx/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Olegosx/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Olegosx/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Olegosx","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Olegosx/PolyMoney2/commit/9e4de9d0a42ed77b8b6abab41347592a494dce67","node_id":"C_kwDOSHIGw9oAKDllNGRlOWQwYTQyZWQ3N2I4YjZhYmFiNDEzNDc1OTJhNDk0ZGNlNjc","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Olegosx/PolyMoney2/commit/a879a92d28eb2cfcc422783a8c820e17ba5e4eed","sha":"a879a92d28eb2cfcc422783a8c820e17ba5e4eed","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Olegosx/PolyMoney2/commits/a879a92d28eb2cfcc422783a8c820e17ba5e4eed"}],"sha":"9e4de9d0a42ed77b8b6abab41347592a494dce67","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Olegosx/PolyMoney2/commits/9e4de9d0a42ed77b8b6abab41347592a494dce67"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/188755011?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Olegosx/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Olegosx/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Olegosx/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Olegosx/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Olegosx","id":188755011,"login":"Olegosx","node_id":"U_kgDOC0AsQw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Olegosx/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Olegosx/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Olegosx/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Olegosx/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Olegosx/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Olegosx","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Olegosx/PolyMoney2/commits/a879a92d28eb2cfcc422783a8c820e17ba5e4eed/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-28T10:08:20Z","email":"olegos@vivaldi.net","name":"Olegosx"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-28T10:08:20Z","email":"olegos@vivaldi.net","name":"Olegosx"},"message":"feat(strategy): авто-выбор стороны лимитки — ядро правила (v0.0.134)\n\nСлайс 1 сквозной механики авто-выбора стороны (YES/NO) для лимитки на\nоткрытие, когда сторона не задана командой явно. Только чистое ядро\nправила и юнит-тесты; подключение к драйверу и переворот — далее.\n\n- drivers.py: чистая функция _nearest_eligible_side(quote, yes_id, no_id,\n  limit_price) — среди выставимых сторон (ask > limit_price, пассивный\n  мейкер) ближайшая к цене исполнения (min ask − limit_price), иначе None.\n  Одно правило на три ситуации (ноль/одна/обе выставимые). Модульный\n  хелпер рядом с _midpoint; OpenTriggerDriver (ролевой выбор) не затронут.\n- test_drivers.py: 6 юнит-тестов (ситуации, строгость порога, ask=None,\n  tie-детерминизм).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"28c81b3a6d6e980c91715a092f34c1124df0d203","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Olegosx/PolyMoney2/git/trees/28c81b3a6d6e980c91715a092f34c1124df0d203"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Olegosx/PolyMoney2/git/commits/a879a92d28eb2cfcc422783a8c820e17ba5e4eed","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/188755011?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Olegosx/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Olegosx/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Olegosx/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Olegosx/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Olegosx","id":188755011,"login":"Olegosx","node_id":"U_kgDOC0AsQw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Olegosx/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Olegosx/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Olegosx/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Olegosx/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Olegosx/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Olegosx","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Olegosx/PolyMoney2/commit/a879a92d28eb2cfcc422783a8c820e17ba5e4eed","node_id":"C_kwDOSHIGw9oAKGE4NzlhOTJkMjhlYjJjZmNjNDIyNzgzYThjODIwZTE3YmE1ZTRlZWQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Olegosx/PolyMoney2/commit/2078e8cdd0fa079f38a93dabdf3cb0177ea3f06a","sha":"2078e8cdd0fa079f38a93dabdf3cb0177ea3f06a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Olegosx/PolyMoney2/commits/2078e8cdd0fa079f38a93dabdf3cb0177ea3f06a"}],"sha":"a879a92d28eb2cfcc422783a8c820e17ba5e4eed","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Olegosx/PolyMoney2/commits/a879a92d28eb2cfcc422783a8c820e17ba5e4eed"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/188755011?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Olegosx/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Olegosx/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Olegosx/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Olegosx/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Olegosx","id":188755011,"login":"Olegosx","node_id":"U_kgDOC0AsQw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Olegosx/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Olegosx/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Olegosx/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Olegosx/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Olegosx/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Olegosx","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Olegosx/PolyMoney2/commits/2078e8cdd0fa079f38a93dabdf3cb0177ea3f06a/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-27T21:19:19Z","email":"olegos@vivaldi.net","name":"Olegosx"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-27T21:19:19Z","email":"olegos@vivaldi.net","name":"Olegosx"},"message":"feat(ui): форма параметров grid-стратегии (ui-0.0.108)\n\nВ реестр STRATEGY_SCHEMAS добавлена запись grid — без неё параметры\nстратегии рисовались сырым JSON вместо формы. 8 полей в трёх секциях:\nгеометрия сетки, окно открытия, защиты у резолюции.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"5c830c9c5d876894aa484fee1dc663194658b467","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Olegosx/PolyMoney2/git/trees/5c830c9c5d876894aa484fee1dc663194658b467"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Olegosx/PolyMoney2/git/commits/2078e8cdd0fa079f38a93dabdf3cb0177ea3f06a","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/188755011?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Olegosx/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Olegosx/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Olegosx/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Olegosx/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Olegosx","id":188755011,"login":"Olegosx","node_id":"U_kgDOC0AsQw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Olegosx/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Olegosx/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Olegosx/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Olegosx/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Olegosx/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Olegosx","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Olegosx/PolyMoney2/commit/2078e8cdd0fa079f38a93dabdf3cb0177ea3f06a","node_id":"C_kwDOSHIGw9oAKDIwNzhlOGNkZDBmYTA3OWYzOGE5M2RhYmRmM2NiMDE3N2VhM2YwNmE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Olegosx/PolyMoney2/commit/7788ae3187a4a00409e07d9613dc65de3d374e60","sha":"7788ae3187a4a00409e07d9613dc65de3d374e60","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Olegosx/PolyMoney2/commits/7788ae3187a4a00409e07d9613dc65de3d374e60"}],"sha":"2078e8cdd0fa079f38a93dabdf3cb0177ea3f06a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Olegosx/PolyMoney2/commits/2078e8cdd0fa079f38a93dabdf3cb0177ea3f06a"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/188755011?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Olegosx/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Olegosx/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Olegosx/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Olegosx/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Olegosx","id":188755011,"login":"Olegosx","node_id":"U_kgDOC0AsQw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Olegosx/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Olegosx/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Olegosx/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Olegosx/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Olegosx/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Olegosx","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Olegosx/PolyMoney2/commits/7788ae3187a4a00409e07d9613dc65de3d374e60/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-27T20:58:55Z","email":"olegos@vivaldi.net","name":"Olegosx"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-27T20:58:55Z","email":"olegos@vivaldi.net","name":"Olegosx"},"message":"feat(strategy): сеточная (grid) стратегия — ядро + защиты у резолюции (v0.0.133)\n\nДвусторонняя сетка вокруг базовой линии: держим BUY-лимитки на всех узлах ниже ask (весь диапазон пред-выставлен — гэп нальёт несколько ступеней), на наливе — размерный тейк SELL @ p+x (per-лот), исполнение тейка → рецикл BUY. Реконсиляция идемпотентна, наливы ловятся по терминальным сущностям. Три независимых защиты у резолюции (0=выкл): arm_stop_sec (стоп новых BUY), flatten_sec (Cancel+close), max_drawdown (стоп по убытку); гашение one-shot. Изолированный плагин, новых примитивов в ядре нет — переиспользует open/TP/close/Cancel блока C. +12 тестов, ruff/mypy/pytest зелёные (655).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"d3347f27e05cd99b043bf831d38fc13f3d5d1c3b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Olegosx/PolyMoney2/git/trees/d3347f27e05cd99b043bf831d38fc13f3d5d1c3b"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Olegosx/PolyMoney2/git/commits/7788ae3187a4a00409e07d9613dc65de3d374e60","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/188755011?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Olegosx/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Olegosx/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Olegosx/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Olegosx/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Olegosx","id":188755011,"login":"Olegosx","node_id":"U_kgDOC0AsQw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Olegosx/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Olegosx/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Olegosx/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Olegosx/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Olegosx/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Olegosx","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Olegosx/PolyMoney2/commit/7788ae3187a4a00409e07d9613dc65de3d374e60","node_id":"C_kwDOSHIGw9oAKDc3ODhhZTMxODdhNGEwMDQwOWUwN2Q5NjEzZGM2NWRlM2QzNzRlNjA","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Olegosx/PolyMoney2/commit/894c69515d8182977b301d705942baee92999515","sha":"894c69515d8182977b301d705942baee92999515","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Olegosx/PolyMoney2/commits/894c69515d8182977b301d705942baee92999515"}],"sha":"7788ae3187a4a00409e07d9613dc65de3d374e60","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Olegosx/PolyMoney2/commits/7788ae3187a4a00409e07d9613dc65de3d374e60"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/188755011?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Olegosx/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Olegosx/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Olegosx/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Olegosx/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Olegosx","id":188755011,"login":"Olegosx","node_id":"U_kgDOC0AsQw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Olegosx/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Olegosx/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Olegosx/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Olegosx/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Olegosx/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Olegosx","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Olegosx/PolyMoney2/commits/894c69515d8182977b301d705942baee92999515/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-27T19:42:41Z","email":"olegos@vivaldi.net","name":"Olegosx"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-27T19:42:41Z","email":"olegos@vivaldi.net","name":"Olegosx"},"message":"feat(strategy): размерный выход TP/close — опциональный requested_size (v0.0.131)\n\nTPCommand/CloseCommand получили необязательное поле requested_size: None → вся позиция (старое поведение), задан → продаём столько (клампится к позиции, оверселл недопустим). Общий помощник _resolve_sell_size проброшен в TakeProfitDriver и три close-драйвера. Слайс 1 сеточной стратегии: мульти-лотовым стратегиям нужен per-лотовый выход. Обратносовместимо, ядро не знает деталей стратегии. +5 тестов, ruff/mypy/pytest зелёные (643).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"1436afa6a2748cd8937c7e974e937e55160fcda8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Olegosx/PolyMoney2/git/trees/1436afa6a2748cd8937c7e974e937e55160fcda8"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Olegosx/PolyMoney2/git/commits/894c69515d8182977b301d705942baee92999515","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/188755011?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Olegosx/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Olegosx/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Olegosx/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Olegosx/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Olegosx","id":188755011,"login":"Olegosx","node_id":"U_kgDOC0AsQw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Olegosx/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Olegosx/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Olegosx/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Olegosx/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Olegosx/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Olegosx","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Olegosx/PolyMoney2/commit/894c69515d8182977b301d705942baee92999515","node_id":"C_kwDOSHIGw9oAKDg5NGM2OTUxNWQ4MTgyOTc3YjMwMWQ3MDU5NDJiYWVlOTI5OTk1MTU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Olegosx/PolyMoney2/commit/1666d40b0eb200f55a968331bb535b2715650e98","sha":"1666d40b0eb200f55a968331bb535b2715650e98","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Olegosx/PolyMoney2/commits/1666d40b0eb200f55a968331bb535b2715650e98"}],"sha":"894c69515d8182977b301d705942baee92999515","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Olegosx/PolyMoney2/commits/894c69515d8182977b301d705942baee92999515"},{"author":{"avatar_ur