github.com/users/Olegosx/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Olegosx/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Olegosx/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Olegosx","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Olegosx/PolyMoney2/commits/1eedb20db6311acd194f66ad0d4b945bc5ded2a3/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-27T16:53:18Z","email":"olegos@vivaldi.net","name":"Olegosx"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-27T16:53:18Z","email":"olegos@vivaldi.net","name":"Olegosx"},"message":"chore(config): убрать мёртвое поле trading.limit_offset_ticks (v0.0.129 · ui-0.0.107)\n\nПоле объявлялось обязательным в TradingConfig, входило в whitelist control и\nимело редактор на Settings, но ни один драйвер его не читал (мейкер хардкодит\nbest_ask − 1 тик). Решение из docs/block-c-backlog.md п.3, вариант «б».\n\n- bot: удалено из config.py / control.py whitelist / config.example.json;\n  тесты на поле сняты (покрытие int/bad_value остаётся на indicators/enum/bool);\n  __init__.py выровнен с pyproject (0.0.127 → 0.0.129).\n- ui: убран редактор поля в BotSettings.tsx (NumberInput + Apply + draft).\n- orchestrator: без bump — только docstring + тестовые словари (trading opaque).\n- docs: закрыт п.3 backlog, вычищены активные ссылки, история не переписана.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"cfd722d4a05a241e2d9194e1f452cfa064e886fe","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Olegosx/PolyMoney2/git/trees/cfd722d4a05a241e2d9194e1f452cfa064e886fe"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Olegosx/PolyMoney2/git/commits/1eedb20db6311acd194f66ad0d4b945bc5ded2a3","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/188755011?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Olegosx/events{/privacy}","