y persistence\n- Links to npm, MCP Market\n\nGraphify section:\n- Expanded to 25 languages (was 20)\n- Added wiki export, auto-sync, vision support, Leiden clustering\n- 71.5x fewer tokens per query, privacy-first local processing\n- Cross-IDE support for 9 tools\n\nLLM Wiki section:\n- Added Karpathy''s compilation vs retrieval insight\n- Expanded vault structure with log.md, overview.md, sources/\n- Added sync operation, key principles\n- Explained why LLMs excel at wiki maintenance\n\nHallucination Prevention:\n- Expanded to triple-layer stack (Guardrails AI + NeMo + DeepEval)\n- Added Cleanlab TLM trustworthiness scoring\n- 71-89% hallucination reduction, 50-200ms latency\n- PII detection, drift monitoring, validator caching\n\nMCP section (new):\n- 5,000+ servers available across 14 categories\n- Portable across Claude Code, Cursor, Windsurf\n\nFree Toolchain:\n- Expanded from 21 to 30 tools with savings column\n- Added Flux CD, Authentik, OpenSearch, n8n, Ollama, vLLM, LiteLLM\n- Total savings: $5,000+/mo\n\nDocker Compose:\n- Added profiles (monitoring, ai)\n- Added Prometheus, Grafana, Ollama services\n- Hot-reload tip\n\nToken Setup:\n- Expanded to 8 model provider tokens with descriptions\n- Added xAI, DeepSeek, Mistral, Cohere, OpenRouter, Groq\n- Separated into Required / Model Providers / Services","tree":{"sha":"1ccec56fceab38a90f383f676e6436bca29c5e0f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ufo1991/citadel-saas-factory/git/trees/1ccec56fceab38a90f383f676e6436bca29c5e0f"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ufo1991/citadel-saas-factory/git/commits/b788a4e4034ba346b1e591bfc5b81a71ac1f52c2","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/240358319?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/oks-citadel/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/oks-citadel/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/use