rl":"https://api.github.com/repos/ufo1991/citadel-saas-factory/commits/529624c3dd33de57d5ea313f555ebe3fce9f996c/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-17T16:47:31Z","email":"citadelcloudmanagement@gmail.com","name":"Citadel"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-17T16:47:31Z","email":"citadelcloudmanagement@gmail.com","name":"Citadel"},"message":"feat: add multi-model routing, cross-IDE configs, and executable bootstrap harness\n\nIntegrate the Cursor/Antigravity Universal Reference and Universal\nAgentification Prompt into the repo as executable infrastructure.\n\nMulti-model system:\n- models/ with catalog (9 providers, 25+ models), tier-based routing\n  (7 tiers with fallback chains), embeddings, rerankers, vision configs\n- agents/providers/ for Anthropic, OpenAI, Google, OpenRouter, Ollama\n- agents/router/ for tier-based model selection with cost controls\n\nCross-IDE support (12 tools):\n- AGENTS.md (Codex/Jules/Factory), GEMINI.md, AGENT.md (Cursor)\n- .cursor/ rules, MCP, settings\n- .github/copilot-instructions.md + copilot-setup-steps.yml\n- .antigravity/ rules, agent-manager, artifacts config\n- .windsurf/, .continue/, .codex/, .devin/, .jules/, .factory/\n- .coderabbit.yml, .codegen/, .daytona/, openhands/, e2b/\n\nBootstrap harness:\n- scripts/parallel-bootstrap.sh — parallel install entry point\n- scripts/install-models.sh, install-mcp.sh, install-hooks.sh\n- scripts/detect-business.sh — auto-detect vertical/stack/compliance\n- scripts/render-agents.sh — sync agents to Cursor + Antigravity formats\n- Justfile + lefthook.yml for task running and git hooks\n\nInfrastructure:\n- mcp/registry.yaml — 40+ MCP servers cataloged\n- subagents/catalog.yaml — 21 parallel worker definitions\n- tools/catalog.yaml — tool registry by category\n- evals/ — promptfoo + deepeval evaluation framework\n- indexing/ — indexing stack config\n- networks/ — agent protocols, mesh, service discovery\n- .github/workflows/ — parallel-agents, claude, eval-models CI/CD\n- docs/references/ — source reference documents\n\nBug fixes applied (19 bugs caught by 3 parallel audit agents):\n- parallel-bootstrap.sh: fix export -f not inherited by xargs, inline\n  task execution in xargs subshells, validate --dry-run arg\n- install-models.sh: use grep -qF for exact model match, remove\n  silent error suppression on ollama pull\n- install-mcp.sh: remove redundant stderr redirect\n- detect-business.sh: fix compliance string concatenation to use array\n  with delimiter join, fix date fallback UTC claim\n- render-agents.sh: escape backslashes in JSON desc, strip newlines\n- verify-install.sh: fix ls|head always-passes check with grep -q\n- lefthook.yml: fix commit-msg hook to use {1} not $1\n- .cursor/mcp.json: fix context7 package name to @upstash/context7-mcp\n- .github/copilot-setup-steps.yml: fix trigger from workflow_dispatch\n  to push for Copilot auto-execution\n- .github/workflows/: add permissions blocks, add BUSINESS_PROFILE.yaml\n  existence check\n- e2b/template.json: remove nonexistent Dockerfile reference\n- models/embeddings.yaml: remove duplicate voyage-code-3 entry\n- agents/providers/ollama.yaml: fix model id format mismatch with catalog\n- AGENT.md: remove nonexistent .cursor/skills/ reference\n- Makefile: add missing .PHONY targets\n- .continue/config.json: fix startUrl to use file:// protocol\n- indexing/results/.gitkeep: create missing output directory","tree":{"sha":"7ca22944724a5b02f258417c5491015596d12711","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ufo1991/citadel-saas-factory/git/trees/7ca22944724a5b02f258417c5491015596d12711"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ufo1991/citadel-saas-factory/git/commits/529624c3dd33de57d5ea313f555ebe3fce9f996c","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/240358319?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/oks-citadel/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/oks-citadel/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/oks-citadel/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/oks-citadel/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/oks-citadel","id":240358319,"login":"oks-citadel","node_id":"U_kgDODlOTrw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/oks-citadel/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/oks-citadel/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/oks-citadel/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/oks-citadel/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/oks-citadel/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/oks-citadel","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/ufo1991/citadel-saas-factory/commit/529624c3dd33de57d5ea313f555ebe3fce9f996c","node_id":"C_kwDOSHR1L9oAKDUyOTYyNGMzZGQzM2RlNTdkNWVhMzEzZjU1NWViZTNmY2U5Zjk5NmM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/ufo1991/citadel-saas-factory/commit/8a7f890f10ba771e629660191c4d02685a2f2e40","sha":"8a7f890f10ba771e629660191c4d02685a2f2e40","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ufo1991/citadel-saas-factory/commits/8a7f890f10ba771e629660191c4d02685a2f2e40"}],"sha":"529624c3dd33de57d5ea313f555ebe3fce9f996c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ufo1991/citadel-saas-factory/commits/529624c3dd33de57d5ea313f555ebe3fce9f996c"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/266169915?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kogunlowo123/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kogunlowo123/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kogunlowo123/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kogunlowo123/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/kogunlowo123","id":266169915,"login":"kogunlowo123","node_id":"U_kgDOD91uOw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kogunlowo123/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kogunlowo123/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kogunlowo123/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kogunlowo123/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kogunlowo123/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kogunlowo123","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ufo1991/citadel-saas-factory/commits/8a7f890f10ba771e629660191c4d02685a2f2e40/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-17T00:08:11Z","email":"kogunlowo@gmail.com","name":"Kehinde Ogunlowo"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-17T00:08:11Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"feat: add autonomous agent backbone, compliance framework, and fix 23 bugs (#2)\n\nAdds a 10-layer autonomous agent backbone (backbone/) that is executable\nwhen cloned — orchestrator, planner, router, state manager, 265-agent\nregistry loader, workflow engine, multi-tier memory, tool registry with\nRBAC enforcement, input/output validation with prompt injection defense,\ndistributed tracing, RBAC governance, safety governor with kill switch,\nand a CLI entry point (python -m backbone run/health/agents).\n\nAdds enterprise compliance framework (compliance/) covering SOC 2,\nGDPR, CCPA, PCI-DSS, ISO 27001, OWASP Top 10, NIST AI RMF, and HIPAA\nwith 5 policy documents, 2 audit checklists, and an automated scanner.\n\nFixes 23 bugs across the backend middleware stack:\n- Implement Prometheus metrics with cardinality protection\n- Implement Redis sliding window rate limiter with proxy-aware IP\n- Implement async JWKS-based JWT auth with TTL cache and key rotation\n- Implement tenant context validation with regex sanitization\n- Register all 7 middleware in correct Starlette execution order\n- Use environment-driven CORS with explicit headers (not wildcard)\n- Add pydantic[email], prometheus-client, redis[hiredis] dependencies\n- Fix 4 CRITICAL security findings (kill switch auth, tool RBAC,\n  approval gate fail-closed, prompt injection bypass via nested data)\n- Fix 5 HIGH security findings (RBAC enforcement, memory path safety,\n  error message sanitization, input validation in agent pipeline,\n  agent registry domain parsing bug)\n\nCo-authored-by: Citadel <citadelcloudmanagement@gmail.com>\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 4.6 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"d79469ce864ec471dfa619bb668d14f50a451211","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ufo1991/citadel-saas-factory/git/trees/d79469ce864ec471dfa619bb668d14f50a451211"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ufo1991/citadel-saas-factory/git/commits/8a7f890f10ba771e629660191c4d02685a2f2e40","verification":{"payload":"tree d79469ce864ec471dfa619bb668d14f50a451211\nparent e5b3862aa3bd26b85ebf043ddcc8447f12ed283c\nauthor Kehinde Ogunlowo <kogunlowo@gmail.com> 1776384491 -0500\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1776384491 -0500\n\nfeat: add autonomous agent backbone, compliance framework, and fix 23 bugs (#2)\n\nAdds a 10-layer autonomous agent backbone (backbone/) that is executable\nwhen cloned — orchestrator, planner, router, state manager, 265-agent\nregistry loader, workflow engine, multi-tier memory, tool registry with\nRBAC enforcement, input/output validation with prompt injection defense,\ndistributed tracing, RBAC governance, safety governor with kill switch,\nand a CLI entry point (python -m backbone run/health/agents).\n\nAdds enterprise compliance framework (compliance/) covering SOC 2,\nGDPR, CCPA, PCI-DSS, ISO 27001, OWASP Top 10, NIST AI RMF, and HIPAA\nwith 5 policy documents, 2 audit checklists, and an automated scanner.\n\nFixes 23 bugs across the backend middleware stack:\n- Implement Prometheus metrics with cardinality protection\n- Implement Redis sliding window rate limiter with proxy-aware IP\n- Implement async JWKS-based JWT auth with TTL cache and key rotation\n- Implement tenant context validation with regex sanitization\n- Register all 7 middleware in correct Starlette execution order\n- Use environment-driven CORS with explicit headers (not wildcard)\n- Add pydantic[email], prometheus-client, redis[hiredis] dependencies\n- Fix 4 CRITICAL security findings (kill switch auth, tool RBAC,\n  approval gate fail-closed, prompt injection bypass via nested data)\n- Fix 5 HIGH security findings (RBAC enforcement, memory path safety,\n  error message sanitization, input validation in agent pipeline,\n  agent registry domain parsing bug)\n\nCo-authored-by: Citadel <citadelcloudmanagement@gmail.com>\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 4.6 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJp4XnrCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAA5C4QADUtpR3ZfDY//lcgRRaRvuck\n4WBKanpZ2a1AyBuHD6wyc5k/MaTPYUJ5ZCgXvl48zRPlfz765XJXIwjLfesh6xAo\nTlRv0+8yDjJ+KPQbWIQHEYuUgryuh5qVTL5beeXBWtVQaA/HJFUphChlQWnBeNhJ\nH1TgqtbTIRXO+LUTp1Wd2izlfaZzYVGmWz1H5i842w+nGECS/Gtg8hB+E5Wg17s1\n/34f2tEhGmlaHqL4wqKKRiqdBLWVtUsbVyYboaTNBV7nWrKZrqgodcdW4nFdxn3u\n79GWt6sysE1F78eaxwQ5veKmgH/d9lkDpx5u5HUHBCQGsmzaO2C5YVbYCpMCQ2go\nIsr9KrjxAOkqdMIIqFTO+NEHEXojDBqAhEivLB3D50HLpUejGoUAgJfku4iSvF6d\nfZSsTojiNZdkCesxowOE4sGntYq2parOt/yZz65afBP0lwTHqeMjuzoDCPqy9ifW\ndfQC6+murFs1N375/i/eCZp1a57XTtVsi2/maDhairLzMDGVtG4gqF2Tg70HtM8J\nDM4p6YMZxZhyxcXGy1l7Oi4NlWcEK8vNyISYfmwqEH5J8SMe6mrg0zbjQJmuaFve\nQKrPmTuBhD4YI7xMAFW5DpXMrp2AvWTXNNcyIB6BwmbnIoHB+/VUonuTwWNQALvc\n0R5yCvD1367snJPMI+ex\n=I34i\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-04-17T00:08:11Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"h