","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/oks-citadel/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/oks-citadel","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ufo1991/citadel-saas-factory/commits/e5b3862aa3bd26b85ebf043ddcc8447f12ed283c/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-14T19:22:08Z","email":"citadelcloudmanagement@gmail.com","name":"Citadel"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-14T19:22:08Z","email":"citadelcloudmanagement@gmail.com","name":"Citadel"},"message":"feat: citadel saas factory v3.0 — 265 agents, 3 LLM engines, obsidian vault, karpathy llm-wiki, starter kit\n\nUniversal Full-Stack SaaS Production Framework.\n\n- 265 autonomous business agents across 15 domains\n- 3 swappable LLM engine backends (paid Anthropic, OpenRouter free, local Ollama)\n- Full .claude/ config: agents, skills, commands, rules, templates, mcp, memory, hooks\n- Obsidian vault with automatic backlinking, graph view, Dataview integration\n- Karpathy LLM Wiki brain memory (raw/wiki/SCHEMA three-layer pattern)\n- Guardrails AI hallucination prevention\n- Graphify codebase knowledge graph integration\n- Ruflo swarm orchestration\n- Infrastructure-agnostic scaffolding (Terraform, Ansible, K3s, Helm, GitOps via ArgoCD)\n- Security toolchain (Kyverno, Falco, Semgrep, Trivy, Sigma, OWASP ZAP)\n- Monitoring (Prometheus, Grafana, Loki, Alertmanager)\n- CI/CD workflows (lint, test, SAST, SCA, secret scan, build, sign, canary deploy, engine bench as artifact-only)\n- docs/strategy.html with all 265 agents individually listed\n- starter-kit/ — deterministic compile-only clone-and-run scaffold\n- $0/month software cost, runs on any Linux with SSH + Docker","tree":{"sha":"0029779db5c501d9b92368c04c0123360d5d6126","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ufo1991/citadel-saas-factory/git/trees/0029779db5c501d9b92368c04c0123360d5d6126"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ufo1991/citadel-saas-factory/git/commits/e5b3862aa3bd26b85eb