:"jdwlabs-agent-bot[bot]","node_id":"BOT_kgDOEuIqig","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jdwlabs-agent-bot%5Bbot%5D/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jdwlabs-agent-bot%5Bbot%5D/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jdwlabs-agent-bot%5Bbot%5D/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jdwlabs-agent-bot%5Bbot%5D/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jdwlabs-agent-bot%5Bbot%5D/subscriptions","type":"Bot","url":"https://api.github.com/users/jdwlabs-agent-bot%5Bbot%5D","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jdwlabs/apps/commits/3b89644150b61985120051cf651b1582879e9702/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-30T04:46:24Z","email":"316811914+jdwlabs-agent-bot[bot]@users.noreply.github.com","name":"jdwlabs-agent-bot[bot]"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-30T06:26:24Z","email":"42048994+jdwillmsen@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Jake Willmsen"},"message":"docs: slim the pr template and fix contributing merge and trailer rules\n\nThe template asked for a type checklist, a test-plan checklist and a\nseven-item checklist, which produced long bodies of unticked boxes that\nrestated the diff. It is now the Why / Needs attention / Risk / Verified\nskeleton as comment hints, with two repo-specific Verified examples.\n\nCONTRIBUTING said to squash-merge, but the repo only allows rebase\nmerges; it told contributors to fill the template completely; it\nhardcoded a Sonnet 4.6 co-author line that agents copied verbatim; and\nits 72-character header limit disagreed with commitlint''s 100.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nAssisted-by: Claude Code:claude-opus-5-5","tree":{"sha":"6eddc76f13ade241d25481a2077cd551fa248913","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jdwlabs/apps/git/trees/6eddc76f13ade241d25481a2077cd551fa248913"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jdwlabs/apps/git/commits/3b89644