":"https://api.github.com/users/jdwillmsen/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/jdwillmsen","id":42048994,"login":"jdwillmsen","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQyMDQ4OTk0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jdwillmsen/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jdwillmsen/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jdwillmsen/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jdwillmsen/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jdwillmsen/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/jdwillmsen","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jdwlabs/apps/commits/b0782958205a5c0ac2947c9a7e1bf445b28c455d/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-30T00:11:51Z","email":"42048994+jdwillmsen@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Jake Willmsen"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-30T03:40:19Z","email":"42048994+jdwillmsen@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Jake Willmsen"},"message":"fix(platform): treat a deleted user''s rejected token as already gone\n\nThe JVM identity service answers 401 to a deleted user''s token where the Go\nservice answers 204, so teardown after a self-delete counted a leak.\nOn 401, log in again: a rejected login means the user is gone, a successful\none retries the deletes with the fresh token. The decision is a pure,\nunit-tested function. The update gate now keeps the user''s password so the\nstored credentials stay valid.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"ee2acbe3babfd071f1a412851b1e78aec9430005","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jdwlabs/apps/git/trees/ee2acbe3babfd071f1a412851b1e78aec9430005"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jdwlabs/apps/git/commits/b0782958205a5c0ac2947c9a7e1bf445b28c455d","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://ava