/jdwlabs/apps/git/trees/581c65c65f1e8537fd38e37cf7c9f05ef57666e4"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jdwlabs/apps/git/commits/6f920f45080c2f8cd24858c27da2072d0e3594b9","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/42048994?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jdwillmsen/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jdwillmsen/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jdwillmsen/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jdwillmsen/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/jdwillmsen","id":42048994,"login":"jdwillmsen","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQyMDQ4OTk0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jdwillmsen/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jdwillmsen/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jdwillmsen/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jdwillmsen/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jdwillmsen/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/jdwillmsen","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/jdwlabs/apps/commit/6f920f45080c2f8cd24858c27da2072d0e3594b9","node_id":"C_kwDOSHTXadoAKDZmOTIwZjQ1MDgwYzJmOGNkMjQ4NThjMjdkYTIwNzJkMGUzNTk0Yjk","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/jdwlabs/apps/commit/422b3eb34d6e597e91932b227817f556df34b58e","sha":"422b3eb34d6e597e91932b227817f556df34b58e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jdwlabs/apps/commits/422b3eb34d6e597e91932b227817f556df34b58e"}],"sha":"6f920f45080c2f8cd24858c27da2072d0e3594b9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jdwlabs/apps/commits/6f920f45080c2f8cd24858c27da2072d0e3594b9"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/42048994?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jdwillmsen/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jdwillmsen/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jdwillmsen/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jdwillmsen/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/jdwillmsen","id":42048994,"login":"jdwillmsen","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQyMDQ4OTk0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jdwillmsen/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jdwillmsen/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jdwillmsen/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jdwillmsen/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jdwillmsen/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/jdwillmsen","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jdwlabs/apps/commits/422b3eb34d6e597e91932b227817f556df34b58e/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-25T00:31:19Z","email":"42048994+jdwillmsen@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Jake Willmsen"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-25T00:49:16Z","email":"42048994+jdwillmsen@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Jake Willmsen"},"message":"build(deps): update vitest to v5\n\nVitest 5 turns up three things the Angular specs got away with on 4:\n\n- It no longer carries mock calls from one test into the next, and five\n  toHaveBeenCalledWith checks in the auth, roles and users service specs\n  had only ever matched a call left over from an earlier test. Each now\n  expects the message its own flushed response produces: \"Sign up\n  successful\", the invalid-submission message for a sign-up 400, and the\n  not-found message for the three 404s.\n- It rejects a vi.mock call that is not at the module''s top level, which\n  is where every vi.mock ends up once the unit-test builder has bundled the\n  spec (Vitest 4 only warned). The dynamic route loader now takes the\n  module-federation runtime through an InjectionToken whose default\n  factory supplies the real loadRemoteModule and setRemoteDefinitions, so\n  production behaviour is unchanged and the spec provides a fake instead.\n- docs/conventions.md says so: no vi.mock in an Angular spec, inject the\n  dependency. The tool specs under tools/ are not bundled and keep theirs.\n\n328 tests in 54 files pass, as before, and all four apps build.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"e4b2a68f14090198a54f9b1d9d84bac36cc4c044","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jdwlabs/apps/git/trees/e4b2a68f14090198a54f9b1d9d84bac36cc4c044"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jdwlabs/apps/git/commits/422b3eb34d6e597e91932b227817f556df34b58e","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/42048994?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jdwillmsen/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jdwillmsen/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jdwillmsen/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jdwillmsen/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/jdwillmsen","id":42048994,"login":"jdwillmsen","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQyMDQ4OTk0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jdwillmsen/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jdwillmsen/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jdwillmsen/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jdwillmsen/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jdwillmsen/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/jdwillmsen","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/jdwlabs/apps/commit/422b3eb34d6e597e91932b227817f556df34b58e","node_id":"C_kwDOSHTXadoAKDQyMmIzZWIzNGQ2ZTU5N2U5MTkzMmIyMjc4MTdmNTU2ZGYzNGI1OGU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/jdwlabs/apps/commit/d8ddcaebe344b8de03294d8b80a017379c603b2d","sha":"d8ddcaebe344b8de03294d8b80a017379c603b2d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jdwlabs/apps/commits/d8ddcaebe344b8de03294d8b80a017379c603b2d"}],"sha":"422b3eb34d6e597e91932b227817f556df34b58e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jdwlabs/apps/commits/422b3eb34d6e597e91932b227817f556df34b58e"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/42048994?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jdwillmsen/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jdwillmsen/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jdwillmsen/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jdwillmsen/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/jdwillmsen","id":42048994,"login":"jdwillmsen","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQyMDQ4OTk0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jdwillmsen/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jdwillmsen/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jdwillmsen/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jdwillmsen/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jdwillmsen/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/jdwillmsen","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jdwlabs/apps/commits/d8ddcaebe344b8de03294d8b80a017379c603b2d/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-25T00:25:15Z","email":"42048994+jdwillmsen@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Jake Willmsen"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-25T00:49:16Z","email":"42048994+jdwillmsen@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Jake Willmsen"},"message":"build(deps): update Angular to 22.2 and hold webpack at 5.110.3\n\nAngular framework packages 22.1.5 -> 22.2.0, the CLI, build and devkit\ntooling 22.1.7 -> 22.2.0, and ng-packagr 22.1.1 -> 22.2.1. None of the\n22.2 package groups ships a migration newer than 22.0.0, so this is a\nversion bump only. The shared util and ui libraries'' own package.json\npins follow, or the dependency-checks lint rule rejects them.\n\n@angular-devkit/build-angular 22.2 depends on webpack 5.111, and on 5.111.0\nand 5.111.1 every module-federation production build fails with\n\n  webpack/runtime/federation runtime - Error: Path variable\n  [contenthash:20] not implemented in this context\n\nIsolated by building container:production with Angular 22.2 against\neach release: 5.110.3 builds, while 5.111.0 and 5.111.1 fail. A pnpm override holds\n5.111.0 and 5.111.1 on 5.110.3; a later webpack installs as declared, and\nthe production builds in CI decide whether it works.\n\nThis is the step that lets Vitest 5 in: @angular/build accepts vitest\n^5 only from 22.2.0.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"dd1f7af1ae7f778607b76f74d4a9cb55baa0d3f1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jdwlabs/apps/git/trees/dd1f7af1ae7f778607b76f74d4a9cb55baa0d3f1"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jdwlabs/apps/git/commits/d8ddcaebe344b8de03294d8b80a017379c603b2d","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/42048994?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jdwillmsen/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jdwillmsen/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jdwillmsen/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jdwillmsen/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/jdwillmsen","id":42048994,"login":"jdwillmsen","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQyMDQ4OTk0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jdwillmsen/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jdwillmsen/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jdwillmsen/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jdwillmsen/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jdwillmsen/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/jdwillmsen","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/jdwlabs/apps/commit/d8ddcaebe344b8de03294d8b80a017379c603b2d","node_id":"C_kwDOSHTXadoAKGQ4ZGRjYWViZTM0NGI4ZGUwMzI5NGQ4YjgwYTAxNzM3OWM2MDNiMmQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/jdwlabs/apps/commit/dfb3fabd141fb54d5e4cd49499cdcda2983ac533","sha":"dfb3fabd141fb54d5e4cd49499cdcda2983ac533","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jdwlabs/apps/commits/dfb3fabd141fb54d5e4cd49499cdcda2983ac533"}],"sha":"d8ddcaebe344b8de03294d8b80a017379c603b2d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jdwlabs/apps/commits/d8ddcaebe344b8de03294d8b80a017379c603b2d"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/42048994?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jdwillmsen/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jdwillmsen/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jdwillmsen/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jdwillmsen/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/jdwillmsen","id":42048994,"login":"jdwillmsen","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQyMDQ4OTk0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jdwillmsen/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jdwillmsen/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jdwillmsen/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jdwillmsen/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jdwillmsen/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/jdwillmsen","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jdwlabs/apps/commits/dfb3fabd141fb54d5e4cd49499cdcda2983ac533/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-24T16:01:16Z","email":"42048994+jdwillmsen@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Jake Willmsen"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-24T16:09:34Z","email":"42048994+jdwillmsen@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Jake Willmsen"},"message":"build(tools): run the tool specs on plain Vitest\n\ntools/release and tools/workspace-checks were the last users of\n@nx/vitest, which caps Vitest at ^4 even in its latest release and so\nholds back the Vitest major. Their test targets now run `vitest run`\nthrough nx:run-commands, and the package is gone.\n\n--root is set explicitly: @nx/vitest pointed Vitest at the project\ndirectory, while plain Vitest resolves include globs from the working\ndirectory, the workspace root, where ''**/*.spec.ts'' would pick up every\nspec in the repo. Vitest then finds vite.config.ts in that root.\n\nrelease-tools keeps the cacheability and dependency-aware inputs it used\nto inherit from the removed @nx/vitest target default; workspace-checks\nstays uncached. The configs import defineConfig from vitest/config rather\nthan the undeclared vite, and drop vite-tsconfig-paths: these specs import\nonly @nx/devkit and relative files, so the plugin resolved nothing.\n\nSame results: release-tools 11 tests, workspace-checks 2, and the latter''s\ncache-input rule passes over the new targets.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"338d346c72752a0aa026c3f26a7d40a3fa616fd2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jdwlabs/apps/git/trees/338d346c72752a0aa026c3f26a7d40a3fa616fd2"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jdwlabs/apps/git/commits/dfb3fabd141fb54d5e4cd49499cdcda2983ac533","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/42048994?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jdwillmsen/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jdwillmsen/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jdwillmsen/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jdwillmsen/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/jdwillmsen","id":42048994,"login":"jdwillmsen","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQyMDQ4OTk0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jdwillmsen/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jdwillmsen/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jdwillmsen/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jdwillmsen/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jdwillmsen/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/jdwillmsen","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/jdwlabs/apps/commit/dfb3fabd141fb54d5e4cd49499cdcda2983ac533","node_id":"C_kwDOSHTXadoAKGRmYjNmYWJkMTQxZmI1NGQ1ZTRjZDQ5NDk5Y2RjZGEyOTgzYWM1MzM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/jdwlabs/apps/commit/c9c2329de5d0e3175e8a89c8dc97add7d63d4d05","sha":"c9c2329de5d0e3175e8a89c8dc97add7d63d4d05","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jdwlabs/apps/commits/c9c2329de5d0e3175e8a89c8dc97add7d63d4d05"}],"sha":"dfb3fabd141fb54d5e4cd49499cdcda2983ac533","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jdwlabs/apps/commits/dfb3fabd141fb54d5e4cd49499cdcda2983ac533"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/42048994?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jdwillmsen/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jdwillmsen/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jdwillmsen/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jdwillmsen/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/jdwillmsen","id":42048994,"login":"jdwillmsen","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQyMDQ4OTk0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jdwillmsen/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jdwillmsen/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jdwillmsen/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jdwillmsen/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jdwillmsen/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/jdwillmsen","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jdwlabs/apps/commits/c9c2329de5d0e3175e8a89c8dc97add7d63d4d05/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-23T06:33:08Z","email":"42048994+jdwillmsen@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Jake Willmsen"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-24T02:18:25Z","email":"42048994+jdwillmsen@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Jake Willmsen"},"message":"build(frontend): run Angular unit tests on Angular''s own Vitest runner\n\nAnalogJS was in the workspace only to let Vitest compile Angular\ncomponents, and its stable releases cap Vitest at ^4, so the Vitest major\ncould not land. Every Angular test target now uses @nx/angular:unit-test,\nwhich delegates to @angular/build''s unit-test builder, and both\n@analogjs packages, the shared Vite config and the per-project\nvite.config.ts and test-setup.ts files are gone. The builder initialises\nTestBed with zone change detection itself because the polyfills list\nzone.js, which is what the removed setup file did by hand.\n\nThe builder only takes its build options from an esbuild application or\nng-packagr target, and here the apps build with webpack for module\nfederation while most libs have no build target. So every test target\npoints at one options-only target, angular-test-host:test-build-options,\ncarrying the polyfills and the SCSS settings the components need; it is\nnever built.\n\nShared settings live in the executor''s targetDefaults: the buildTarget,\nisolate: true (the builder defaults to false, the old runner isolated each\nspec file), watch: false, coverage under coverage/{projectName} where the\nbuilder writes it, and the test host''s files as a cache input. Each tested\nproject lists the host in implicitDependencies, so editing it re-runs\ntheir tests.\n\nTwo behaviours differ from the old runner. The builder refuses a project\nwith no specs, so the five projects without any lose their test target.\nAnd it bundles workspace libraries into the test, so vi.mock cannot\nreplace a @jdw/* import; the one spec that did now asserts on the real\nerror message instead.\n\n@angular/build is declared directly: the executor requires it and it\nwas only resolvable transitively. isolatedModules and the es2016 target\ncome out of the spec tsconfigs; they were there for the Vite transform,\nand the Angular compiler rejects the first alongside decorator metadata\nand overrides the second.\n\nSame result as before: 315 tests in 50 files pass.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"b46677ae451a13ffb3b6e19abbdf36daf2118b29","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jdwlabs/apps/git/trees/b46677ae451a13ffb3b6e19abbdf36daf2118b29"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jdwlabs/apps/git/commits/c9c2329de5d0e3175e8a89c8dc97add7d63d4d05","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/42048994?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jdwillmsen/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jdwillmsen/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jdwillmsen/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jdwillmsen/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/jdwillmsen","id":42048994,"login":"jdwillmsen","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQyMDQ4OTk0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jdwillmsen/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jdwillmsen/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jdwillmsen/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jdwillmsen/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jdwillmsen/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/jdwillmsen","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/jdwlabs/apps/commit/c9c2329de5d0e3175e8a89c8dc97add7d63d4d05","node_id":"C_kwDOSHTXadoAKGM5YzIzMjlkZTVkMGUzMTc1ZThhODljOGRjOTdhZGQ3ZDYzZDRkMDU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/jdwlabs/apps/commit/671c0d0ba868dda3eb0c91eb64b2ef91eb19d8b9","sha":"671c0d0ba868dda3eb0c91eb64b2ef91eb19d8b9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jdwlabs/apps/commits/671c0d0ba868dda3eb0c91eb64b2ef91eb19d8b9"}],"sha":"c9c2329de5d0e3175e8a89c8dc97add7d63d4d05","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jdwlabs/apps/commits/c9c2329de5d0e3175e8a89c8dc97add7d63d4d05"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/42048994?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jdwillmsen/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jdwillmsen/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jdwillmsen/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jdwillmsen/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/jdwillmsen","id":42048994,"login":"jdwillmsen","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQyMDQ4OTk0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jdwillmsen/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jdwillmsen/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jdwillmsen/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jdwillmsen/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jdwillmsen/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/jdwillmsen","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jdwlabs/apps/commits/671c0d0ba868dda3eb0c91eb64b2ef91eb19d8b9/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-23T06:33:05Z","email":"42048994+jdwillmsen@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Jake Willmsen"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-24T02:18:25Z","email":"42048994+jdwillmsen@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Jake Willmsen"},"message":"test(frontend): assert error paths on recorded outcomes and type-check specs\n\nTwenty error-path tests in the roles, users and profiles service specs put\ntheir assertions inside RxJS subscribe callbacks, where they cannot fail\nthe test: RxJS catches what a callback throws and reports it\nasynchronously. In roles and users the callbacks never ran at all, because\nhandleError returns EMPTY, so assertions like expect(error).toBe(EMPTY)\nhad never executed. Each test now records the stream''s values, error and\ncompletion and asserts after the flush: EMPTY-completion for roles and\nusers, the rethrown HttpErrorResponse for profiles. Breaking any of them\nnow fails its test.\n\nThe specs also never went through a type checker. fail() is a Jest global\nVitest does not define, vi.Mock is not a type namespace (Mock from\n''vitest'' is), and a few fakes were typed unknown where Angular and RxJS\nexpect concrete types.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"80c58a18c56bc0e583ac8403baf6d154db7179fe","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jdwlabs/apps/git/trees/80c58a18c56bc0e583ac8403baf6d154db7179fe"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jdwlabs/apps/git/commits/671c0d0ba868dda3eb0c91eb64b2ef91eb19d8b9","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/42048994?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jdwillmsen/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jdwillmsen/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jdwillmsen/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jdwillmsen/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/jdwillmsen","id":42048994,"login":"jdwillmsen","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQyMDQ4OTk0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jdwillmsen/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jdwillmsen/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jdwillmsen/repo