events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pyroblazer/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pyroblazer/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pyroblazer/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/pyroblazer","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/pyroblazer/VelocityClear/commit/bedee846a0d75765db1885b1c3b00e05a509be50","node_id":"C_kwDOSHY9_toAKGJlZGVlODQ2YTBkNzU3NjVkYjE4ODViMWMzYjAwZTA1YTUwOWJlNTA","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/pyroblazer/VelocityClear/commit/a9b294775ce3302d36312fb46f145a3ee9ecc57f","sha":"a9b294775ce3302d36312fb46f145a3ee9ecc57f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pyroblazer/VelocityClear/commits/a9b294775ce3302d36312fb46f145a3ee9ecc57f"}],"sha":"bedee846a0d75765db1885b1c3b00e05a509be50","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pyroblazer/VelocityClear/commits/bedee846a0d75765db1885b1c3b00e05a509be50"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/30342515?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pyroblazer/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pyroblazer/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pyroblazer/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pyroblazer/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/pyroblazer","id":30342515,"login":"pyroblazer","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMwMzQyNTE1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pyroblazer/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pyroblazer/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pyroblazer/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pyroblazer/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pyroblazer/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/pyroblazer","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pyroblazer/VelocityClear/commits/a9b294775ce3302d36312fb46f145a3ee9ecc57f/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-28T07:23:14Z","email":"darkshadow.itm777@gmail.com","name":"pyroblazer"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-28T07:23:14Z","email":"darkshadow.itm777@gmail.com","name":"pyroblazer"},"message":"feat: implement OJK regulatory compliance framework (Phases 1-7)\n\nAdds full Indonesian OJK/POJK compliance coverage across 9 regulatory domains:\n\n1. Data Protection (UU PDP + POJK No.6/POJK.07/2022)\n   - DataClassificationLevel enum (Public→SensitivePII) + DataMaskingService\n   - Field-level masking strategies: Full, Partial, LastFour, Email, Phone\n   - ConsentService with grant/withdraw lifecycle + ConsentRecord model\n   - Seeded DataClassification entries for User PII and Transaction fields\n\n2. KYC/eKYC (POJK No.12/POJK.01/2017)\n   - KycService with full status workflow: InProgress→Verified/Rejected\n   - Simulated liveness detection (0.85–0.99 confidence scoring)\n   - PEP/Sanction screening via Levenshtein fuzzy match on WatchlistEntries\n   - KycProfile with 2-year expiry; WatchlistHitDetectedEvent published on hits\n\n3. AML/CFT (POJK APU-PMT)\n   - AmlRuleEngine singleton with 7 rules: STRUCTURING, VELOCITY_1H/24H/7D,\n     ROUND_AMOUNT, CROSS_BORDER, DORMANT_ACTIVATION\n   - Integrated into RiskEvaluationService.EvaluateAsync — flags appear in RiskEvaluatedEvent\n   - AmlMonitoringService alert lifecycle: Open→UnderReview→Closed/Escalated\n   - SarService with OJK reference numbering (SAR-YYYYMMDD-{UUID8})\n\n4. Maker-Checker / Segregation of Duties (POJK)\n   - ApprovalService enforcing requestedBy ≠ approvedBy at service layer\n   - 24-hour approval expiry; ApprovalRequestedEvent + ApprovalCompletedEvent\n   - AccessControlService with ABAC evaluation and SoD conflict detection\n   - Conflicting role pairs: Maker/Checker, Trader/RiskOfficer, Admin/Auditor\n\n5. Regulatory Reporting (POJK)\n   - ReportingService generating JSON/XML/CSV reports from live ComplianceDbContext\n   - XML uses structured <OjkReport> schema for OJK submission\n   - WormStorageService: write-once Dictionary with SHA-256 integrity hash\n   - 10-year retention tracked via OjkReport.RetentionYears\n\n6. Customer Protection / Complaints (POJK Perlindungan Konsumen)\n   - ComplaintService with 3-level escalation workflow up to OJK referral\n   - 20-business-day SLA enforcement (SlaDeadline = CreatedAt + 28 days)\n   - SlaBreach flag auto-set; ComplaintNote threaded notes\n\n7. Digital Signature (UU ITE & PSrE)\n   - DigitalSignatureService using HMAC-SHA256; PrivyID/VIDA integration-ready\n   - 5-year signature retention; VendorReferenceId field for external linking\n\n8. SOC / Incident Response (POJK IT Risk)\n   - SocService with IncidentSeverity (Low→Critical) classification\n   - SOC dashboard aggregating open incidents by severity\n\n9. DRP/BCP & Cloud Governance (POJK IT Risk Art.28–35)\n   - InfrastructureComplianceService tracking RTO/RPO targets\n   - DataResidencyCheck and VendorAuditEntry models\n\nBackend additions: 11 controllers, 13 services, 17 models, 20 enums,\n8 events, 8 DTOs, 1 EF Core migration (AddOjkComplianceTables)\n\nTests: 62 new unit tests across 12 test files (271 total, all passing)\n\nFrontend: ComplianceDashboardPage, KycPage, ConsentPage + complianceApi.ts\nRoutes added: /compliance, /kyc, /consent\n\nDocs: ADR-010 through ADR-014 + OJK compliance matrix","tree":{"sha":"e7f176b5ea35cd874bd6894d2c8e9628422f63d1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pyroblazer/VelocityClear/git/trees/e7f176b5ea35cd874bd6894d2c8e9628422f63d1"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pyroblazer/VelocityClear/git/commits/a9b294775ce3302d36312fb46f145a3ee9ecc57f","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/30342515?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pyroblazer/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pyroblazer/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pyroblazer/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pyroblazer/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/pyroblazer","id":30342515,"login":"pyroblazer","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMwMzQyNTE1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pyroblazer/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pyroblazer/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pyroblazer/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pyroblazer/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pyroblazer/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/pyroblazer","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/pyroblazer/VelocityClear/commit/a9b294775ce3302d36312fb46f145a3ee9ecc57f","node_id":"C_kwDOSHY9_toAKGE5YjI5NDc3NWNlMzMwMmQzNjMxMmZiNDZmMTQ1YTNlZTllY2M1N2Y","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/pyroblazer/VelocityClear/commit/8467faa1ecf9477a4420c12337111828d4adf892","sha":"8467faa1ecf9477a4420c12337111828d4adf892","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pyroblazer/VelocityClear/commits/8467faa1ecf9477a4420c12337111828d4adf892"}],"sha":"a9b294775ce3302d36312fb46f145a3ee9ecc57f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pyroblazer/VelocityClear/commits/a9b294775ce3302d36312fb46f145a3ee9ecc57f"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/30342515?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pyroblazer/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pyroblazer/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pyroblazer/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pyroblazer/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/pyroblazer","id":30342515,"login":"pyroblazer","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMwMzQyNTE1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pyroblazer/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pyroblazer/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pyroblazer/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pyroblazer/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pyroblazer/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/pyroblazer","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pyroblazer/VelocityClear/commits/8467faa1ecf9477a4420c12337111828d4adf892/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-20T06:32:44Z","email":"darkshadow.itm777@gmail.com","name":"pyroblazer"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-23T06:38:04Z","email":"darkshadow.itm777@gmail.com","name":"pyroblazer"},"message":"feat: implement adaptive real-time financial transaction platform\n\nFull-stack microservices platform with .NET 10 backend, React frontend,\nand Docker-based infrastructure.\n\nBackend:\n- ApiGateway with JWT auth, SSE streaming, request logging (port 5000)\n- TransactionService with EF Core SQL Server CRUD + event publishing (port 5001)\n- RiskService with velocity detection, anomaly flagging, odd-hour scoring (port 5002)\n- PaymentService with authorization rules and payment gateway simulation (port 5003)\n- ComplianceService with SHA-256 hash chain audit logging (port 5004)\n- PinEncryptionService with ISO 9564 PIN blocks, software HSM, ISO 8583 parsing (port 5005)\n- Shared library with models, DTOs, events, interfaces, enums\n- Adaptive Event Bus: CPU-based auto-switching between InMemory/Redis/RabbitMQ/Kafka\n- Distributed backends: Redis Streams, RabbitMQ fanout exchange, Kafka topics\n- Event flow: TransactionCreated -> RiskEvaluated -> PaymentAuthorized -> AuditLogged\n- Swagger UI on all services for interactive API documentation\n\nFrontend (6 React + Vite + TypeScript microfrontends):\n- transaction-ui (port 3001): transaction table, form, KPI cards, live SSE feed\n- admin-dashboard (port 3002): service status, event bus monitoring\n- risk-dashboard (port 3003): risk gauge, pie/line charts, events table\n- audit-dashboard (port 3004): audit stats, hash chain timeline, chain visualization\n- card-operations (port 3005): PIN encryption, ISO 8583, card authorization\n- superapp (port 3000): unified single-page app combining all dashboards\n\nInfrastructure:\n- Docker Compose with SQL Server, Redis, RabbitMQ, Kafka, Prometheus, Grafana\n- Multi-stage Dockerfiles for all backend services and frontend apps\n- Redis as default EventBus backend for cross-service event propagation\n- Prometheus with per-service scrape configs and service labels\n- Grafana with auto-provisioned datasource and dashboard (8 panels)\n\nAPI Testing:\n- Postman collection with 37+ requests covering all 6 microservices\n- Newman CLI runner for automated API testing\n- Docker and Local environment configurations\n- Fix: align PIN Encryption Service section with actual C# API contracts:\n  encryptedPinBlock instead of pinBlock, zpkId instead of keyId, expectedPin\n  instead of pin, isoMessage instead of rawMessage, authorizationId instead of\n  authorizationCode, authorize uses direct fields not ISO message format,\n  deny test PAN uses 4999-prefix blocklist pattern, list keys expects {keyIds}\n  object, pm.environment.set for encrypted_pin_block for Newman scoping\n\nTesting:\n- 108 unit tests covering JWT, risk, payment, audit, event bus, serialization\n- 19 integration tests covering API gateway, transactions, and full event flow\n- 93 frontend component/store tests across all microfrontends with Vitest\n- 22 Playwright E2E tests for transaction-ui covering page structure, data\n  display, form interaction, and error/empty states (all API calls mocked)\n\nCI (GitHub Actions):\n- backend-lint: dotnet format verification\n- backend-unit-tests: 108 unit tests with Cobertura coverage (55% threshold)\n- backend-integration-tests: 19 integration tests\n- frontend-build (matrix x6): build, type-check, lint, and unit test each app\n- frontend-e2e: builds superapp, installs Playwright chromium, runs E2E tests\n- newman-tests: starts all 6 services + SQL Server, runs full Postman collection\n- trivy-scan: filesystem and IaC vulnerability scanning (CRITICAL/HIGH), SARIF upload\n- sbom-generation: CycloneDX SBOM for all .NET dependencies\n\nCode quality:\n- Replace all em dashes with hyphens across files (comments, docs, configs)\n- Exclude infrastructure files from coverage (Program.cs, Migrations, middleware stubs)","tree":{"sha":"1a99d46e08b9145b582856a59b988f59e5b364c7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pyroblazer/VelocityClear/git/trees/1a99d46e08b9145b582856a59b988f59e5b364c7"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pyroblazer/VelocityClear/git/commits/8467faa1ecf9477a4420c12337111828d4adf892","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/30342515?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pyroblazer/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pyroblazer/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pyroblazer/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pyroblazer/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/pyroblazer","id":30342515,"login":"pyroblazer","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMwMzQyNTE1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pyroblazer/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pyroblazer/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pyroblazer/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pyroblazer/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pyroblazer/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/pyroblazer","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/pyroblazer/VelocityClear/commit/8467faa1ecf9477a4420c12337111828d4adf892","node_id":"C_kwDOSHY9_toAKDg0NjdmYWExZWNmOTQ3N2E0NDIwYzEyMzM3MTExODI4ZDRhZGY4OTI","parents":[],"sha":"8467faa1ecf9477a4420c12337111828d4adf892","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pyroblazer/VelocityClear/commits/8467faa1ecf9477a4420c12337111828d4adf892"}],"requestUrl":"https://api.github.com/repos/pyroblazer/VelocityClear/commits?per_page=100&page=1&sha=d796f56f2b14995d4fcb31f6efce457a0be6e0f3&since=2025-03-31T23%3A59%3A59.000Z&until=2026-10-08T15%3A42%3A39.872Z"}');
