https://api.github.com/repos/yashas004/PriorAuth/commits/a18d527d985cef82cfe625719dd8084d395a36d4/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-06T17:30:25Z","email":"yashasyadav04@gmail.com","name":"Yashas"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-06T17:30:25Z","email":"yashasyadav04@gmail.com","name":"Yashas"},"message":"feat: wire full pipeline, swap to Gemini, redesign frontend\n\nBackend:\n- Replace Anthropic/Claude with Google Gemini 2.5 Flash (google-genai SDK)\n  - New gemini_client.py with async generate_content, mock fallback\n  - Updated requirements, env vars, docker-compose defaults\n- Fix FastMCP 3.x API: streamable_http_app() -> http_app(), health routes\n  via Starlette add_route() instead of FastAPI decorator\n- Add fastapi explicitly to all service requirements (missing from slim image)\n- Fix Docker healthchecks: use python3 urllib instead of missing curl\n- Add orchestrator service (port 8000): chains Tool 1 -> Tool 2 -> Tool 3,\n  exposes POST /generate-auth for the frontend, includes CORS and\n  treatment extraction from free text\n- Remove stale prior-auth-tasks planning files\n- Update README to reflect actual stack\n\nFrontend:\n- Animated step-by-step pipeline loading (shows 3 MCP tools running in sequence)\n- Patient quick-pick cards with risk labels (Low / Medium / High)\n- Denial risk gradient meter with Low / Medium / High scale\n- Payer requirements checklist with matched (green check) / unmet (grey X) criteria\n- AI letter display with copy-to-clipboard button\n- Tech stack footer (FHIR R4, Da Vinci CRD, MCP 2025-03-26, Gemini 2.5 Flash)\n- Update metadata title and description","tree":{"sha":"33d0650ba14f96e41f5e61480318528ac5938d2a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yashas004/PriorAuth/git/trees/33d0650ba14f96e41f5e61480318528ac5938d2a"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yashas004/PriorAuth/git/commits/a18d527d985cef82cfe625719dd8084d395a36d4","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":