tomiwa@yahoo.com","name":"Adeliyio"},"message":"Add RAG layer: FAISS vector store and evidence retrieval system\n\nImplement vector store with feature-based embeddings for historical deal\nsimilarity search. Add retriever interface with outcome-filtered search,\nsilence pattern matching, cohort insights, and graceful degradation when\ninsufficient historical data exists. Ensures agent risk assessments are\ngrounded in retrieved evidence rather than hallucinated patterns.","tree":{"sha":"8e75fd9af1171abda4c2901a2fcdb1feb3676523","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Adeliyio/deal-intelligence-for-sales-teams/git/trees/8e75fd9af1171abda4c2901a2fcdb1feb3676523"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Adeliyio/deal-intelligence-for-sales-teams/git/commits/a44dab29960c490f6e69bf5ebb55013f8fbaacf4","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/125208184?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Adeliyio/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Adeliyio/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Adeliyio/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Adeliyio/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Adeliyio","id":125208184,"login":"Adeliyio","node_id":"U_kgDOB3aGeA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Adeliyio/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Adeliyio/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Adeliyio/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Adeliyio/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Adeliyio/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Adeliyio","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Adeliyio/deal-intelligence-for-sales-teams/commit/a44dab29960c490f6e69bf5ebb55013f8fbaacf4","node_id":"C_kwDOSHnpBdoAKGE0NGR