22:43:34.062Z","raw":[{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/82684537?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Juyotal/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Juyotal/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Juyotal/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Juyotal/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Juyotal","id":82684537,"login":"Juyotal","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgyNjg0NTM3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Juyotal/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Juyotal/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Juyotal/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Juyotal/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Juyotal/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Juyotal","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Juyotal/rcm-copilot/commits/ce2a4aa88887e6bea807bc2e363c4e001f35f6d1/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-20T13:33:00Z","email":"cesarkamga3@gmail.com","name":"madaocesar"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-20T13:33:00Z","email":"cesarkamga3@gmail.com","name":"madaocesar"},"message":"docs: Clerk auth setup, architecture, and protected-routes reference\n\nNew \"Authentication (Clerk)\" section in the README covers:\n\n- one-time Clerk dashboard setup (publishable + secret key, frontend\n  API URL as the JWT issuer)\n- exact env vars to drop into frontend/.env.local and backend/.env\n- optional session-token customization for including email claims\n  (without it we fall back to a synthetic placeholder)\n- architecture pointers: ClerkProvider, middleware, get_current_user,\n  JIT provisioning rationale, and the LLM-cost attribution path\n- migration apply command for 0002_users_organizations.sql\n- a what-is-protected reference table for both API endpoints and\n  frontend routes\n- where the test fakes live\n\nAlso refreshes the project-structure tree (auth/ added, db/services/llm\nno longer \"empty\") and replaces the stale \"next step is Clerk auth\"\nparagraph with the actual next milestone (Prior Auth Letter Builder,\ncomponent #6).","tree":{"sha":"67096aaa5fcfa54411eebb3754e57fedec064b72","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Juyotal/rcm-copilot/git/trees/67096aaa5fcfa54411eebb3754e57fedec064b72"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Juyotal/rcm-copilot/git/commits/ce2a4aa88887e6bea807bc2e363c4e001f35f6d1","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/82684537?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Juyotal/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Juyotal/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Juyotal/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Juyotal/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Juyotal","id":82684537,"login":"Juyotal","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgyNjg0NTM3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Juyotal/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Juyotal/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Juyotal/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Juyotal/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Juyotal/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Juyotal","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Juyotal/rcm-copilot/commit/ce2a4aa88887e6bea807bc2e363c4e001f35f6d1","node_id":"C_kwDOSHpbGdoAKGNlMmE0YWE4ODg4N2U2YmVhODA3YmMyZTM2M2M0ZTAwMWYzNWY2ZDE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Juyotal/rcm-copilot/commit/5a0adc8952f6f1e16ea1d52f065f1de8d348d7f8","sha":"5a0adc8952f6f1e16ea1d52f065f1de8d348d7f8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Juyotal/rcm-copilot/commits/5a0adc8952f6f1e16ea1d52f065f1de8d348d7f8"}],"sha":"ce2a4aa88887e6bea807bc2e363c4e001f35f6d1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Juyotal/rcm-copilot/commits/ce2a4aa88887e6bea807bc2e363c4e001f35f6d1"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/82684537?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Juyotal/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Juyotal/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Juyotal/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Juyotal/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Juyotal","id":82684537,"login":"Juyotal","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgyNjg0NTM3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Juyotal/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Juyotal/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Juyotal/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Juyotal/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Juyotal/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Juyotal","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Juyotal/rcm-copilot/commits/5a0adc8952f6f1e16ea1d52f065f1de8d348d7f8/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-20T08:08:00Z","email":"cesarkamga3@gmail.com","name":"madaocesar"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-20T08:08:00Z","email":"cesarkamga3@gmail.com","name":"madaocesar"},"message":"feat(auth): sign-in/up routes, header user-button, JWT on API calls\n\nFrontend chrome + wiring for Clerk:\n\n- app/sign-in/[[...sign-in]]/page.tsx and the matching sign-up route\n  use Clerk''s hosted <SignIn/> / <SignUp/> components (catch-all\n  segments so the multi-step flow works in-place rather than\n  redirecting to clerk.com).\n- components/auth-header.tsx renders globally from the root layout:\n  signed-out users see Sign in / Sign up CTAs (modal flow); signed-in\n  users see <UserButton/> with the account menu. The brand link\n  doubles as a home link from any feature page.\n- lib/api/denials.ts now takes an optional `token` and sets the\n  Authorization: Bearer header; userFacingMessage maps 401 to\n  \"session expired, please sign in again\".\n- /denials/decode pulls the JWT via Clerk''s useAuth().getToken() and\n  forwards it to explainDenial(). Per-request fetch is the\n  documented pattern (Clerk session tokens are short-lived and\n  auto-refreshed by the SDK).\n\nExisting API tests stay green because `token` is optional.","tree":{"sha":"aeb7f9a43f3b59187a510b799c40c05a25d8eccf","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Juyotal/rcm-copilot/git/trees/aeb7f9a43f3b59187a510b799c40c05a25d8eccf"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Juyotal/rcm-copilot/git/commits/5a0adc8952f6f1e16ea1d52f065f1de8d348d7f8","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/82684537?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Juyotal/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Juyotal/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Juyotal/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Juyotal/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Juyotal","id":82684537,"login":"Juyotal","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgyNjg0NTM3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Juyotal/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Juyotal/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Juyotal/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Juyotal/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Juyotal/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Juyotal","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Juyotal/rcm-copilot/commit/5a0adc8952f6f1e16ea1d52f065f1de8d348d7f8","node_id":"C_kwDOSHpbGdoAKDVhMGFkYzg5NTJmNmYxZTE2ZWExZDUyZjA2NWYxZGU4ZDM0OGQ3Zjg","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Juyotal/rcm-copilot/commit/ea849672b190d254b707391c6e7eb6ab8c5e6a12","sha":"ea849672b190d254b707391c6e7eb6ab8c5e6a12","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Juyotal/rcm-copilot/commits/ea849672b190d254b707391c6e7eb6ab8c5e6a12"}],"sha":"5a0adc8952f6f1e16ea1d52f065f1de8d348d7f8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Juyotal/rcm-copilot/commits/5a0adc8952f6f1e16ea1d52f065f1de8d348d7f8"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/82684537?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Juyotal/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Juyotal/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Juyotal/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Juyotal/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Juyotal","id":82684537,"login":"Juyotal","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgyNjg0NTM3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Juyotal/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Juyotal/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Juyotal/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Juyotal/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Juyotal/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Juyotal","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Juyotal/rcm-copilot/commits/ea849672b190d254b707391c6e7eb6ab8c5e6a12/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-19T14:42:00Z","email":"cesarkamga3@gmail.com","name":"madaocesar"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-19T14:42:00Z","email":"cesarkamga3@gmail.com","name":"madaocesar"},"message":"feat(auth): install @clerk/nextjs and gate routes via middleware\n\n- Adds @clerk/nextjs (pinned to ^5 — v7 requires Next 15, we''re on\n  14.2.15).\n- Wraps the QueryClient + Toaster in <ClerkProvider> with a custom\n  primary color so Clerk''s modal/components inherit the app palette.\n- Adds middleware.ts using clerkMiddleware + createRouteMatcher. The\n  protected matcher is allowlist-style (`/denials(.*)`) so a new\n  feature route is private only when its pattern is added here —\n  forgetting to add it surfaces the obvious bug (signed-out users see\n  the page) rather than the dangerous one (data leaks because we\n  blanket-protected and missed an opt-out).\n- The home page (`/`) stays public.\n- Documents the publishable/secret key + sign-in/-up redirect env\n  vars in .env.local.example. Real keys are filled from the Clerk\n  dashboard.","tree":{"sha":"28d806fc22fc7b98d528d2ef9851e39992381cfb","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Juyotal/rcm-copilot/git/trees/28d806fc22fc7b98d528d2ef9851e39992381cfb"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Juyotal/rcm-copilot/git/commits/ea849672b190d254b707391c6e7eb6ab8c5e6a12","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/82684537?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Juyotal/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Juyotal/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Juyotal/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Juyotal/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Juyotal","id":82684537,"login":"Juyotal","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgyNjg0NTM3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Juyotal/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Juyotal/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Juyotal/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Juyotal/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Juyotal/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Juyotal","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Juyotal/rcm-copilot/commit/ea849672b190d254b707391c6e7eb6ab8c5e6a12","node_id":"C_kwDOSHpbGdoAKGVhODQ5NjcyYjE5MGQyNTRiNzA3MzkxYzZlN2ViNmFiOGM1ZTZhMTI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Juyotal/rcm-copilot/commit/5fbd8da2d8db167d28350dc2a477e0532aa5e4e0","sha":"5fbd8da2d8db167d28350dc2a477e0532aa5e4e0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Juyotal/rcm-copilot/commits/5fbd8da2d8db167d28350dc2a477e0532aa5e4e0"}],"sha":"ea849672b190d254b707391c6e7eb6ab8c5e6a12","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Juyotal/rcm-copilot/commits/ea849672b190d254b707391c6e7eb6ab8c5e6a12"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/82684537?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Juyotal/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Juyotal/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Juyotal/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Juyotal/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Juyotal","id":82684537,"login":"Juyotal","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgyNjg0NTM3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Juyotal/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Juyotal/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Juyotal/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Juyotal/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Juyotal/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Juyotal","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Juyotal/rcm-copilot/commits/5fbd8da2d8db167d28350dc2a477e0532aa5e4e0/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-19T07:55:00Z","email":"cesarkamga3@gmail.com","name":"madaocesar"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-19T07:55:00Z","email":"cesarkamga3@gmail.com","name":"madaocesar"},"message":"test(auth): hermetic tests for 401, valid JWT, and JIT provisioning\n\nAdds tests/auth/ with reusable FakeVerifier and FakeUserRepository\nfakes installed via FastAPI''s dependency override system, so the\nsuite never touches Clerk''s network or Postgres.\n\nCoverage:\n  - /health stays public\n  - protected endpoint -> 401 with no Authorization header\n  - protected endpoint -> 401 with an unknown token\n  - protected endpoint -> 401 with a non-Bearer scheme (Basic)\n  - protected endpoint -> 200 + canned body for a valid token\n  - JIT creates exactly one User + one personal Organization on first\n    request, then reuses both on subsequent calls (idempotent)\n  - the user''s surrogate id propagates to DenialService.explain (the\n    same value LLMGateway records to llm_calls.user_id)\n  - FakeVerifier negative + positive paths on the unit level\n\nAlso updates tests/services/test_denial_api.py to install the auth\noverrides + pass a Bearer token, since the denials route now\ndepends on get_current_user.\n\nSide fix: moved `request.state.user_id = str(user.id)` from the\ndenials handler body into get_current_user itself. slowapi''s\nkey_func runs after dep resolution but before the handler body,\nso the previous placement meant the limiter never actually saw the\nauthenticated user id for the current request.","tree":{"sha":"235d47dfe07adddcb9b7c904b8fc1085d35e343a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Juyotal/rcm-copilot/git/trees/235d47dfe07adddcb9b7c904b8fc1085d35e343a"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Juyotal/rcm-copilot/git/commits/5fbd8da2d8db167d28350dc2a477e0532aa5e4e0","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/82684537?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Juyotal/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Juyotal/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Juyotal/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Juyotal/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Juyotal","id":82684537,"login":"Juyotal","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgyNjg0NTM3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Juyotal/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Juyotal/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Juyotal/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Juyotal/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Juyotal/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Juyotal","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Juyotal/rcm-copilot/commit/5fbd8da2d8db167d28350dc2a477e0532aa5e4e0","node_id":"C_kwDOSHpbGdoAKDVmYmQ4ZGEyZDhkYjE2N2QyODM1MGRjMmE0NzdlMDUzMmFhNWU0ZTA","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Juyotal/rcm-copilot/commit/00272d301e908ac378cc34026b9d14fcf0484a3f","sha":"00272d301e908ac378cc34026b9d14fcf0484a3f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Juyotal/rcm-copilot/commits/00272d301e908ac378cc34026b9d14fcf0484a3f"}],"sha":"5fbd8da2d8db167d28350dc2a477e0532aa5e4e0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Juyotal/rcm-copilot/commits/5fbd8da2d8db167d28350dc2a477e0532aa5e4e0"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/82684537?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Juyotal/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Juyotal/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Juyotal/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Juyotal/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Juyotal","id":82684537,"login":"Juyotal","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgyNjg0NTM3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Juyotal/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Juyotal/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Juyotal/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Juyotal/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Juyotal/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Juyotal","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Juyotal/rcm-copilot/commits/00272d301e908ac378cc34026b9d14fcf0484a3f/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-18T15:38:00Z","email":"cesarkamga3@gmail.com","name":"madaocesar"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-18T15:38:00Z","email":"cesarkamga3@gmail.com","name":"madaocesar"},"message":"feat(denials): require auth and attribute LLM cost to the user\n\nPOST /api/v1/denials/explain now depends on get_current_user. The\nauthenticated user''s surrogate id is:\n\n  - threaded into DenialService.explain(..., user_id=...) which already\n    propagated it to LLMGateway.complete — so the existing llm_calls\n    rows now carry a real user_id instead of NULL, enabling per-user\n    cost reporting.\n  - written to request.state.user_id so the slowapi key_func can\n    switch from per-IP to per-user limiting (an office sharing a NAT\n    no longer collectively burns one user''s quota).\n\n/health stays unauthenticated (no Depends on the route, separate\nrouter).\n\nDocumented the new 401 response in the OpenAPI `responses` table.","tree":{"sha":"a8197cff509e006b6d228a087bfabdb4559c2025","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Juyotal/rcm-copilot/git/trees/a8197cff509e006b6d228a087bfabdb4559c2025"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Juyotal/rcm-copilot/git/commits/00272d301e908ac378cc34026b9d14fcf0484a3f","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/82684537?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Juyotal/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Juyotal/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Juyotal/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Juyotal/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Juyotal","id":82684537,"login":"Juyotal","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgyNjg0NTM3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Juyotal/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Juyotal/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Juyotal/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Juyotal/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Juyotal/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Juyotal","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Juyotal/rcm-copilot/commit/00272d301e908ac378cc34026b9d14fcf0484a3f","node_id":"C_kwDOSHpbGdoAKDAwMjcyZDMwMWU5MDhhYzM3OGNjMzQwMjZiOWQxNGZjZjA0ODRhM2Y","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Juyotal/rcm-copilot/commit/7c5013fd48cbaaa2c57851a3aa516e49cc3af20b","sha":"7c5013fd48cbaaa2c57851a3aa516e49cc3af20b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Juyotal/rcm-copilot/commits/7c5013fd48cbaaa2c57851a3aa516e49cc3af20b"}],"sha":"00272d301e908ac378cc34026b9d14fcf0484a3f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Juyotal/rcm-copilot/commits/00272d301e908ac378cc34026b9d14fcf0484a3f"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/82684537?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Juyotal/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Juyotal/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Juyotal/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Juyotal/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Juyotal","id":82684537,"login":"Juyotal","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgyNjg0NTM3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Juyotal/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Juyotal/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Juyotal/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Juyotal/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Juyotal/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Juyotal","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Juyotal/rcm-copilot/commits/7c5013fd48cbaaa2c57851a3aa516e49cc3af20b/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-16T09:20:00Z","email":"cesarkamga3@gmail.com","name":"madaocesar"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-16T09:20:00Z","email":"cesarkamga3@gmail.com","name":"madaocesar"},"message":"test(denials): pin LLMMetadataStrip number formatting\n\nLocks in the three formatting decisions the strip makes that aren''t\nobvious from reading the JSX:\n\n- sub-cent costs render at 4 decimals (a 0.0012¢ cache hit shouldn''t\n  round to 0.00¢ — that would lie about how cheap the cache is)\n- regular costs render at 2 decimals\n- latency switches from ms to seconds at the 1000ms boundary\n- the ''cached'' badge only appears when cache_hit is true\n\nRenders the real component (jsdom) rather than testing the helpers in\nisolation so we don''t have to export them just to assert on them.","tree":{"sha":"97539c078a5514023d6857dddc2561cfff8eb9b0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Juyotal/rcm-copilot/git/trees/97539c078a5514023d6857dddc2561cfff8eb9b0"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Juyotal/rcm-copilot/git/commits/7c5013fd48cbaaa2c57851a3aa516e49cc3af20b","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/82684537?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Juyotal/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Juyotal/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Juyotal/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Juyotal/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Juyotal","id":82684537,"login":"Juyotal","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgyNjg0NTM3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Juyotal/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Juyotal/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Juyotal/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Juyotal/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Juyotal/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Juyotal","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Juyotal/rcm-copilot/commit/7c5013fd48cbaaa2c57851a3aa516e49cc3af20b","node_id":"C_kwDOSHpbGdoAKDdjNTAxM2ZkNDhjYmFhYTJjNTc4NTFhM2FhNTE2ZTQ5Y2MzYWYyMGI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Juyotal/rcm-copilot/commit/d390acb686615ddfb411f912b6c4459536f482ac","sha":"d390acb686615ddfb411f912b6c4459536f482ac","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Juyotal/rcm-copilot/commits/d390acb686615ddfb411f912b6c4459536f482ac"}],"sha":"7c5013fd48cbaaa2c57851a3aa516e49cc3af20b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Juyotal/rcm-copilot/commits/7c5013fd48cbaaa2c57851a3aa516e49cc3af20b"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/82684537?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Juyotal/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Juyotal/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Juyotal/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Juyotal/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Juyotal","id":82684537,"login":"Juyotal","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgyNjg0NTM3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Juyotal/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Juyotal/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Juyotal/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Juyotal/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Juyotal/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Juyotal","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Juyotal/rcm-copilot/commits/d390acb686615ddfb411f912b6c4459536f482ac/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-18T08:14:00Z","email":"cesarkamga3@gmail.com","name":"madaocesar"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-18T08:14:00Z","email":"cesarkamga3@gmail.com","name":"madaocesar"},"message":"feat(auth): get_current_user dependency with JIT provisioning\n\nAdds app.auth.deps.get_current_user — the single seam every protected\nFastAPI endpoint will depend on. Flow:\n\n    Authorization: Bearer <clerk-jwt>\n      -> ClerkJWTVerifier.verify  (signature + iss + exp)\n      -> UserRepository.get_or_create (JIT provisioning)\n      -> User attached to the route handler\n\nUserRepository wraps the lookup + insert in a single transaction so a\nconcurrent first request for the same clerk_user_id cannot create two\nrows (UNIQUE constraint defends the loser). On miss, we auto-create a\npersonal organization on the free plan and bind the user to it.\n\nChose JIT over a Clerk webhook because:\n  - no public endpoint to expose / no signing-secret to manage\n  - no retry/idempotency story for missed events\n  - no drift for events we don''t care about yet\nA webhook can be layered on later for user.deleted / user.updated.\n\nMissing / wrong scheme / invalid JWT all map to 401 with a generic\ndetail — we never echo the underlying jwt error (would leak whether\nsignature vs expiry vs issuer failed). HTTPBearer is constructed with\nauto_error=False so the response shape stays consistent JSON.","tree":{"sha":"c192c72228b07b9b470315b52ec08f31e9cac446","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Juyotal/rcm-copilot/git/trees/c192c72228b07b9b470315b52ec08f31e9cac446"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Juyotal/rcm-copilot/git/commits/d390acb686615ddfb411f912b6c4459536f482ac","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/82684537?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Juyotal/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Juyotal/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Juyotal/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Juyotal/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Juyotal","id":82684537,"login":"Juyotal","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgyNjg0NTM3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Juyotal/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Juyotal/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Juyotal/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Juyotal/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Juyotal/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Juyotal","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Juyotal/rcm-copilot/commit/d390acb686615ddfb411f912b6c4459536f482ac","node_id":"C_kwDOSHpbGdoAKGQzOTBhY2I2ODY2MTVkZGZiNDExZjkxMmI2YzQ0NTk1MzZmNDgyYWM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Juyotal/rcm-copilot/commit/43865df76085a3c25f0832290da956aa3536af7a","sha":"43865df76085a3c25f0832290da956aa3536af7a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Juyotal/rcm-copilot/commits/43865df76085a3c25f0832290da956aa3536af7a"}],"sha":"d390acb686615ddfb411f912b6c4459536f482ac","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Juyotal/rcm-copilot/commits/d390acb686615ddfb411f912b6c4459536f482ac"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/82684537?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Juyotal/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Juyotal/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Juyotal/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Juyotal/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Juyotal","id":82684537,"login":"Juyotal","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgyNjg0NTM3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Juyotal/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Juyotal/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Juyotal/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Juyotal/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Juyotal/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Juyotal","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Juyotal/rcm-copilot/commits/43865df76085a3c25f0832290da956aa3536af7a/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-17T14:21:00Z","email":"cesarkamga3@gmail.com","name":"madaocesar"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-17T14:21:00Z","email":"cesarkamga3@gmail.com","name":"madaocesar"},"message":"feat(auth): Clerk RS256 JWT verifier with cached JWKS\n\nAdds app.auth.clerk.ClerkJWTVerifier — a thin wrapper over PyJWT''s\nPyJWKClient that:\n\n- fetches and caches Clerk''s JWKS (default 1h TTL, in-process)\n- verifies RS256 signature + issuer + exp/nbf on each call\n- skips `aud` enforcement by default (Clerk''s stock session token\n  has no audience claim; opt-in via CLERK_JWT_AUDIENCE)\n- returns a typed ClerkClaims (clerk_user_id, email?, raw)\n\nNo Clerk SDK dependency — the JWT carries everything the hot path\nneeds. Tests will override the verifier via FastAPI''s dependency\noverrides, so we never hit Clerk''s network in CI.\n\nPulls in PyJWT[crypto]; adds CLERK_JWT_ISSUER / CLERK_JWKS_URL /\nCLERK_JWT_AUDIENCE / CLERK_JWKS_CACHE_SECONDS settings.","tree":{"sha":"087d500afb3006752c51b4cb8d902b1103489b6d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Juyotal/rcm-copilot/git/trees/087d500afb3006752c51b4cb8d902b1103489b6d"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Juyotal/rcm-copilot/git/commits/43865df76085a3c25f0832290da956aa3536af7a","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/82684537?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Juyotal/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Juyotal/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Juyotal/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Juyotal/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Juyotal","id":82684537,"login":"Juyotal","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgyNjg0NTM3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Juyotal/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Juyotal/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Juyotal/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Juyotal/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Juyotal/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Juyotal","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Juyotal/rcm-copilot/commit/43865df76085a3c25f0832290da956aa3536af7a","node_id":"C_kwDOSHpbGdoAKDQzODY1ZGY3NjA4NWEzYzI1ZjA4MzIyOTBkYTk1NmFhMzUzNmFmN2E","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Juyotal/rcm-copilot/commit/0ca39d08b2435c7643e8dad211b7c7194dd214b8","sha":"0ca39d08b2435c7643e8dad211b7c7194dd214b8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Juyotal/rcm-copilot/commits/0ca39d08b2435c7643e8dad211b7c7194dd214b8"}],"sha":"43865df76085a3c25f0832290da956aa3536af7a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Juyotal/rcm-copilot/commits/43865df76085a3c25f0832290da956aa3536af7a"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/82684537?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Juyotal/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Juyotal/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Juyotal/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Juyotal/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Juyotal","id":82684537,"login":"Juyotal","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgyNjg0NTM3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Juyotal/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Juyotal/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Juyotal/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Juyotal/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Juyotal/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Juyotal","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Juyotal/rcm-copilot/commits/0ca39d08b2435c7643e8dad211b7c7194dd214b8/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-17T07:42:00Z","email":"cesarkamga3@gmail.com","name":"madaocesar"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-17T07:42:00Z","email":"cesarkamga3@gmail.com","name":"madaocesar"},"message":"feat(db): add users and organizations tables for Clerk-backed auth\n\nMigration 0002 introduces the two tables that back the auth layer:\n\n- organizations: id, name, plan (free|starter|pro CHECK), nullable\n  stripe_customer_id (unique when present so collisions surface),\n  created_at.\n- users: id, clerk_user_id (unique — Clerk''s `sub` claim), email,\n  organization_id (NOT NULL FK; everyone belongs to an org, solo users\n  get a personal org auto-created at JIT-provisioning time).\n\nschema.sql is kept in sync as a convenience snapshot; the migrations\ndirectory remains authoritative.","tree":{"sha":"44c4d0b4579cf49bb6547cb3d145e9265303098f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Juyotal/rcm-copilot/git/trees/44c4d0b4579cf49bb6547cb3d145e9265303098f"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Juyotal/rcm-copilot/git/commits/0ca39d08b2435c7643e8dad211b7c7194dd214b8","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/82684537?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Juyotal/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Juyotal/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Juyotal/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Juyotal/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Juyotal","id":82684537,"login":"Juyotal","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgyNjg0NTM3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Juyotal/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Juyotal/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Juyotal/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Juyotal/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Juyotal/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Juyotal","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Juyotal/rcm-copilot/commit/0ca39d08b2435c7643e8dad211b7c7194dd214b8","node_id":"C_kwDOSHpbGdoAKDBjYTM5ZDA4YjI0MzVjNzY0M2U4ZGFkMjExYjdjNzE5NGRkMjE0Yjg","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Juyotal/rcm-copilot/commit/3132a2d498975eed32453bdd17d2964ae0788cd3","sha":"3132a2d498975eed32453bdd17d2964ae0788cd3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Juyotal/rcm-copilot/commits/3132a2d498975eed32453bdd17d2964ae0788cd3"}],"sha":"0ca39d08b2435c7643e8dad211b7c7194dd214b8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Juyotal/rcm-copilot/commits/0ca39d08b2435c7643e8dad211b7c7194dd214b8"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/82684537?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Juyotal/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Juyotal/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Juyotal/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Juyotal/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Juyotal","id":82684537,"login":"Juyotal","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgyNjg0NTM3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Juyotal/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Juyotal/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Juyotal/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Juyotal/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Juyotal/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Juyotal","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Juyotal/rcm-copilot/commits/3132a2d498975eed32453bdd17d2964ae0788cd3/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-15T16:35:00Z","email":"cesarkamga3@gmail.com","name":"madaocesar"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-15T16:35:00Z","email":"cesarkamga3@gmail.com","name":"madaocesar"},"message":"feat(denials): /denials/decode page with responsive two-column layout\n\nWire DenialForm to explainDenial through a react-query useMutation,\nand route the four lifecycle states to dedicated components:\n\n  isPending → ResultsSkeleton\n  isError   → ErrorState with DenialApiError.message (already\n              user-facing) and mutation.reset() as the retry handler\n  data      → DenialResults + LLMMetadataStrip in the card footer\n  idle      → EmptyState\n\nonSuccess fires a sonner toast — \"Denial decoded\" or \"Denial decoded\n(cached)\" so users can feel the cache pay off without reading the\nmetadata strip.\n\nLayout: lg:grid-cols-5 split (2 form / 3 results) on desktop so the\nresults card gets the room it deserves; single-column stack on\nmobile. min-h-[420px] on the results CardContent keeps empty/error/\nloading states from collapsing the column.","tree":{"sha":"a50372b3dd94db698b55cb89f98c6e0e8bab5230","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Juyotal/rcm-copilot/git/trees/a50372b3dd94db698b55cb89f98c6e0e8bab5230"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Juyotal/rcm-copilot/git/commits/3132a2d498975eed32453bdd17d2964ae0788cd3","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/82684537?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Juyotal/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Juyotal/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Juyotal/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Juyotal/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Juyotal","id":82684537,"login":"Juyotal","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgyNjg0NTM3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Juyotal/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Juyotal/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Juyotal/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Juyotal/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Juyotal/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Juyotal","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Juyotal/rcm-copilot/commit/3132a2d498975eed32453bdd17d2964ae0788cd3","node_id":"C_kwDOSHpbGdoAKDMxMzJhMmQ0OTg5NzVlZWQzMjQ1M2JkZDE3ZDI5NjRhZTA3ODhjZDM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Juyotal/rcm-copilot/commit/fff9316b785226b2f9cf1ae55b028219f30f9a9b","sha":"fff9316b785226b2f9cf1ae55b028219f30f9a9b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Juyotal/rcm-copilot/commits/fff9316b785226b2f9cf1ae55b028219f30f9a9b"}],"sha":"3132a2d498975eed32453bdd17d2964ae0788cd3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Juyotal/rcm-copilot/commits/3132a2d498975eed32453bdd17d2964ae0788cd3"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/82684537?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Juyotal/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Juyotal/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Juyotal/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Juyotal/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Juyotal","id":82684537,"login":"Juyotal","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgyNjg0NTM3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Juyotal/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Juyotal/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Juyotal/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Juyotal/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Juyotal/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Juyotal","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Juyotal/rcm-copilot/commits/fff9316b785226b2f9cf1ae55b028219f30f9a9b/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-15T11:47:00Z","email":"cesarkamga3@gmail.com","name":"madaocesar"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-15T11:47:00Z","email":"cesarkamga3@gmail.com","name":"madaocesar"},"message":"feat(denials): metadata strip, skeleton loader, empty + error states\n\nRound out the right column''s non-success states:\n\n- LLMMetadataStrip is the muted footer (model / cost / latency / cache\n  hit) for power users. Sub-cent costs render to 4 dp so a 0.0012¢\n  cache hit looks distinct from a 0.04¢ live call; a small zap icon\n  highlights cache hits to make the value of caching legible.\n- ResultsSkeleton mirrors the shape of DenialResults so the layout\n  doesn''t jump when content lands. Skeleton blocks, not spinners — per\n  the design brief.\n- EmptyState invites the first action with explicit copy about what\n  the page does. ErrorState pairs a friendly headline with the precise\n  message from DenialApiError so users learn whether it was rate\n  limiting or an LLM hiccup, plus an optional Try again button.","tree":{"sha":"e83d2295bcf04e83bee7ddceb649bb3b5dd5ae04","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Juyotal/rcm-copilot/git/trees/e83d2295bcf04e83bee7ddceb649bb3b5dd5ae04"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Juyotal/rcm-copilot/git/commits/fff9316b785226b2f9cf1ae55b028219f30f9a9b","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/82684537?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Juyotal/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Juyotal/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Juyotal/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Juyotal/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Juyotal","id":82684537,"login":"Juyotal","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgyNjg0NTM3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Juyotal/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Juyotal/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Juyotal/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Juyotal/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Juyotal/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Juyotal","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Juyotal/rcm-copilot/commit/fff9316b785226b2f9cf1ae55b028219f30f9a9b","node_id":"C_kwDOSHpbGdoAKGZmZjkzMTZiNzg1MjI2YjJmOWNmMWFlNTViMDI4MjE5ZjMwZjlhOWI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Juyotal/rcm-copilot/commit/2c01c9cb16cc3aaeb1f7035c3026a395b155107d","sha":"2c01c9cb16cc3aaeb1f7035c3026a395b155107d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Juyotal/rcm-copilot/commits/2c01c9cb16cc3aaeb1f7035c3026a395b155107d"}],"sha":"fff9316b785226b2f9cf1ae55b028219f30f9a9b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Juyotal/rcm-copilot/commits/fff9316b785226b2f9cf1ae55b028219f30f9a9b"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/82684537?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Juyotal/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Juyotal/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Juyotal/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Juyotal/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Juyotal","id":82684537,"login":"Juyotal","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgyNjg0NTM3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Juyotal/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Juyotal/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Juyotal/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Juyotal/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Juyotal/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Juyotal","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Juyotal/rcm-copilot/commits/2c01c9cb16cc3aaeb1f7035c3026a395b155107d/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-15T08:08:00Z","email":"cesarkamga3@gmail.com","name":"madaocesar"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-15T08:08:00Z","email":"cesarkamga3@gmail.com","name":"madaocesar"},"message":"feat(denials): four-tab results view (explanation, root cause, next steps, appeal letter)\n\nDenialResults renders the backend response across four tabs with a\nconfidence badge pinned to the top-right:\n\n- Explanation tab pairs the plain-English text with cited sources\n  (CARC-N excerpts) so power users can verify the answer against the\n  knowledge base rather than trusting a black-box LLM.\n- Next steps render as a checklist with a brand-accent check icon —\n  this is what billers will actually act on.\n- AppealLetterPanel is its own component because it owns local edit\n  state and clipboard interaction: Edit toggles between a styled\n  preformatted preview and an editable Textarea; Copy lifts whichever\n  is current. A new draft from a fresh submission resets local edits\n  (useEffect on draft).\n- ConfidenceBadge maps high/medium/low to success/warning/destructive\n  variants so users can read it without reading the word.","tree":{"sha":"4af9fd12b9f976a990acade301624a91925d01d4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Juyotal/rcm-copilot/git/trees/4af9fd12b9f976a990acade301624a91925d01d4"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Juyotal/rcm-copilot/git/commits/2c01c9cb16cc3aaeb1f7035c3026a395b155107d","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/82684537?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Juyotal/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Juyotal/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.c