"https://api.github.com/users/Juyotal/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Juyotal/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Juyotal","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Juyotal/rcm-copilot/commits/c79f49919130448f3c406a63f94660b19fd09404/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-14T15:22:00Z","email":"cesarkamga3@gmail.com","name":"madaocesar"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-14T15:22:00Z","email":"cesarkamga3@gmail.com","name":"madaocesar"},"message":"feat(denials): zod schema and DenialForm with code autocomplete\n\n- schema.ts mirrors the backend DenialExplainRequest contract but caps\n  claim_context at 500 chars (the single-textarea UI budget) vs the\n  backend''s 4000. Empty optional strings transform to undefined so the\n  request body stays minimal.\n- code-combobox.tsx is a cmdk-backed combobox used for both the CARC\n  field (with descriptions) and the payer field. allowFreeText is on by\n  default so users can submit codes/payers that aren''t in the curated\n  lists — the lists are hints, not enums.\n- denial-form.tsx assembles the four fields with react-hook-form +\n  zodResolver. Submit button uses the brand variant; a live char\n  counter on claim_context turns amber near the cap so users notice\n  before they overflow.","tree":{"sha":"df38233bea01d75f776345bc976dc02e796ae3f0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Juyotal/rcm-copilot/git/trees/df38233bea01d75f776345bc976dc02e796ae3f0"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Juyotal/rcm-copilot/git/commits/c79f49919130448f3c406a63f94660b19fd09404","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/82684537?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Juyotal/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Juyotal/followers","following_url":"https://api.git