:"https://api.github.com/repos/Juyotal/rcm-copilot/commits/7ee8fed52bded2f63b135cfdc8c12cfc22619a93/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-14T07:30:00Z","email":"cesarkamga3@gmail.com","name":"madaocesar"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-14T07:30:00Z","email":"cesarkamga3@gmail.com","name":"madaocesar"},"message":"feat(denials): typed API client at lib/api/denials.ts\n\nHand-typed mirror of the Pydantic contract in\nbackend/app/services/denial_schemas.py: request, response, sources,\nllm_metadata. To be replaced by an OpenAPI-generated client once the\ngenerator is wired up; until then, keep these in sync manually.\n\nExports a DenialApiError carrying status + Retry-After so the page can\ndistinguish 429 (rate-limit toast with countdown) from 502 (LLM down)\nfrom 4xx (validation). userFacingMessage() centralises the copy so no\nPHI or raw backend detail leaks into toasts.","tree":{"sha":"3cea9f5449d2a2d4645ac5f8a42917f4a6a5e01f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Juyotal/rcm-copilot/git/trees/3cea9f5449d2a2d4645ac5f8a42917f4a6a5e01f"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Juyotal/rcm-copilot/git/commits/7ee8fed52bded2f63b135cfdc8c12cfc22619a93","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/82684537?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Juyotal/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Juyotal/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Juyotal/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Juyotal/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Juyotal","id":82684537,"login":"Juyotal","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgyNjg0NTM3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Juyotal/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Juyotal/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Juyotal/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_ur