ount":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-13T14:55:00Z","email":"cesarkamga3@gmail.com","name":"madaocesar"},"message":"feat(frontend): wire react-query and sonner providers in root layout\n\nAdds a single Providers client component holding the QueryClient and\nthe Toaster. Mounted once in the root layout so every page (and the\nupcoming /denials/decode) can use useQuery/useMutation and toast()\nwithout per-route setup.\n\nQueryClient is created via useState so the instance is per-tab and not\nshared across SSR renders. refetchOnWindowFocus is disabled — denial\nexplanations are deterministic per input, so silent refetches just burn\nLLM cost; users can re-submit explicitly if they want a fresh answer.","tree":{"sha":"f21c8ce362317b5828c4cd4593be8eaadbde9b88","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Juyotal/rcm-copilot/git/trees/f21c8ce362317b5828c4cd4593be8eaadbde9b88"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Juyotal/rcm-copilot/git/commits/8dbb17f6af73dbf1f89ab113160b39f07dab5a84","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/82684537?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Juyotal/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Juyotal/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Juyotal/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Juyotal/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Juyotal","id":82684537,"login":"Juyotal","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgyNjg0NTM3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Juyotal/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Juyotal/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Juyotal/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Juyotal/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Juyotal/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Juyotal","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Juyotal/rcm-copilot/commit/8dbb17f6af73dbf1f89ab113160b39f07dab5a84","node_id":"C_kwDOSHpbGdoAKDhkYmIxN2Y2YWY3M2RiZjFmODlhYjExMzE2MGIzOWYwN2RhYjVhODQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Juyotal/rcm-copilot/commit/7017f6732fbd49c1a042273b3e586f9459df20ae","sha":"7017f6732fbd49c1a042273b3e586f9459df20ae","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Juyotal/rcm-copilot/commits/7017f6732fbd49c1a042273b3e586f9459df20ae"}],"sha":"8dbb17f6af73dbf1f89ab113160b39f07dab5a84","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Juyotal/rcm-copilot/commits/8dbb17f6af73dbf1f89ab113160b39f07dab5a84"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/82684537?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Juyotal/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Juyotal/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Juyotal/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Juyotal/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Juyotal","id":82684537,"login":"Juyotal","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgyNjg0NTM3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Juyotal/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Juyotal/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Juyotal/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Juyotal/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Juyotal/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Juyotal","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Juyotal/rcm-copilot/commits/7017f6732fbd49c1a042273b3e586f9459df20ae/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-13T12:18:00Z","email":"cesarkamga3@gmail.com","name":"madaocesar"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-13T12:18:00Z","email":"cesarkamga3@gmail.com","name":"madaocesar"},"message":"feat(frontend): add shadcn/ui primitives and brand accent\n\nHand-rolled shadcn components (style=default, baseColor=slate per\ncomponents.json) for: Button, Card, Input, Textarea, Label, Badge,\nSkeleton, Tabs, Popover, Command, Form.\n\nAlso adds a single brand accent token (--brand) — a medical teal used\nsparingly on the primary CTA. Picked over a flashier blue because the\ntarget buyer (small billing companies, RCM consultants) values calm\nclinical aesthetics, not SaaS-flashy.\n\nComponents live under components/ui per the aliases in components.json.\nWritten by hand rather than via the shadcn CLI because pnpm install has\nnot been run locally yet.","tree":{"sha":"69595daa8c5fb7b2118bd92f67fa9fb02c1e7777","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Juyotal/rcm-copilot/git/trees/69595daa8c5fb7b2118bd92f67fa9fb02c1e7777"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Juyotal/rcm-copilot/git/commits/7017f6732fbd49c1a042273b3e586f9459df20ae","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/82684537?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Juyotal/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Juyotal/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Juyotal/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Juyotal/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Juyotal","id":82684537,"login":"Juyotal","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgyNjg0NTM3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Juyotal/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Juyotal/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Juyotal/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Juyotal/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Juyotal/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Juyotal","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Juyotal/rcm-copilot/commit/7017f6732fbd49c1a042273b3e586f9459df20ae","node