t":{"author":{"date":"2026-03-17T08:08:00Z","email":"cesarkamga3@gmail.com","name":"madaocesar"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-03-17T08:08:00Z","email":"cesarkamga3@gmail.com","name":"madaocesar"},"message":"feat(denials): denial-explain Jinja prompt and loader\n\nPrompts live as .md templates under app/llm/prompts so they read well\nin a diff and can use Jinja conditionals for optional fields. The\nloader uses StrictUndefined so a missing template var fails loudly\ninstead of silently rendering an empty string.\n\nThe denial_explain template hard-codes the standard appeal letter\nstructure and the bracketed-placeholder rule, but pulls all\ndomain knowledge from the retrieved-context block — no CARC facts are\nbaked into the prompt itself.","tree":{"sha":"7857bc406b283f6cc31fbdf71dcbd1f81bcdfe92","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Juyotal/rcm-copilot/git/trees/7857bc406b283f6cc31fbdf71dcbd1f81bcdfe92"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Juyotal/rcm-copilot/git/commits/22bf9a7d342e95ffe935e9dae89533aa54a87978","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/82684537?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Juyotal/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Juyotal/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Juyotal/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Juyotal/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Juyotal","id":82684537,"login":"Juyotal","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgyNjg0NTM3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Juyotal/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Juyotal/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Juyotal/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Juyotal/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Juyotal/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Juyotal","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Juyotal/rcm-copilot/commit/22bf9a7d342e95ffe935e9dae89533aa54a87978","node_id":"C_kwDOSHpbGdoAKDIyYmY5YTdkMzQyZTk1ZmZlOTM1ZTlkYWU4OTUzM2FhNTRhODc5Nzg","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Juyotal/rcm-copilot/commit/dfae8b5faa3a47f91d26d7272a26813ee5a0d625","sha":"dfae8b5faa3a47f91d26d7272a26813ee5a0d625","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Juyotal/rcm-copilot/commits/dfae8b5faa3a47f91d26d7272a26813ee5a0d625"}],"sha":"22bf9a7d342e95ffe935e9dae89533aa54a87978","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Juyotal/rcm-copilot/commits/22bf9a7d342e95ffe935e9dae89533aa54a87978"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/82684537?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Juyotal/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Juyotal/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Juyotal/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Juyotal/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Juyotal","id":82684537,"login":"Juyotal","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgyNjg0NTM3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Juyotal/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Juyotal/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Juyotal/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Juyotal/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Juyotal/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Juyotal","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Juyotal/rcm-copilot/commits/dfae8b5faa3a47f91d26d7272a26813ee5a0d625/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-03-16T12:32:00Z","email":"cesarkamga3@gmail.com","name":"madaocesar"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-03-16T12:32:00Z","email":"cesarkamga3@gmail.com","name":"madaocesar"},"message":"feat(denials): Pydantic schemas for the explain endpoint\n\nThree-layer split:\n  - DenialExplainRequest is the inbound API contract with strict\n    field-level validation and whitespace trimming.\n  - LLMDenialPayload mirrors the JSON the model is asked to return;\n    keeping it separate from the API response means we can add\n    presentation fields without changing the prompt.\n  - DenialExplainResponse layers confidence + LLM bookkeeping on top\n    of the parsed payload for the outbound contract.","tree":{"sha":"b4491b34372036c59638ccbc6447bf34da2a7523","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Juyotal/rcm-copilot/git/trees/b4491b34372036c59638ccbc6447bf34da2a7523"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Juyotal/rcm-copilot/git/commits/dfae8b5faa3a47f91d26d7272a26813ee5a0d625","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/82684537?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Juyotal/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Juyotal/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Juyotal/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Juyotal/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Juyotal","id":82684537,"login":"Juyotal","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgyNjg0NTM3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Juyotal/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Juyotal/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Juyotal/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Juyotal/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Juyotal/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Juyotal","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Juyotal/rcm-copilot/commit/dfae8b5faa3a47f91d26d7272a26813ee5a0d625","node_id":"C_kwDOSHpbGdoAKGRmYWU4YjVmYWEzYTQ3ZjkxZDI2ZDcyNzJhMjY4MTNlZTVhMGQ2MjU","parents":[{"html_ur