esar"},"message":"docs(llm): README for gateway usage and extension\n\nDocument the constructor wiring, the complete()/embed() signatures,\nthe retry/cache/cost contract, and the two-step recipe for adding\na new model. Calls out the explicit \"no service code talks to\nanthropic/openai directly\" rule so future contributors don''t bypass\nthe gateway and lose cost tracking.","tree":{"sha":"6eb8bc14219a31bd4e42f5db164e47f348e143a4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Juyotal/rcm-copilot/git/trees/6eb8bc14219a31bd4e42f5db164e47f348e143a4"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Juyotal/rcm-copilot/git/commits/6b4b7a7f0a4eb14152555b61d1bf4e78aaea582c","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/82684537?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Juyotal/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Juyotal/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Juyotal/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Juyotal/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Juyotal","id":82684537,"login":"Juyotal","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgyNjg0NTM3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Juyotal/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Juyotal/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Juyotal/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Juyotal/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Juyotal/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Juyotal","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Juyotal/rcm-copilot/commit/6b4b7a7f0a4eb14152555b61d1bf4e78aaea582c","node_id":"C_kwDOSHpbGdoAKDZiNGI3YTdmMGE0ZWIxNDE1MjU1NWI2MWQxYmY0ZTc4YWFlYTU4MmM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Juyotal/rcm-copilot/commit/b81f7fef8a553ad18ed9bd750c0e37332f0211fa","sha":"b81f7fef8a553ad18ed9bd750c0e37332f0211fa","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Juyotal/rcm-copilot/commits/b81f7fef8a553ad18ed9bd750c0e37332f0211fa"}],"sha":"6b4b7a7f0a4eb14152555b61d1bf4e78aaea582c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Juyotal/rcm-copilot/commits/6b4b7a7f0a4eb14152555b61d1bf4e78aaea582c"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/82684537?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Juyotal/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Juyotal/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Juyotal/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Juyotal/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Juyotal","id":82684537,"login":"Juyotal","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgyNjg0NTM3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Juyotal/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Juyotal/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Juyotal/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Juyotal/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Juyotal/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Juyotal","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Juyotal/rcm-copilot/commits/b81f7fef8a553ad18ed9bd750c0e37332f0211fa/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-02-13T18:51:00Z","email":"cesarkamga3@gmail.com","name":"madaocesar"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-02-13T18:51:00Z","email":"cesarkamga3@gmail.com","name":"madaocesar"},"message":"test(llm): integration test against stubbed http transport\n\nUse respx to intercept httpx at the transport layer so the real\nanthropic and openai SDKs serialize, send, and parse against canned\nresponses. This exercises the full gateway -> provider -> SDK ->\nwire path without needing a real key or network, and would catch\nSDK upgrades that break our request shape — something the pure\nunit mocks in test_providers.py can''t see.\n\nThree scenarios: a successful Anthropic completion (cost computed\nend-to-end), a cache hit on the second identical call (no second\nupstream request), and an OpenAI embeddings round-trip dispatched\nvia the embedder seam.","tree":{"sha":"52c1710dcbff8f90d264aba6195464c0d85a2645","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Juyotal/rcm-copilot/git/trees/52c1710dcbff8f90d264aba6195464c0d85a2645"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Juyotal/rcm-copilot/git/commits/b81f7fef8a553ad18ed9bd750c0e37332f0211fa","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/82684537?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Juyotal/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Juyotal/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Juyotal/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Juyotal/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Juyotal","id":82684537,"login":"Juyotal","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgyNjg0NTM3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Juyotal/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Juyotal/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Juyotal/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Juyotal/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Juyotal/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Juyotal","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Juyotal/rcm-copilot/commit/b81f7fef8a553ad18ed9bd750c0e37332f0211fa","node_id":"C_kwDOSHpbGdoAKGI4MWY3ZmVmOGE1NTNhZDE4ZWQ5YmQ3NTBjMGUzNzMzMmYwMjExZmE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Juyotal/rcm-copilot/commit/ca9af2ad175d22622272a857e3181f170a9ccd3f","sha":"ca9af2ad175d22622272a857e3181f170a9ccd3f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Juyotal/rcm-copilot/commits/ca9af2ad175d22622272a857e3181f170a9ccd3f"}],"sha":"b81f7fef8a553ad18ed9bd750c0e37332f0211fa","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Juyotal/rcm-copilot/commits/b81f7fef8a553ad18ed9bd750c0e37332f0211fa"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/82684537?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Juyotal/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Juyotal/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Juyotal/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Juyotal/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Juyotal","id":82684537,"login":"Juyotal","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgyNjg0NTM3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Juyotal/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Juyotal/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Juyotal/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Juyotal/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Juyotal/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Juyotal","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Juyotal/rcm-copilot/commits/ca9af2ad175d22622272a857e3181f170a9ccd3f/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-02-13T15:23:00Z","email":"cesarkamga3@gmail.com","name":"madaocesar"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-02-13T15:23:00Z","email":"cesarkamga3@gmail.com","name":"madaocesar"},"message":"test(llm): unit tests for cost, cache, providers, and gateway\n\nCover the four building blocks behind mocks so the suite runs without\nany network: cost lookup + arithmetic, cache key stability and\nfakeredis round-trips, both provider implementations (with vendor\nSDK clients stubbed via SimpleNamespace + AsyncMock), and the gateway\nitself with a hand-rolled StubProvider.\n\nGateway tests pin down the contract that matters most: cache hits\nshort-circuit, temperature and extra cache_key invalidate, timeouts\nretry exactly once before raising LLMUnavailableError, non-timeout\nprovider errors don''t retry, and embed() caches per-text so partial\noverlaps with prior batches skip the provider.\n\nCoverage on app/llm sits at ~96%, comfortably above the 80% gate\nconfigured in pyproject.","tree":{"sha":"974c1d1293866b5f8ef7fc0c0ae40a377553e851","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Juyotal/rcm-copilot/git/trees/974c1d1293866b5f8ef7fc0c0ae40a377553e851"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Juyotal/rcm-copilot/git/commits/ca9af2ad175d22622272a857e3181f170a9ccd3f","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/82684537?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Juyotal/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Juyotal/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Juyotal/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Juyotal/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Juyotal","id":82684537,"login":"Juyotal","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgyNjg0NTM3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Juyotal/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Juyotal/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Juyotal/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Juyotal/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Juyotal/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Juyotal","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Juyotal/rcm-copilot/commit/ca9af2ad175d22622272a857e3181f170a9ccd3f","node_id":"C_kwDOSHpbGdoAKGNhOWFmMmFkMTc1ZDIyNjIyMjcyYTg1N2UzMTgxZjE3MGE5Y2NkM2Y","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Juyotal/rcm-copilot/commit/df31ad6c412fb1c7ad35aa5e70b796a78362360b","sha":"df31ad6c412fb1c7ad35aa5e70b796a78362360b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Juyotal/rcm-copilot/commits/df31ad6c412fb1c7ad35aa5e70b796a78362360b"}],"sha":"ca9af2ad175d22622272a857e3181f170a9ccd3f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Juyotal/rcm-copilot/commits/ca9af2ad175d22622272a857e3181f170a9ccd3f"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/82684537?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Juyotal/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Juyotal/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Juyotal/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Juyotal/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Juyotal","id":82684537,"login":"Juyotal","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgyNjg0NTM3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Juyotal/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Juyotal/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Juyotal/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Juyotal/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Juyotal/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Juyotal","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Juyotal/rcm-copilot/commits/df31ad6c412fb1c7ad35aa5e70b796a78362360b/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-02-12T22:09:00Z","email":"cesarkamga3@gmail.com","name":"madaocesar"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-02-12T22:09:00Z","email":"cesarkamga3@gmail.com","name":"madaocesar"},"message":"feat(llm): gateway with retry, caching, logging, and persistence\n\nLLMGateway is the only thing service code should touch for LLM I/O.\ncomplete() normalizes prompt input, checks Redis, and on miss issues\nthe provider call with a one-shot timeout retry before raising\nLLMUnavailableError. Successful responses are cached for the caller''s\nttl (defaulting to 7 days) and the response carries cost_cents,\nlatency_ms, and cache_hit so callers don''t need to recompute them.\n\nembed() caches per-text so partial overlap with prior batches still\nbenefits, and stores vectors with no TTL since they''re deterministic\nper (model, text). Embeddings dispatch to a dedicated embedder\nprovider since Anthropic doesn''t expose one.\n\nEach call emits a structlog event and (when an engine is provided)\nwrites one row to llm_calls. The DB write is best-effort by virtue\nof being optional — tests can pass engine=None to skip persistence.\n\nFallback provider is intentionally not wired yet; the retry path is\nstructured so it can drop in at one site.","tree":{"sha":"11d0b60b20aae43ce6dca1bf73339224e5ec4f63","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Juyotal/rcm-copilot/git/trees/11d0b60b20aae43ce6dca1bf73339224e5ec4f63"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Juyotal/rcm-copilot/git/commits/df31ad6c412fb1c7ad35aa5e70b796a78362360b","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/82684537?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Juyotal/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Juyotal/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Juyotal/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Juyotal/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Juyotal","id":82684537,"login":"Juyotal","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgyNjg0NTM3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Juyotal/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Juyotal/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Juyotal/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Juyotal/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Juyotal/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Juyotal","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Juyotal/rcm-copilot/commit/df31ad6c412fb1c7ad35aa5e70b796a78362360b","node_id":"C_kwDOSHpbGdoAKGRmMzFhZDZjNDEyZmIxYzdhZDM1YWE1ZTcwYjc5NmE3ODM2MjM2MGI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Juyotal/rcm-copilot/commit/2098818e6b3077b36d427dc55a517661ae136d56","sha":"2098818e6b3077b36d427dc55a517661ae136d56","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Juyotal/rcm-copilot/commits/2098818e6b3077b36d427dc55a517661ae136d56"}],"sha":"df31ad6c412fb1c7ad35aa5e70b796a78362360b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Juyotal/rcm-copilot/commits/df31ad6c412fb1c7ad35aa5e70b796a78362360b"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/82684537?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Juyotal/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Juyotal/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Juyotal/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Juyotal/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Juyotal","id":82684537,"login":"Juyotal","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgyNjg0NTM3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Juyotal/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Juyotal/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Juyotal/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Juyotal/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Juyotal/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Juyotal","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Juyotal/rcm-copilot/commits/2098818e6b3077b36d427dc55a517661ae136d56/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-02-12T16:47:00Z","email":"cesarkamga3@gmail.com","name":"madaocesar"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-02-12T16:47:00Z","email":"cesarkamga3@gmail.com","name":"madaocesar"},"message":"feat(db): async engine and llm_calls table DDL\n\nBootstrap a lazily-initialized AsyncEngine so any module can call\nget_engine() without worrying about app startup ordering, plus\ndispose_engine() for clean test teardown.\n\nllm_calls captures everything observability needs (user, prompt hash,\nmodel/provider, token split, cost, latency, cache hit) with composite\nindexes on (user_id, created_at) and (model, created_at) for the\ntwo queries we expect to run most: per-user spend and per-model usage.\n\nDDL is plain SQL applied with psql; no migration tool yet.","tree":{"sha":"6563c96130b244b5ae4ceefd529d7ba78fe37ae7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Juyotal/rcm-copilot/git/trees/6563c96130b244b5ae4ceefd529d7ba78fe37ae7"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Juyotal/rcm-copilot/git/commits/2098818e6b3077b36d427dc55a517661ae136d56","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/82684537?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Juyotal/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Juyotal/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Juyotal/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Juyotal/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Juyotal","id":82684537,"login":"Juyotal","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgyNjg0NTM3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Juyotal/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Juyotal/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Juyotal/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Juyotal/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Juyotal/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Juyotal","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Juyotal/rcm-copilot/commit/2098818e6b3077b36d427dc55a517661ae136d56","node_id":"C_kwDOSHpbGdoAKDIwOTg4MThlNmIzMDc3YjM2ZDQyN2RjNTVhNTE3NjYxYWUxMzZkNTY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Juyotal/rcm-copilot/commit/af53dd586ae452a1487efe9ec8660c6dbccecdfb","sha":"af53dd586ae452a1487efe9ec8660c6dbccecdfb","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Juyotal/rcm-copilot/commits/af53dd586ae452a1487efe9ec8660c6dbccecdfb"}],"sha":"2098818e6b3077b36d427dc55a517661ae136d56","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Juyotal/rcm-copilot/commits/2098818e6b3077b36d427dc55a517661ae136d56"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/82684537?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Juyotal/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Juyotal/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Juyotal/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Juyotal/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Juyotal","id":82684537,"login":"Juyotal","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgyNjg0NTM3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Juyotal/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Juyotal/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Juyotal/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Juyotal/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Juyotal/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Juyotal","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Juyotal/rcm-copilot/commits/af53dd586ae452a1487efe9ec8660c6dbccecdfb/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-02-12T14:11:00Z","email":"cesarkamga3@gmail.com","name":"madaocesar"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-02-12T14:11:00Z","email":"cesarkamga3@gmail.com","name":"madaocesar"},"message":"feat(llm): redis cache for completions and embeddings\n\nCache key derivation hashes (messages, model, temperature,\nresponse_format) plus an optional extra_key so callers can namespace\nby tenant or scenario without colliding. Embeddings hash on (text,\nmodel) only and are stored without a TTL since they''re deterministic.\n\nLLMCache stays a thin async wrapper that JSON-serializes payloads;\nthe gateway owns what to cache and for how long.","tree":{"sha":"c80d6d02306d8252ebbea077588e8973db232ccc","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Juyotal/rcm-copilot/git/trees/c80d6d02306d8252ebbea077588e8973db232ccc"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Juyotal/rcm-copilot/git/commits/af53dd586ae452a1487efe9ec8660c6dbccecdfb","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/82684537?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Juyotal/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Juyotal/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Juyotal/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Juyotal/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Juyotal","id":82684537,"login":"Juyotal","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgyNjg0NTM3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Juyotal/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Juyotal/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Juyotal/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Juyotal/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Juyotal/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Juyotal","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Juyotal/rcm-copilot/commit/af53dd586ae452a1487efe9ec8660c6dbccecdfb","node_id":"C_kwDOSHpbGdoAKGFmNTNkZDU4NmFlNDUyYTE0ODdlZmU5ZWM4NjYwYzZkYmNjZWNkZmI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Juyotal/rcm-copilot/commit/48b4662e8ed8db7bc7483bc210d1c1812503c132","sha":"48b4662e8ed8db7bc7483bc210d1c1812503c132","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Juyotal/rcm-copilot/commits/48b4662e8ed8db7bc7483bc210d1c1812503c132"}],"sha":"af53dd586ae452a1487efe9ec8660c6dbccecdfb","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Juyotal/rcm-copilot/commits/af53dd586ae452a1487efe9ec8660c6dbccecdfb"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/82684537?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Juyotal/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Juyotal/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Juyotal/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Juyotal/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Juyotal","id":82684537,"login":"Juyotal","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgyNjg0NTM3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Juyotal/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Juyotal/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Juyotal/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Juyotal/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Juyotal/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Juyotal","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Juyotal/rcm-copilot/commits/48b4662e8ed8db7bc7483bc210d1c1812503c132/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-02-11T20:34:00Z","email":"cesarkamga3@gmail.com","name":"madaocesar"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-02-11T20:34:00Z","email":"cesarkamga3@gmail.com","name":"madaocesar"},"message":"feat(llm): provider abstraction with anthropic and openai impls\n\nDefine BaseLLMProvider as the only seam between the gateway and any\nvendor SDK, and ship two concrete implementations behind it.\n\nBoth providers translate vendor-specific errors into ProviderError /\nProviderTimeoutError so the gateway can drive retry and fallback off\na single exception hierarchy. The Anthropic impl folds system messages\ninto the dedicated `system` parameter and emulates JSON mode via a\nnudge, since the SDK has no strict json_object equivalent today.\n\nEmbeddings live on the same interface but the Anthropic side raises:\nthey have no first-party embeddings API, so callers route through the\nOpenAI provider.","tree":{"sha":"a4e223ee4c03f852c67057124f401fc56d4b48fa","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Juyotal/rcm-copilot/git/trees/a4e223ee4c03f852c670571