github.com/users/kadurodrigues/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kadurodrigues/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kadurodrigues","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kadurodrigues/my-portfolio/commits/dfd2b1cc4ae55a25293c7ff4fb97e016362ff7cf/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-22T12:29:32Z","email":"carlos.rodrigues.silva@outlook.com","name":"Carlos Rodrigues"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-22T12:29:32Z","email":"carlos.rodrigues.silva@outlook.com","name":"Carlos Rodrigues"},"message":"Redesign site with editorial voice\n\nRebuild the portfolio around an editorial/magazine direction: Sentient\ndisplay serif paired with Geist Sans/Mono, a considered OKLCH token\nsystem, and a light-first theme with a polished dark mode. Every page\nand shared chrome is rewritten against the new vocabulary, and the\nlegacy utility-driven styles are retired.\n\nDesign system\n- Introduce OKLCH semantic tokens (--ink, --ink-muted, --rule, --paper,\n  --surface-sunken, --ink-blue) and motion primitives (exponential\n  easing, enter durations).\n- Self-host Sentient (Regular / Medium / MediumItalic) and establish\n  .display-accent (italic blue pull-word) as the single recurring\n  editorial gesture across every page.\n- Retire 11 legacy component classes and ~10 orphan tokens no pages\n  reference, plus the Tailwind gray dark-mode override block.\n\nPages and chrome\n- Rewrite Home, About, Experience, Design System, Micro-frontends,\n  Articles and Contact as editorial compositions (meta-lines, numbered\n  chapters, em-dash bullets, italic accents, typographic nav).\n- Rework Header and Footer to use semantic tokens only; replace the\n  pill-shaped theme toggle with a bare glyph and the hamburger with a\n  \"Menu / Close\" mono word label. Fix a side-stripe mobile-nav\n  violation.\n- Delete orphan Card.tsx and HighlightBox.tsx.\n\nMetadata\n- Update title to \"Carlos Rodrigues · Frontend Engineer\", add meta\n  description, canonical link, Open Graph / Twitter card tags pointing\n  at caedu.dev, and a generated 1200x630 editorial og-image.png.\n- Replace the default Vercel favicon with an italic CR monogram in\n  --ink-blue, matching the header logo and social card.\n- Exclude AGENTS.md and .impeccable.md from version control.\n\nMade-with: Cursor","tree":{"sha":"934d5c08263fac93aaaa4467dc72b76bb7310b47","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kadurodrigues/my-portfolio/git/trees/934d5c08263fac93aaaa4467dc72b76bb7310b47"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kadurodrigues/my-portfolio/git/commits/dfd2b1cc4ae55a25293c7ff4fb97e016362ff7cf","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4370657?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kadurodrigues/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kadurodrigues/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kadurodrigues/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kadurodrigues/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/kadurodrigues","id":4370657,"login":"kadurodrigues","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQzNzA2NTc=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kadurodrigues/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kadurodrigues/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kadurodrigues/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kadurodrigues/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kadurodrigues/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kadurodrigues","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/kadurodrigues/my-portfolio/commit/dfd2b1cc4ae55a25293c7ff4fb97e016362ff7cf","node_id":"C_kwDOSHtYltoAKGRmZDJiMWNjNGFlNTVhMjUyOTNjN2ZmNGZiOTdlMDE2MzYyZmY3Y2Y","parents":[