chou"},"message":"Add spatial nearest-neighbor index and recommendation services\n\n- Implemented SpatialCandidateIndex for efficient POI candidate expansion using haversine distance.\n- Created latest_model_adapter for loading and managing recommendation models.\n- Added model_config for managing configuration settings via environment variables.\n- Developed recommendation_service to handle user recommendations, integrating spatial and semantic rerankers.\n- Introduced SpatialReranker and SemanticReranker classes for reranking candidates based on spatial and semantic criteria.\n- Established methods for loading and normalizing prediction rows.","tree":{"sha":"d52fe9dc52f7d94d674050f02128fe0ccd998a0a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chengruchou/WhereNext/git/trees/d52fe9dc52f7d94d674050f02128fe0ccd998a0a"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chengruchou/WhereNext/git/commits/5941faabbed292d23c5de1c7564f225dcbb63e34","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/167217679?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chengruchou/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chengruchou/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chengruchou/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chengruchou/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/chengruchou","id":167217679,"login":"chengruchou","node_id":"U_kgDOCfeKDw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chengruchou/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chengruchou/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chengruchou/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chengruchou/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chengruchou/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/chengruchou","user_view_