/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/chengruchou","id":167217679,"login":"chengruchou","node_id":"U_kgDOCfeKDw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chengruchou/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chengruchou/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chengruchou/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chengruchou/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chengruchou/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/chengruchou","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chengruchou/WhereNext/commits/0b4ed4578d9334d1de70c394d2e5d39c594835ad/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-20T15:27:12Z","email":"chengruchou@gmail.com","name":"chengruchou"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-20T15:27:12Z","email":"chengruchou@gmail.com","name":"chengruchou"},"message":"feat: add semantic reranking module for POI recommendations\n\n- Introduced a new semantic reranking package to enhance inference-time POI recommendations.\n- Implemented configuration settings for the semantic reranker, including weights for different semantic views.\n- Developed a mock semantic embedder for deterministic embedding generation.\n- Created a weighted fusion mechanism to combine multiple semantic view embeddings.\n- Built prompt construction functions to generate semantic views based on POI metadata.\n- Implemented the reranking logic to combine SBR scores with semantic similarity for improved candidate ranking.\n- Added utility functions for handling semantic data processing and normalization.\n- Established typed schemas for structured data flow within the semantic reranking process.","tree":{"sha":"7707220a9ab135e7656c57d17bda305fed70b01a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chengruchou/WhereNext/git/trees/7707220a9ab135e7656c57d17bda305fed70b01a"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chengrucho