now the student-facing starting point. The full reference\nsolution (host/catalog/account remotes, shared packages, Terraform,\nper-app pipelines) lives on the ''reference'' branch.\n\nRemoved from main:\n- apps/host, apps/catalog, apps/account\n- packages/{types,ui,config}\n- infra/\n- .github/workflows/{host,catalog,account,pr-checks}.yml\n- .claude/launch.json (was for local debug only)\n\nKept on main:\n- apps/monolith (the starting state)\n- .github/workflows/monolith.yml + _reusable-build-deploy.yml as\n  the deploy pattern students replicate for each remote\n- README.md, STUDENT_TASK.md, architecture.md\n\nAdjusted root package.json to drop dev:host/dev:catalog/dev:account/\ndev:all scripts. Regenerated pnpm-lock.yaml without the removed\nworkspace packages. STUDENT_TASK.md no longer claims the path-based\nCI triggers and Terraform are pre-scaffolded.","tree":{"sha":"6af52c506d73081e3169e4d7e471ee47f37b7d80","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dima-tolmachev/mf-infra/git/trees/6af52c506d73081e3169e4d7e471ee47f37b7d80"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dima-tolmachev/mf-infra/git/commits/45281f0df70418ae9e93a407b63dd96ebbd36e58","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/34914134?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dima-tolmachev/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dima-tolmachev/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dima-tolmachev/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dima-tolmachev/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/dima-tolmachev","id":34914134,"login":"dima-tolmachev","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM0OTE0MTM0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dima-tolmachev/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dima-tolmachev/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dima-tolmachev/re