155ba80b9354edcb9b19b012979a7fdc3ef7/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-20T21:43:32Z","email":"dima.tolmachev@outlook.com","name":"Dima Tolmachev"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-20T21:43:32Z","email":"dima.tolmachev@outlook.com","name":"Dima Tolmachev"},"message":"Fix monolith white screen: inline process.env via DefinePlugin\n\nWebpack 5 doesn''t polyfill `process` in the browser. Header (via\ngetFeatureFlags) and Footer read process.env.* at render time and\nthrew ReferenceError, which React caught and blanked the tree.\n\nAdd DefinePlugin to monolith webpack config so APP_VERSION and the\nthree FEATURE_* flags compile to string literals (or `undefined`\nwhen unset, preserving readBool''s fallback branch).\n\nAlso scaffold .claude/launch.json for the Preview tool.","tree":{"sha":"64d4fbb8ca103c7c02a96fd95c22d562d180ec81","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dima-tolmachev/mf-infra/git/trees/64d4fbb8ca103c7c02a96fd95c22d562d180ec81"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dima-tolmachev/mf-infra/git/commits/f01e155ba80b9354edcb9b19b012979a7fdc3ef7","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/34914134?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dima-tolmachev/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dima-tolmachev/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dima-tolmachev/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dima-tolmachev/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/dima-tolmachev","id":34914134,"login":"dima-tolmachev","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM0OTE0MTM0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dima-tolmachev/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dima-tolmachev/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dima-tolmachev/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dima-tolmachev/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dima-tolmachev/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/dima-tolmachev","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/dima-tolmachev/mf-infra/commit/f01e155ba80b9354edcb9b19b012979a7fdc3ef7","node_id":"C_kwDOSIC7ldoAKGYwMWUxNTViYTgwYjkzNTRlZGNiOWIxOWIwMTI5NzlhN2ZkYzNlZjc","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/dima-tolmachev/mf-infra/commit/2835db544add45db26aaf958b57f5c495cdd95e0","sha":"2835db544add45db26aaf958b57f5c495cdd95e0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dima-tolmachev/mf-infra/commits/2835db544add45db26aaf958b57f5c495cdd95e0"}],"sha":"f01e155ba80b9354edcb9b19b012979a7fdc3ef7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dima-tolmachev/mf-infra/commits/f01e155ba80b9354edcb9b19b012979a7fdc3ef7"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/34914134?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dima-tolmachev/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dima-tolmachev/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dima-tolmachev/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dima-tolmachev/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/dima-tolmachev","id":34914134,"login":"dima-tolmachev","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM0OTE0MTM0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dima-tolmachev/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dima-tolmachev/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dima-tolmachev/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dima-tolmachev/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dima-tolmachev/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/dima-tolmachev","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dima-tolmachev/mf-infra/commits/2835db544add45db26aaf958b57f5c495cdd95e0/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-20T21:39:45Z","email":"dima.tolmachev@outlook.com","name":"Dima Tolmachev"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-20T21:39:45Z","email":"dima.tolmachev@outlook.com","name":"Dima Tolmachev"},"message":"Fix ts-loader: override noEmit:false in app tsconfigs\n\ntsconfig.base.json sets noEmit:true (correct default for tsc typecheck\nruns), but ts-loader respects it and refuses to emit output, which\nwebpack then reports as ''TypeScript emitted no output''. Each app\ntsconfig now overrides noEmit:false so ts-loader can emit.","tree":{"sha":"d62e26ca51292c0d9cffd700d1cb2a284d2acce1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dima-tolmachev/mf-infra/git/trees/d62e26ca51292c0d9cffd700d1cb2a284d2acce1"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dima-tolmachev/mf-infra/git/commits/2835db544add45db26aaf958b57f5c495cdd95e0","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/34914134?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dima-tolmachev/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dima-tolmachev/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dima-tolmachev/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dima-tolmachev/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/dima-tolmachev","id":34914134,"login":"dima-tolmachev","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM0OTE0MTM0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dima-tolmachev/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dima-tolmachev/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dima-tolmachev/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dima-tolmachev/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dima-tolmachev/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/dima-tolmachev","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/dima-tolmachev/mf-infra/commit/2835db544add45db26aaf958b57f5c495cdd95e0","node_id":"C_kwDOSIC7ldoAKDI4MzVkYjU0NGFkZDQ1ZGIyNmFhZjk1OGI1N2Y1YzQ5NWNkZDk1ZTA","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/dima-tolmachev/mf-infra/commit/08a29655fee5882de88adb6e29353267d2078c8d","sha":"08a29655fee5882de88adb6e29353267d2078c8d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dima-tolmachev/mf-infra/commits/08a29655fee5882de88adb6e29353267d2078c8d"}],"sha":"2835db544add45db26aaf958b57f5c495cdd95e0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dima-tolmachev/mf-infra/commits/2835db544add45db26aaf958b57f5c495cdd95e0"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/34914134?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dima-tolmachev/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dima-tolmachev/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dima-tolmachev/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dima-tolmachev/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/dima-tolmachev","id":34914134,"login":"dima-tolmachev","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM0OTE0MTM0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dima-tolmachev/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dima-tolmachev/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dima-tolmachev/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dima-tolmachev/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dima-tolmachev/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/dima-tolmachev","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dima-tolmachev/mf-infra/commits/08a29655fee5882de88adb6e29353267d2078c8d/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-20T21:35:14Z","email":"dima.tolmachev@outlook.com","name":"Dima Tolmachev"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-20T21:35:14Z","email":"dima.tolmachev@outlook.com","name":"Dima Tolmachev"},"message":"Fix ts-loader build: exclude tests from tsconfig, drop MENTOR_NOTES refs\n\n- Exclude *.test.ts(x) from app tsconfigs so ts-loader doesn''t fail\n  webpack emit on unrelated test-only strict-mode errors.\n- cart-store.test.ts: use optional chaining for noUncheckedIndexedAccess.\n- Remove dangling references to MENTOR_NOTES.md (file not part of repo).","tree":{"sha":"6b29f7a2e3bfbc5a4688ee16045f20e901640c5d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dima-tolmachev/mf-infra/git/trees/6b29f7a2e3bfbc5a4688ee16045f20e901640c5d"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dima-tolmachev/mf-infra/git/commits/08a29655fee5882de88adb6e29353267d2078c8d","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/34914134?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dima-tolmachev/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dima-tolmachev/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dima-tolmachev/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dima-tolmachev/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/dima-tolmachev","id":34914134,"login":"dima-tolmachev","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM0OTE0MTM0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dima-tolmachev/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dima-tolmachev/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dima-tolmachev/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dima-tolmachev/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dima-tolmachev/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/dima-tolmachev","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/dima-tolmachev/mf-infra/commit/08a29655fee5882de88adb6e29353267d2078c8d","node_id":"C_kwDOSIC7ldoAKDA4YTI5NjU1ZmVlNTg4MmRlODhhZGI2ZTI5MzUzMjY3ZDIwNzhjOGQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/dima-tolmachev/mf-infra/commit/b7113