items and invoices\n\nInsert 12 healthy-chef menu items with variants and 8 invoices\nspanning 8 Indian customers, mixed GST rates (5%, 12%), and both\ndiscount types (percentage and absolute). Totals computed via\ncalculateInvoice; invoice numbers via nextInvoiceNumber so the\nnumbering sequence matches production. Default run is idempotent\n(skips when data exists); --fresh wipes and reinserts.\n\nUsage:\n  npm run seed --workspace=server\n  npm run seed:fresh --workspace=server\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"90a206e07ca2ca70603d2459ee73160d0f8a6dc4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/LEKKALAGANESH/healthy-chef/git/trees/90a206e07ca2ca70603d2459ee73160d0f8a6dc4"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/LEKKALAGANESH/healthy-chef/git/commits/8050d23f349947ae989adf0628431c7a916c19e7","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/121800894?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LEKKALAGANESH/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LEKKALAGANESH/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LEKKALAGANESH/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LEKKALAGANESH/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/LEKKALAGANESH","id":121800894,"login":"LEKKALAGANESH","node_id":"U_kgDOB0KIvg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LEKKALAGANESH/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LEKKALAGANESH/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LEKKALAGANESH/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LEKKALAGANESH/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LEKKALAGANESH/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/LEKKALAGANESH","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/LEKKALAGANESH/