: notifications page, real unread counts, and logout\n\n- Notifications: full in-app page (desktop + mobile) replacing the bell\n  popover. Real messages + friend requests (Accept/Decline wired to\n  backend); mock security/system/archive cards matching the design.\n- Conversations: server-backed unread badge, latest-message time, and\n  sort by most recent activity; mark-read on open via the read endpoint.\n- Logout: sidebar button + the missing /api/auth/logout BFF route.\n- Set up Mantine theme + Tailwind tokens in mfe-chat and ship styles in\n  the federated chunk so they apply inside the shell host.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"b98f7b01569e009b18ce7a0506bfc8b7637a458c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/LiamMai/chat-app-microfrontend/git/trees/b98f7b01569e009b18ce7a0506bfc8b7637a458c"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/LiamMai/chat-app-microfrontend/git/commits/4b92dd498686e0fc334d763887d93899672c0b20","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/135251201?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LiamMai/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LiamMai/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LiamMai/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LiamMai/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/LiamMai","id":135251201,"login":"LiamMai","node_id":"U_kgDOCA_FAQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LiamMai/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LiamMai/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LiamMai/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LiamMai/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LiamMai/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/LiamMai","user_view